window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001: My Spiritual Saint Guard (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4001: My Spiritual Saint Guard (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Aren’t you a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord?” Jing Bao stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “A Level-9 Spiritual Overlord? I’m not one anymore.” Jing Bao looked as if he knew what was going on.","Meanwhile, the other two guards were also staring at him in astonishment.","Jing Jia, the second best guard said, “You were a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord before you went in with the lord because you said you wanted to become a","Spiritual Saint. How could you...”","The Spiritual Saint stage!","Although a Level-I Spiritual Saint and a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord were only one level apart, the difference was like heaven and earth!","“How did you do it? Why did you make a breakthrough?” Jing Bao pressed.","Feng Wu already had a plan. Hence, she put on an innocent face and said, “I... I didn’t do it. How could I possibly do it...” Jing Bao asked again, “How did you do it, then?!”","Feng Wu said, “Well... that...’","Jing Bao bellowed, “Speak!”","Feng Wu said, “Actually, I really have to thank Lord Jing. If he hadn’t prepared so many spiritual liquid and spiritual stones, or if he hadn’t taught me in person, I might not become a Spiritual Saint for the rest of my life. I’ll stay loyal to him forever...”","Jing Bao only heard the first half of what Feng Wu said.","“Why is Lord Jing so nice to you? Why did he prepare so much spiritual liquid for you? And why did he give you instructions himself?” Jing Bao stared at Feng wu.","Lord Jing had never given him any instructions when he made his breakthrough, nor had he provided him with any spiritual liquid!","Jing Bao couldn’t stand it anymore.","That was Feng Wu’s plan. She wanted to make Jing Bao feel mistreated.","Most people had similar feelings.","They wouldn’t have thought much of it if Lord Jing hadn’t given anyone the spiritual liquid, but Feng Wu was playing Jing Wei, who had gained Lord Jing’s favor. Moreover...","She looked so innocent and matter-of-fact, which only made Jing Bao angrier.","Feng Wu knew how resentful Jing Bao felt, for she knew that he had spent all the wealth he had accumulated over the years to become a Spiritual Saint. Moreover, he had owed a lot of money.","He wanted to find an explanation that he could accept.","But Feng Wu was doing it on purpose to upset him, and he wasn’t going to get what he wanted.","She was here to stir up trouble.","Feng Wu looked perfectly innocent. “Debt? No, I don’t have any. Lord Jing told me to relax and work on my cultivation. If I have a chance to make a breakthrough, he’ll help me.”","Jing Bao clenched his fists in frustration.","Feng Wu sighed. “I’ve absorbed all the spiritual liquid in the secret room of Lord Jing’s study. Captain, I’m afraid you’ll have to prepare more for me.” Jing Bao was astonished.","He had extracted the liquid from the spiritual stones himself and had to work for a whole year to finish it, but...","“You’ve used it all?!”","Feng Wu said guiltily, “That’s right. I’m so sorry...”","Jing Bao’s face turned livid. He threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and smirked. “If that’s the case, I’d like to see how capable you are now that you’ve absorbed so much spiritual essence! Bring it on!”","The third best guard had also risen to the Spiritual Saint stage, and Jing Bao still needed to demonstrate his ability.."]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002: My Spiritual Saint Guard (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4002: My Spiritual Saint Guard (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu looked terrified and waved her hands repeatedly. “Of course, you’re the best. You’re the best.”","However, the look on her face infuriated Jing Bao again.","The captain said angrily, “Shut up and fight me!”","Feng Wu waved her hands repeatedly. “No, of course not. I’m not your match.”","Without another word, the captain struck down at Feng Wu.","Thump!","They exchanged blows.","“Captain, please forgive him...” Jing Jia had always been on friendly terms with Jing Bao. He felt that even if Jing Wei had become a Spiritual Saint, he had only just become one. There was no way that he could be as capable as the captain of the guards.","He tried to plead for mercy, but the captain stumbled back before he could finish.","However, Jing Wei remained on his spot.","Shocked, Jing Bao stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “Jing Wei, you...”","Feng Wu’s aim now was to enrage Jing Bao, so she put on an innocent face. “I... I didn’t mean to...","Jing Bao was furious!","“Again!”","As he spoke, he drew out the sword on his back.","Feng Wu waved her hands in a hurry. “Don’t get serious. You really can’t...’","However, Feng Wu still drew out her sword in the end.","Jing Bao sword was soon broken.","The two onlookers were speechless.","Of conrqe_ he wouldn’t give in _ hilt he also knew that Ting Wei was already more","capable than him. Damn it!","“Just wait and see!”","Sensing that he had lost his authority, he pointed at Feng Wu and stormed off after that.","Jing Guo glanced at Feng Wu and quickly followed the captain.","Meanwhile, Jing Jia looked at Feng Wu in astonishment. “You... you’ve already surpassed the captain?”","Feng Wu shrugged, pretending that she didn’t know what was going on either.","“I don’t know why this is happening. I think it’s all thanks to Lord Jing.” The captain, who had yet to leave Feng Wu’s sight, was so angry that he almost fainted.","“Captain...” Jing Guo looked concerned.","Jing Bao couldn’t take it anymore. “Why? Why did that happen? He’s a guard, but so am I! I’m the captain of the guards! Why did Lord Jing only give him pointers, and why was he the only one getting the liquid?","“And there’s more to it. It’s not as simple as it seems!","“Lord Jing is only a Level-I Spiritual Saint. What can he possibly teach? Can he make someone more capable than him?","“So, Lord Jing must have given Jing Wei something precious!”","He was filled with resentment toward Lord Jing.","Normally, he wouldn’t do this. Even if he wanted to vent his anger on the lord, he would do it when no one was around. However, Feng Wu had really pissed him off this time.","He had no idea that Feng Wu was doing this on purpose. Feng Wu had everything under control, and he would be furious if he knew that.","“I won’t accept this!” Jing Bao clenched his fists.","Jing Guo wouldn’t accept it either.","Jing Wei used to be the weakest of the four guards. Although Jing Guo was the fourth, he was slightly more capable than Jing Wei. He had defeated the latter in the previous competition.","But Lord Jing was so biased now!"]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003: Jin Tianyi the Young Prince (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4003: Jin Tianyi the Young Prince (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jing Bao glanced at Jing Guo. “You’re much more capable and talented than Jing Wei. If you can use that pool of liquid, you’ll be more accomplished and capable than Jing Wei, but Lord Jing only favors Jing Wei!” Jing Guo clenched his fists and was filled with hatred. Jing Bao still wouldn’t let it drop. “I’ll go to reason with Lord Jing!” “I’m coming with you.” Jing Guo quickly followed her.","The captain wasn’t so direct when he met Lord Jing. He was more tactful.","Lord Jing said, “Really? Do you mean Jing Wei? Haha, he’s a good kid. He’s talented and has a good temperament. As the captain of the guards, you have to treat him well. Don’t pick on him. Got it?”","The captain was speechless.","Lord Jing asked, “Anything else?”","Despite his resentment, the captain shook his head.","Lord Jing waved at them. “Alright. You can leave now.”","Jing Bao and Jing Guo left the room, closing the door behind them.","Jing Guo was the younger one and couldn’t control his temper. “I can tell that Lord Jing is biased toward him!”","Jing Bao remained silent with a livid face.","“Boss, Lord Jing is completely on his side now, and he’s as capable as you are. Your position as the captain...” Jing Guo glanced at Jing Bao as he spoke.","Jing Bao glared at him, and Jing Guo immediately stopped talking.","Jing Bao went back to his room and wrote a letter.","What Jing Bao didn’t know was that Jing Wei already knew his secret, but he didn’t dare to tell anyone before.","Feng Wu used the truth serum, and Jing Wei revealed everything. As it turned out, the captain of the guards was a pawn that the king had put in Lord Jing’s residence.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu...","She left the courtyard and pretended to take a walk. Soon, she ran into Jing Tianyi, Lord Jing’s son.","He was the only son of Lord Jing, so of course, Lord Jing doted on him. Hence, he gave his son a name that meant he was at the top of the world.","Needless to say, Feng Wu had learned about Jing Tianyi from Jing Wei.","No one knew what Feng Wu was going to do in Donglin City.","No one knew how much trouble the Dongsang Kingdom would have because of the girl.","Right now, the teenage girl was walking around the manor in disguise as a capable guard of the Jing Manor.","A colorful bird was flying in the sky. Needless to say, it was Little Phoenix.","“Get me my bow! Now!”","Under the moonlight, a chubby seven-year-old was shouting in excitement.","When he was playing in the garden, a bird pecked at him! Not only that, but it had also peed on his head.","“Ahhh!!!”","Infuriated, Jing Tianyi shouted, “Shoot the bird down! Now!”","The young prince had four guards with him. Although they weren’t Spiritual Saints, they were still peak Spiritual Overlords.","That was to say, the Dongsang Kingdom had more capable cultivators than the Junwu Empire.","One of them ran back to find the young prince’s bow, while the other three went to catch Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix was as capable as they were.."]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004: Jing Tianyi the Young Prince (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4004: Jing Tianyi the Young Prince (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It had been there when Feng Wu became a Spiritual Saint, and it was so close that it could make the breakthrough at any moment.","It had been cultivated in seclusion to make a breakthrough, but Feng Wu had brought it here to play the part.","“Catch it! Now!”","Jing Tianyi stomped his foot anxiously, and his round body looked like a ball.","Lord Jing doted on the boy and would do anything to please his son. He would spare no effort to provide him with the best things in the world.","Hence, the four guards didn’t dare to defy the young lord’s order. They all tried their best to catch Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix led the three guards around the manor as if it were playing hide and seek.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t do anything. She hid in the dark, for it was a very important part of her plan. Jing Bao, the captain of the guards, and Jing Tianyi, the younger prince were her pawns.","Little Phoenix flew around in circles and soon arrived at Jing Bao’s courtyard.","Just then, Little Phoenix spotted a white pigeon and flew in that direction.","“You sure know where you’re going!” Grabbing his bow, the young prince tried to shoot the bird.","Little Phoenix flew away, but the white pigeon was hit.","The arrow pierced through the pigeon, and it was dead before it hit the ground.","The young prince didn’t even look at the pigeon. He was going to chase Little Phoenix, but to his surprise, the bird with the colorful tail was gone.","“It’s gone? How?! Why is it gone? Did I give it permission?!”","The young prince shouted arrogantly.","“Find it! Everyone! Find this bird, or I’ll kill you!” the young prince said angrily.","Just then, the young prince’s favorite guard picked up the pigeon.","“Wait!” He cried out. “My Lord, that’s a messenger pigeon! And it has a letter tube tied to its leg.”","After that, he handed the bamboo tube to the young prince.","He was so excited because this discovery might atone for his crime.","The young prince was a child and could be easily distracted. So, if they changed the subject, maybe the younger prince would...","But the young prince wasn’t in the mood now. He said angrily, “What pigeon? I don’t need a pigeon!”","Yang Fu smiled bitterly. “My Lord, your father is the only one in this manor who can send a messenger pigeon. What if it’s an emergency...”","The young prince frowned. Looking up, he saw that the colorful bird was indeed gone, so he said angrily, “Then prepare another pigeon and send this letter! Why bother me with such a petty thing? You’re useless!”","He turned to leave after that.","Yang Fu smiled bitterly. “But... but the pigeon is dead, and we don’t know where it’s going.”","“This is so annoying!” The young prince waved his chubby hand and said, ‘Give it to me. Let me see what it says. I’ll know where to send it after I read it.” Yang Fu said, “But if your father knows about this, I’m afraid...’","The young prince threw a dirty look at him. “I’m my father’s only son. He’s not going to kill me..”"]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005: Jing Tianyi the Young Prince (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4005: Jing Tianyi the Young Prince (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yang Fu didn’t know what to say, so he handed the letter to the young prince.","The young prince impatiently opened the letter, unfolded it, and casually glanced through it.","One look and he was dumbfounded.","Rubbing his eyes, he looked again and saw that the handwriting hadn’t changed. That was to say, he wasn’t seeing things!","“My lord?”","“My lord?”","The guards reminded him in a low voice.","Jing Tianyi looked up at a manor a short distance away, and his face darkened. The next moment, he waved his hand and said, “That’s enough. Let’s go back.","“Take this pigeon away and clean this place!","“No one is to know that I killed a pigeon today. Got it?!”","The young prince wasn’t a complete idiot. When he straightened his face, he still looked very authoritative.","“Yes.”","The guards exchanged looks of bewilderment. It seemed that something had really happened.","Meanwhile, the young prince ran off to find Lord Jing.","No one knew what the father and son were talking about in the room, but one thing was for sure: Lord Jing was furious that night.","After that, Lord Jing patted his son on the shoulder. “Kiddo, I’ve underestimated you. Good job.”","This was the first time that his father had complimented him like this, and Jing Tianyi was over the moon. Clenching his fists, he decided that he would do something else to impress his father.","The following day.","“Come with me.”","Lord Jing pointed at Feng Wu and said indifferently.","“Yes,” Feng Wu said in a hurry.","There were four guards in total, but he only mentioned Jing Wei’s name.","Feng Wu stole a glance at Jing Bao, the captain of the guards. As expected, he was so angry that he had clenched his fists.","Feng Wu noticed that Lord Jing also glanced at Jing Bao out of the corner of his eye, but his face didn’t betray anything.","As expected of the merciless Lord Jing. He didn’t even bat an eyelash.","After leaving the manor, Lord Jing took Feng Wu to the crown prince’s residence.","“His Royal Highness is cultivating and won’t see anyone. My Lord, please leave.”","After entering the crown prince’s residence, Lord Jing couldn’t see Night Owl. Instead, he saw Gong Ming, Night Owl’s personal guard.","Just like Jun Linyuan, Night Owl, the crown prince, was also living outside the palace.","Feng Wu wondered if the Dongsang King trusted his son as much as Emperor Wu trusted Jun Linyuan.","When the crown prince left the imperial palace to build his own residence, it was very likely that the crown prince would become allies with the officials, which would weaken the king’s authority.","After all, the king was old, but the courtiers were all ambitious.","Night Owl’s senior guard used to be Xiao, but unfortunately, Jun Linyuan killed him in the battle of Northern Yan.",".Therefore, Night Owl had to find a new senior guard","Lord Jing frowned a little. “His Royal Highness hasn’t come out of seclusion yet? He must have been doing it for a while.”","Gong Ming didn’t say a word because he was usually an aloof figure. Lord Jing frowned again. “Do you know when he’ll come out?”","Gong Ming shook his head. “His Royal Highness didn’t leave a message. He only said that no one was to disturb him. He’s cultivating a... formidable technique. ”","Lord Jing asked, “A formidable skill? From the Dayan Empire? Has he met any of them?”","Gong Ming shook his head. “No.”","Lord Jing rubbed his chin and was lost in his thoughts. What kind of formidable skill was it? Where did it come from?","Standing in the manor, Feng Wu looked as calm as ever, but deep down..."]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006: Who’s Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 4006: Who’s Man","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was already surprised.","So, this was Night Owl’s manor. He had built a manor outside the palace as well. Did the Dongsang King trust him as well?","What was going on with his unparalleled skill?","To Feng Wu, Night Owl had always been an unlucky person.","Whether it was the explosion when he held Jun Linyuan in his arms or the fact that she had made him bedridden, Feng Wu found the crown prince to be rather unlucky. But what was that unparalleled technique about?","Just then, footsteps came from inside.","Hearing footsteps, Lord Jing, who had been sipping tea in his armchair, rose to his feet and looked in the direction of the door. As expected...","“Your Royal Highness!” Lord Jing said cheerfully.","Night Owl smiled when he saw Lord Jing. “Uncle, you seem to know that I’m out of seclusion today. Have you been waiting for me?”","Seeing Night Owl’s smile, Lord Jing knew that Night Owl had made a breakthrough.","“Who can predict that? But I’m indeed very lucky.” Feng Wu stood next to Lord Jing and listened attentively.","Wait...","The more Feng Wu listened, the more uneasy she felt.","According to Jing Wei, the relationship between Lord Jing and Night Owl was only so-so in front of outsiders. However, from their private interaction, Feng Wu could tell that they were very close.","However, it was probably because Jing Wei wasn’t qualified enough, and Jing Bao had been following Lord Jing around.","If that was the case, Feng Wu’s plan would be much easier to carry out.","She was going to play a big game here in Dongsang City. Lord Jing, Night Owl, and the king of the Dongsang Kingdom would all be her pawns.","The Dongsang Kingdom was like a chessboard, but she was only a guard. It was almost an impossible game.","However, Feng Wu was very confident in her plan.","Just then, Lord Jing asked Night Owl about the so-called peerless skill.","Feng Wu pricked up her ears.","“Speaking of which...” Night Owl had only just started talking when he spotted","Feng Wu. He frowned. “Is Jing Bao not here today?”","Hearing Jing Bao’s name, Lord Jing’s face darkened.","Night Owl frowned. “What happened?”","Lord Jing smacked the table and said angrily, “Do you know who Jing Bao works for?”","Night Owl paled a little.","Lord Jing used to take Jing Bao with him when he came here, and Jing Bao had heard everything they said.","“Leave us.” Lord Jing glanced at Feng Wu.","Although she had left, Little Phoenix was still there.","Because Little Phoenix could turn invisible, it was sitting in a chair opposite the two men and watching them curiously. It was broadcasting the whole thing to Feng Wu.","“Jing Bao? Who’s he working for?” Night Owl gritted his teeth. It seemed that Jing Bao wasn’t on Lord Jing’s side.","Lord Jing pointed at the sky.","“His Majesty? My father?!” Night Owl jumped to his feet.","Lord Jing sighed inwardly and nodded.","“His Majesty’s man? Since when did he become His Majesty’s man? What about our conversation...” Night Owl put his hands behind his back and paced around the room anxiously.."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007: The Arrogant Princess (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4007: The Arrogant Princess (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Jing softened a little and said, “Luckily, I didn’t tell him about our secret. We’ve only been seeing each other a little. It’s not a big deal.”","Night Owl stared at him. “Are you sure?”","Lord Jing said, “My lord, His Majesty has allowed you to have an independent residence because he trusts you. Don’t panic.”","Night Owl calmed down and nodded. “That’s right.”","Lord Jing changed the subject. “By the way, what’s that amazing skill you talked about? Have you succeeded?”","Night Owl gloated at the mention of that. “Who do you think I am? How can I fail?”","Lord Jing said, “So, it’s...”","Night Owl didn’t dare to say anything. It was an indescribable pain, but the advancement had indeed made him much more confident.","Night Owl said, “Don’t ask. By the way, how’s the war going?”","Lord Jing shook his head and told him about Patriarch Huyan’s participation in the battle.","Night Owl frowned. “Why would he join the war? Does he have connections with the Junwu Empire? Why would he help them?”","Lord Jing shook his head and was equally confused. “The Patriarch said that he only did it because a young friend asked for his help, and the deadline is three months. We’ll do it after that, and he won’t interfere.”","Night Owl asked, “Are you sure?”","Lord Jing said, “I heard it with my own ears.”","Night nodded. “If that’s the case, it’s doable. As for this young friend... Uncle, who do you think it is?” Lord Jing said, “Jun Linyuan?”","Night Owl’s face turned livid.","Lord Jing smiled bitterly. “I don’t want it to be him, but apart from him, I don’t think there’s anyone else in this world that can do such a thing.”","Night Owl smirked. “So what if Patriarch Huyan thinks highly of him? I’ll kill him in three months!”","Lord Jing was curious. ‘Your current skill..","Night Owl said, “I’ll surpass him in three months. Don’t worry!” Just then, they heard a voice outside. It was Gong Ming.","“Princess Yan Ling is here to see you.”","The fact that Princess Yan Ling was here to see him was proof enough of her status.","Moreover, before Night Owl could say anything, a pleasant voice rang out. “This room is crowded. What’s going on here?”","Princess Yan Ling sat down opposite them and played with a red fruit in her hand.","She didn’t seem to think much of the two influential figures of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t blame her because his master was Ma Quanquan, who worked for Yan Ling’s family","Lord Jing smiled. “Princess Yan Ling, I didn’t expect to see you here. Sorry for not greeting you earlier.”","Night Owl had known Princess Yan Ling since they were little.","Although communication between the two continents was very difficult, Princess Yan Ling had begged Ma Quanquan to bring her here when she was little. She had grown up with Night Owl, but the crown prince didn’t like Princess Yan Ling very much.","Because when Princess Yan Ling looked at them...","To be more precise, Princess Yan Ling looked down upon everyone on this continent in a condescending manner.","Night Owl frowned at the thought of that attitude.","And she was doing it again.."]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008: The Arrogant Princess (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4008: The Arrogant Princess (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Lord Jing before looking at Night Owl again.","“What? Does the crown prince have a problem with me? Am I not welcome here?” Princess Yan Ling said indifferently, but there was no warmth in her eyes.","Lord Jing glanced at Night Owl.","Night Owl was furious, but he still smiled coldly.","“Of course not. It’s my honor.”","“Good. Otherwise, I would have thought that I was an unwelcome guest.”","Princess Yan Ling chuckled. “By the way, what were you talking about?”","Lord Jing immediately said, “Nothing. We were just talking about His Royal","Highness’ phenomenal success.”","“A phenomenal success?” Princess Yan Ling was intrigued. Rising to her feet, she walked around Night Owl and asked, “What is it? Are you very capable Night ????????????????? said, “It’s nothing. I’m just a little better than you.”","Crossing her hands behind her back, Princess Yan Ling gave Night Owl a half-smile. “Night Owl, why do I feel that you have something against me?”","Night Owl said indifferently, “Of course not.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “I don’t think you’ll dare either.”","Night Owl was furious.","Princess Yan Ling suddenly raised her voice and stared at him. “Night Owl, didn’t you tell me that you were the most capable man of your generation? You lied to me!”","Night Owl’s face darkened.","Lord Jing intervened. “Princess, you’re making fun of us. His Royal Highness is indeed the best of the younger generation.”","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Lord Jing. “That’s a claim that’s only true in the Dongsang Kingdom, isn’t it? I’ve been walking around outside, and they all told me that the king of your continent’s younger generation is a teenager named","Jun Linyuan.”","Night Owl’s face darkened.","Princess Yan Ling sneered at Night Owl. “Is Jun Linyuan really more capable than you?”","Outside, Feng Wu felt embarrassed for Night Owl.","Princess Yan Ling had to be here to upset Night Owl, right?","As expected, Night Owl’s breathing quickened, and he was obviously angry.","Lord Jing tried to make peace again.","He smiled bitterly. “Jun Linyuan is indeed a talented cultivator, but His Royal Highness is as capable as he is. I think they’re about the same level.”","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Is that so?”","Lord Jing immediately said, “Princess, you’ll be able to see with your own eyes if Jun Linyuan or the crown prince is more capable in the final battle three months later.’","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Night Owl and said, “Don’t think that I don’t know what your father is thinking. He wants me to marry you.","“But Night Owl, the man I want to marry has to be the strongest.","“Even if he’s not the most capable cultivator of the Dayan Empire, he has to be the most capable young man on this continent.","“If you can’t even defeat Jun Linyuan, you’re not qualified to marry me!”","Night Owl had had enough of this condescending attitude. He smirked and said, “You can marry whomever you want. Do you think I want to marry you?!” That was the wrong thing to say.","Princess Yan Ling wasn’t provoked. She only stared at Night Owl and suddenly smiled. “Don’t tell me you think that without the Dayan Empire’s help, the","Dongsang Kingdom could have suppressed the Junwu Empire all these years..”"]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009: The Arrogant Princess (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4009: The Arrogant Princess (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You!” Night Owl glared at Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “What did I do? Did I say something wrong?”","Lord Jing intervened. “That’s enough. Stop quarreling.”","He grabbed Night Owl’s arm.","Night Owl was obviously displeased.","Princess Yan Ling sneered at him. “Lord Jing, am I wrong?","Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t be happy. He was from the Dongsang Kingdom.","Princess Yan Ling was humiliating the Dongsang Kingdom, which was the same as humiliating him.","However, Lord Jing could only smile obsequiously. “Princess Yan Ling, you’re right. If it hadn’t been for the help of the empire, the Dongsang Kingdom would have...”","Seeing that Lord Jing had given in, Princess Yan Ling softened a little. She glanced at Night Owl and said arrogantly, “You have to admit it, even if you don’t want to!”","Night Owl was furious, but Lord Jing stepped on his foot and silenced him.","Seeing this, Princess Yan Ling was even more pleased.","Lord Jing immediately changed the subject. “Princess, why are you here today?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Can’t I come here when I don’t have anything to do?” Lord Jing smiled bitterly. “Of course. Princess, you can come whenever you want.”","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Lord Jing as she played with the fruit. “Why do I feel that you can make decisions for the crown prince’s residence?”","Lord Jing was vexed. Princess Yan Ling was so disrespectful!","But Princess Yan Ling was the ambassador of the empire, and he didn’t dare to offend her.","“Princess, you’re making fun of me.” Lord Jing could only laugh it off and hoped that Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t talk about it anymore.","But Princess Yan Ling didn’t seem to mind at all. She smiled and said, “Actually, His Royal Highness lets his emotions show too easily, and he’s too childish. I don’t quite trust him when we work together.”","Night Owl was going to lose his temper again, but Lord Jing was already in front of him. This time, Lord Jing didn’t try to laugh it off because he realized that even so, Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t stop.","Lord Jing said indifferently, “Princess, please show some respect to the","Dongsang Kingdom.”","Humiliating the crown prince was the same as humiliating the Dongsang Kingdom.","Little Phoenix showed Feng Wu the live feed.","“They’re so boring. I don’t want to listen to them. I want to sleep and cultivate.” Little Phoenix yawned and wanted to come out.","It had been coveting Feng Wu’s cultivation level for a long time. All it needed to do now was to sleep and cultivate, and it would reach the Spiritual Saint stage in time. Therefore, it wanted to go back to its ring space.","Because of Feng Wu’s request, it had to stay awake and take care of all the chores.","However, Feng Wu sensed something from Princess Yan Ling’s tone.","She immediately communicated with Little Phoenix in her head.","“No, please don’t! Just stay a little longer! Just a little longer!","“I promise I won’t keep you from your cultivation anymore.","“Please! You’re the smartest and wisest Master Phoenix in the universe!”","Little Phoenix was so pleased with Feng Wu’s flattery that it only said proudly,","“Fine, fine. Since you’ve begged me, I’ll stay a little longer. Just a little longer.”","Feng Wu said, “Yes!”","To Feng Wu’s surprise, Princess Yan Ling..."]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010: Night Owl’s Story (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4010: Night Owl’s Story (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","To Feng Wu’s surprise, Princess Yan Ling was going to reveal such a big secret.","Princess Yan Ling smiled at Lord Jing and said indifferently, “I’m not showing the Dongsang Kingdom any respect? Hahaha! You’re the king’s only brother, and you’re the one who’s not showing the Dongsang Kingdom any respect!” Lord Jing blanched, and his face darkened again.","“Princess, what do you mean?” Lord Jing narrowed his eyes and gave her a warning look.","Wait, he was angry!","Little Phoenix, who had been dozing off, scrambled to its feet and looked from one face to another.","Unfortunately, Lord Jing and the others didn’t know that Feng Wu had a mouthpiece in the room.","Princess Yan Ling wasn’t threatened at all and grinned. “What do you mean? Lord Jing, you know better than I do, don’t you? Are you afraid to admit it?” “Princess Yan Ling!” Lord Jing tried to stop her.","Unfortunately, he had underestimated the princess’s sense of superiority.","Princess Yan Ling grinned at Night Owl. “Don’t tell me you don’t know that.”","Night Owl had a dangerous look in his eyes. Princess Yan Ling took the hint right away. “So, you do know.”","Both Lord Jing and Night Owl stared at her.","Lord Jing asked coldly, “Princess, what do you know? Please don’t hesitate to tell me.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “If that’s what you want, I’ll tell you.”","Princess Yan Ling grinned at Night Owl. As she ate her fruit, she turned to look at Lord Jing. “Why do I feel that His Royal Highness looks a little like you?”","Instantly, the air seemed to freeze.","Little Phoenix was dumbfounded. It took it a while to tell Feng Wu what it had heard.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded... What was that supposed to mean?","Her imagination began to run wild.","Meanwhile, Princess Yan Ling was grinning at Lord Jing. “Why do I feel that the two of you look a lot alike?”","Lord Jing’s eyes flickered, but he didn’t let it show. “Princess, you’re so funny.”","Princess Yan Ling smiled. “I don’t tell jokes.”","Lord Jing was speechless.","Night Owl stared at Princess Yan Ling. “Are you done talking? Get lost!”","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Your Royal Highness, are you chasing me away?” Night Owl snorted.","Princess Yan Ling chuckled. “If you still don’t understand what I mean, I haven’t told you enough.”","Lord Jing said, “That’s enough, Princess. I don’t want to hear such things from other people again.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Well... it’s negotiable. The two of you really look alike and have the same temperament. You’re both so grumpy.”","Lord Jing was speechless.","Night Owl fell silent.","Princess Yan Ling waved at them. “Fine, fine. If you don’t want to listen to me, I’ll go to someone who will.”","She rose to her feet and turned to leave after that.","“Where are you going?!” Night Owl blocked her way.","Princess Yan Ling grinned at him. “To court, of course. I’ll talk to Her Majesty.","Maybe His Majesty will listen to me if he’s here..”"]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011: Night Owl’s Story (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4011: Night Owl’s Story (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Stop!” Lord Jing’s cold voice rang out behind Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling could sense the murderous intention, but she wasn’t intimidated at all. Instead, she was very competitive.","How dare the Dongsang Kingdom threaten her?!","Princess Yan Ling turned around and sneered at Lord Jing. “What? Do you want to silence me?”","Lord Jing and Night Owl blocked her way.","Both of them kept their silence and stared at Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling suddenly chuckled. “Do you really think that I’ve walked into this manor all by myself and said all those things in front of you without leaving any backup plans for myself?” “Uncle Ma,” said Princess Yan Ling.","“Yes.”","Ma Quanquan’s voice came from the roof.","Lord Jing and Night Owl’s faces turned livid.","Ma Quanquan was Lord Jing’s master, but that relationship was only a scheme against the Dongsang Kingdom.","Princess Yan Ling smiled at him. “So, do you think you and the queen are the only ones who know what you did?","“Why do you think the queen gave birth to him?","“Do you think the Dongsang King wouldn’t suspect anything if Dayan hadn’t been here to clean up your mess?","Lord Jing felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","Night Owl’s face turned livid as well.","Seeing this, Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Lord Jing, don’t you see? You’re a dog of the empire, and the crown prince you’re talking about is no more than a puppy!”","Smack!","Night Owl slapped Princess Yan Ling hard.","It happened so fast that Lord Jing didn’t have time to react.","“You!” Princess Yan Ling glared at Night Owl. “How dare you hit me?! ” The next second, Ma Quanquan was behind her.","“Uncle Ma, kill him!” Princess Yan Ling wanted to kill Night Owl.","Although Ma Quanquan didn’t do anything, the murderous look on his face was very intense.","Taking a deep breath, Lord Jing fought back his rage. He went up to Ma Quanquan and knelt down on one knee. “Master, please spare my son’s life.”","His son... He had admitted it!","Feng Wu was astonished when she heard it from Little Phoenix.","It was true!","She wasn’t imagining things, but it was the truth!","The crown prince of the Dongsang Kingdom wasn’t the Dongsang King’s son!","Ma Quanquan said indifferently, “This is the last time.”","Lord Jing said, “Yes.”","He grabbed Night Owl and forced him to kneel.","Princess Yan Ling snorted. “If you hadn’t been useful, you would all be dead by now! But Uncle Ma, slap him.”","Ma Quanquan was an employee of Lord Yan’s residence, so of course, he would follow Princess Yan Ling’s order. He struck out with his palm.","Pffft!","Night Owl fell back and smashed into the wall. He slumped to the ground and no one knew if he was still alive.","Lord Jing was worried sick.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “I’m only going to teach him a little lesson. If he dares to offend me again, it won’t end so well!”","Lord Jing wanted to throttle Princess Yan Ling, but he still looked grateful.."]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012: Night Owl’s Story (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4012: Night Owl’s Story (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling waved him off. “That’s enough. I’m not here to kill you. I just want to make a deal with you. I didn’t expect Night Owl to be so reckless. How frustrating!”","She turned to leave after that.","“Princess, what do you want to talk about?” Lord Jing’s voice came from behind her.","“Are you going to take the throne or not?” asked Princess Yan Ling.","Lord Jin’s pupils contracted. Princess Yan Ling, on the other hand, had left after throwing the bomb.","After she left, Lord Jing quickly went to Night Owl’s side and checked his pulse.","Outside, Feng Wu was overwhelmed with excitement.","She had thought that she was only here to meet Night Owl, but as it turned out, Princess Yan Ling had given her such an important piece of information.","With that information, Feng Wu had a lot of room to maneuver!","Instantly, Feng Wu was so excited that her cheeks flushed.","Therefore, when Princess Yan Ling walked out of the room, she saw that Feng Wu was lost in her thoughts.","“Who are you?”","Princess Yan Ling looked at Feng Wu and asked curiously, “Have I seen you before?”","Feng Wu immediately feigned a respectful tone and said to Princess Yan Ling,","“I’m a guard of Lord Jing. I’m sure you’ve met me before.”","Rubbing her chin, Princess Yan Ling suddenly stared at Feng Wu. “But why do I feel that it’s more than that?”","Feng Wu looked nervous and didn’t answer.","Princess Yan Ling suddenly smiled. “You’re very handsome.” Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Do you want to work for me?”","Feng Wu vented her sarcasm inwardly. What was wrong with this princess? Why did she suddenly become her target? She didn’t think Jing Wei was that good-looking.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I’m Lord Jing’s guard, and I’ll do as he says.”","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Feng Wu and snorted. “Even you won’t show me any respect? Huh?”","Just then, a man walked in. It was Mr. Sakiya, whom Feng Wu had defeated.","That was mainly because of the ethos of Dayan.","Not only did the empire worship the capable cultivators, but they also worshiped the wise ones.","Princess Yan Ling recognized Sakiya’s wisdom, so she sounded much more respectful.","“What are you doing here?” Princess Yan Ling asked curiously.","Mr. Sakiya knew Princess Yan Ling as well, so he said, “I heard that His Royal","Highness had come out of his seclusion, so I came here to have a look.”","Princess Yan Ling suddenly smiled. “I think he should stay in seclusion for a bit longer.”","She left after that.","“Master?” Bu Jingyu, Mr. Sakiya’s pupil, frowned and asked, ‘Why did Princess","Yan Ling look so pleased?”","Sakiya threw a dirty look at him.","Bu Jingyu cringed and didn’t dare to speak.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief when she saw Princess Yan Ling leave. But she still couldn’t figure out why Princess Yan Ling had her eyes on her all of a sudden.","Mr. Sakiya was the one who answered her question.","He glanced at her before turning to Bu Jingyu. “Don’t underestimate this princess. She may not be the most capable cultivator, but she has a special ability..”"]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013: Blackmail","paragraphs":["Chapter 4013: Blackmail","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“She can smell treasures.” Sakiya didn’t stop talking when he walked past Feng Wu with Bu Jingyu. “If someone has a treasure that catches her eye, she’ll have her eyes on it and won’t let go of it. Therefore, stay away from that princess.","Got it?”","Bu Jingyu nodded. “Yes, master. I’ll remember that.”","Sakiya left Bu Jingyu behind, and Gong Ming showed him in.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was lost in her thoughts.","Sakiya must have seen how Princess Yan Ling had pressed the guard. Was he giving Jing Wei a hint when he talked to Bu Jingyu?","Princess Yan Ling could smell treasures, and Feng Wu had quite a few on her.","Although a lot of things had been stored in the ring, Feng Wu was still wearing the soft armor Jun Linyuan gave her.","She also had some pills with her.","Feng Wu moved all the things in her ring space.","She was even more alarmed by Princess Yan Ling.","Sakiya frowned when he saw Night Owl. “What happened to His Royal","Highness?”","Of course, Lord Jing couldn’t tell Mr. Sakiya what had happened because if he did, he wouldn’t be able to keep Night Owl’s secret.","Sakiya was only loyal to the Dongsang King, and he would definitely protect the royal bloodline. Therefore, Night Owl wouldn’t be the crown prince anymore if the secret got out.","Hence, Lord Jing and Night Owl exchanged looks and tried to cover it up. Mr. Sakiva was smart enough to see that something was off. but he also saw that the two men were keeping things from him. He didn’t let it show and only replied indifferently.","Night Owl cleared his throat. “Mr. Sakiya, may I ask why you’re here today?”","He coughed as he spoke and picked up his teacup.","He wanted Sakiya to leave.","Sakiya smiled bitterly, but he said, “I heard that the Junwu Empire and our kingdom are going to have a major battle in three months. Is that true?","Night Owl looked at Lord Jing.","Lord Jing said, “Hasn’t His Majesty told you?”","Sakiya nodded. “His Majesty has said so, but Lord Jing, you’ve experienced it in person, so I thought I should ask you.”","Hence, Lord Jing told Mr. Sakiya about the visit of Patriarch Huyan. After that, Lord Jing said, “Jun Linyuan is so well-respected that even Patriarch Huyan would help him.”","Mr. Sakiya shook his head. “The young friend that Patriarch Huyan mentioned may not be Jun Linyuan.”","“Is that so?”","Night Owl and Lord Jing looked at Sakiya in unison.","Mr. Sakiya nodded. “I have a suspect.”","“Who is she?”","“Feng wu.”","Lord Jing didn’t know much about Feng Wu. To be more precise, he didn’t remember Feng Wu at all.","Night Owl knew who Feng Wu was because Feng Wu had tricked him more than once. She was the reason that he had been bedridden for so long.","“Little Feng Wu?” Night Owl frowned at Sakiya. ‘Why do you think it’s her? Do you have any proof?”","Sakiya said, “The method of elimination.","“Have you heard about Jun Linyuan’s battle in the Northern Yan Kingdom?” Night Owl and Lord Jing nodded.","Night Owl said, “I thought it was Jun Linyuan because I saw him fighting in","Northern Yan..”"]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014: Who’s the Young Friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 4014: Who’s the Young Friend","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mr. Sakiya said, “If Patriarch Huyan really is Jun Linyuan’s friend, why didn’t he intervene in such a dangerous situation? Jun Linyuan was almost killed.” Night Owl frowned.","Mr. Sakiya said, “Your Royal Highness, you saw the battle. I had a water screen as well and recorded it.”","He took a crystal ball out of his sleeve as he spoke.","“Unfortunately, the recording in this crystal ball can only be played once. Take a closer look.” With a wave of his hand, Mr. Sakiya projected the battle between Jun Linyuan and the others onto the white wall.","Meanwhile, Little Phoenix also told Feng Wu what happened inside.","Feng Wu was surprised.","It was no wonder that the Dongsang Kingdom was said to be more advanced than other kingdoms on this continent. They had such a screen that could see the battle of the Northern Yan Kingdom from so far away.","If Night Owl could see it. so could Mr- Sakivm What about the Dongsang King?","At that thought, Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. She told Little Phoenix to keep an eye on it for her, and she couldn’t miss any of their conversation.","Little Phoenix had been playing cute and slacking off, but now that it was serious, it was very considerate. It was already eavesdropping.","“Look, this is where Jun Linyuan’s life was hanging in the balance.”","Sakiya pointed at the screen. “If Patriarch Huyan really is his friend, he would have intervened by then. But he’s not there. Look here.”","The screen showed the VIP seat.","“It’s common knowledge that this giant eagle is the only spiritual pet that can get close to Patriarch Huyan. Let’s see who it sits next to.”","He paused the recording..","It was Feng Wu.","Not only was Feng Wu sitting next to the eagle, but she was also whispering to it. In the end, Feng Wu said something to the eagle, and it began to fly toward the tower.","“Look at Feng Wu’s interaction with the eagle.","“The giant eagle is so proud that even princes and princesses have to fawn on it, but it’s so familiar with Feng Wu.","“Keep watching, and you’ll see that the giant eagle and Jun Linyuan haven’t interacted at all.","“So, do you see it now? Feng Wu is the one who’s on friendly terms with Patriarch Huyan”","Mr. Saloua couldn’t believe his ears as he explained. It was that girl.","Lord Jing was astonished. Night Owl clenched his fists. “It’s her!”","Sakiya nodded. “It’s her.”","Night Owl gritted his teeth and murmured, “Why is she so popular? How did she gain Patriarch Huyan’s favor? Three months? Even Patriarch Huyan has to pay a high price to resist the empire for three months. Why did Feng Wu make him do such a thing?”","A hush fell over the crowd, for everyone found it unbelievable.","“You’ve been picked,” Little Phoenix said sympathetically. “They’ve deduced that you’re the young friend of Patriarch Huyan. You’re in a lot of trouble.”","Feng Wu was a little frustrated as well. Has she risen too high and become too outstanding? Why did other people always pick on her?"]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015: Marry Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4015: Marry Feng Wu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Who would have known that the Dongsang Kingdom had such surveillance? That was so scary.","But it also made Feng Wu much more alarmed.","She had to be extra careful in the Dongsang Kingdom. Only in that way, would she be safer.","“If that’s the case, what do you think I should do?” Night Owl stared at Sakiya. Sakiya said, “If that little Feng Wu is so capable, why don’t we save her life?”","“Is that so?”","Mr. Sakiya said, “Since Dayan has set its eyes on Junwu, the latter is bound to fall, and everyone there will die. If that’s the case, Your Royal Highness, why don’t you marry that Feng Wu?”","“They said they wanted Night Owl to marry you!” Little Phoenix screamed in","Feng Wu’s head.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. “Listen carefully!”","Little Phoenix said, ‘Yes!”","It was a little sleepy at first, but these people really knew how to wake it up. The bombs kept coming.","Needless to say, Lord Jing was shocked. Night Owl, on the other...","He looked pleasantly surprised. “Do you want me to marry that girl?”","Sakiya nodded. “Saving a life is better than building a seven-story pagoda. Your Royal Highness can save her life.”","Night Owl said, “Well, I can consider it.”","Lord Jing frowned and was about to say something when Night Owl asked, “But will she agree?”","Sakiya said, “The Junwu Empire has learned about the sanctions Dayan put on them, and they’re bound to fall into chaos. If we tell them that marriage can bring peace, that girl will have to accept it for the greater good.”","“Is Patriarch Huyan going to agree?” Night Owl was concerned.","Sakiya said, “Patriarch Huyan may have helped her once, but he may not do it again. Moreover, if Feng Wu wants to marry willingly, he has no reason to object. He knows that the Junwu Empire is going to be wiped out. He’s on friendly terms with Feng Wu, so of course, he wants her to get out of this mess. Maybe he’ll be the first to agree.”","Night Owl was elated.","Lord Jing frowned. “Your Royal Highness, have you forgotten? His Majesty wants you to marry Princess Yan Ling.”","Night Owl’s face turned livid when he heard the name. “Who wants to marry that princess?”","Lord Jing said, “If you marry Princess Yan Ling, Dayan will support you, and Your Royal Highness’s position will be secured. What do you think?”","Night Owl didn’t know what to do.","Sakiya said, “There’s a solution.”","Night Owl asked, “Really?”","Sakiya said, “If His Royal Highness takes the throne, he can’t dote on just one woman. Even the princess of Dayan can’t interfere.” Night Owl clapped his hands. “Alright! We’ll do as you say!”","Sakiya said, “I’ll start working on it, then.”","Night Owl nodded. “As soon as possible! I need to save that girl!”","After Mr. Sakiya left, Lord Jing looked at Night Owl in resignation. “Your Royal Highness, this isn’t the time for romance. Do you know what’s more important?”","Night Owl said, “Of course, I do! The throne is the most important thing! If other people know who my father is, everything will be gone! That’s what you’re going to tell me, isn’t it?","Lord Jing stared at him. “Princess Yan Ling already knows about it..”"]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016: Smart as Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 4016: Smart as Feng Wu","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Owl said, “Her purpose is to work with us, isn’t it? So, let’s talk to her.”","What Night Owl didn’t know was that Princess Yan Ling wasn’t that easy to talk to.","When Lord Jing went to see Princess Yan Ling, she said unhurriedly, “Negotiate? Of course, we can do that. But before that, sign this first.” Taking a look at the paper on the table, Lord Jing frowned.","It said that from now on, Lord Jing and Night Owl had to follow her orders. If they defied her, she would reveal Night Owl’s secret.","Even Lord Jing, who had been indulging Princess Yan Ling, lost his temper. He glared at the princess. “That’s an exorbitant price!” Princess Yan Ling said arrogantly, “You don’t say.”","Look at that condescending attitude...","Lord Jing felt that he was only a dog in front of her. In this world where the strong were respected, the princess was only a Spiritual Overlord, but she was so arrogant!","He was also a respected lord of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Lord Jing’s face was livid as he said coldly, “Princess, that’s not a negotiation, is","Princess Yan Ling glanced at him. “Negotiate? Who cares about that? Are we negotiating? Don’t you know who has the upper hand?”","She rose to her feet.","“I’m here on behalf of Dayan.","“We have talented people as well as ancient technologies.","“Now that I know your secret, if it gets out, you’re all dead!","“Do you think Night Owl is the only prince the kingdom has? The king has at least thirty sons, and there will be more in the future.","“Do you believe that I can destroy your son and you with a single sentence?","“You don’t want to sign it? Let’s see what’ll happen!”","Lord Jing’s face went scarlet red.","Princess Yan Ling sneered at him. “I see that you’re not sincere enough today. Come to me when you show your sincerity. Uncle Ma, see him out.”","She threatened Lord Jing with Ma Quanquan again.","Ma Quanquan, the peak Spiritual Saint, was the person that Jin Wang feared the most when facing Princess Yan Ling.","As Lord Jing stormed off, Princess Yan Ling smirked at her maid. “They’re just some dogs raised by my father. Who the hell do they think they are? Tsk!”","She didn’t raise her voice, but Lord Jing could hear her.","Lord Jing clenched his fists, and his face turned livid.","That was outrageous!","After Lord Jing left, Ma Quanquan frowned at Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, don’t overdo it.”","Princess Yan Ling glared at Ma Quanquan.","If I don’t show them some power, they’ll try to be my superior! Who do they think they are?!”","Ma Quanquan had no choice but to try his best to persuade her. “Princess, our priority is more important.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “I know. I won’t sabotage it.”","In Lord Jing’s study.","Thump!","Infuriated, Lord Jing swept everything off the table, and his face went scarlet red.","Lady Jing arrived in a hurry to find the mess.","It was the same as yesterday...","She asked what was going on.","Lord Jing gestured at her to leave.","“My dear husband...” Lady Jing said sadly, “You used to tell me everything. Are you keeping everything to yourself now?”","Lord Jing was so frustrated as he looked at his wife. He let her serve the wine and drank with her.","Lord Jing had been drinking nonstop. In the end, he had gone pale.","Lady Jing was about to put him to bed when Lord Jing suddenly asked, “What will you do if someone threatens you?”","Lady Jing looked at him. “Has someone threatened you?”","Lord Jing shouted, “What will you do if someone threatens you?!” Lady Jing clenched her fists and said, “No one should be threatened.","“If I compromise when threatened, I’ll be no different from a rat hiding in a ditch.","“You think the person threatening you will stop when the opportunity arises, but to that person, all they need to do is threaten you once and they’ll get what they want. Why not do it again? You’re afraid of them, anyway.","“Hiding in the shadows isn’t real life at all!","“My lord, you’re too proud to be threatened!”","Lord Jing’s eyes lit up. “My lady, do you think so as well?”","Lady Jing nodded. “Of course!”","“What do you think I should do?”","“Get rid of the threat, of course. Make sure that there’s no trace left behind!” Lady Jing clenched her fists.","“You’re right!” Lord Jing smacked the table. “Not only did she threaten me, but she also treated me like a dog! Does she think she’s that amazing?!”","Lady Jing asked curiously, “Who is she?”","Those words woke Lord Jing up from his reverie. “You can leave now.”","After Lady Jing excused herself, she left the study and went to a remote corner. She removed the makeup cream and revealed her true appearance. It was none other than Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew that after what he had gone through, Lord Jing would drown his sorrows in wine when he got back home. Therefore, she put something in the wine, then disguised herself as Lady Jing and led him in that direction.","To Feng Wu, both Lord Jing and Princess Yan Ling were important chess pieces in the game she was playing.","She had been trying to figure out a way to set off a conflict between Princess Yan Ling and Lord Jing, but as it turned out, the princess was simply too easy a target. Not only did she look down upon Lord Jing and Night Owl, but she also knew their biggest secret and wouldn’t stop threatening them.","Both Lord Jing and Night Owl were proud men, and they couldn’t stand the humiliation.","Therefore, the conflict between the Lord Jing and Princess Yan Ling could lead to friction between the Dongsang Kingdom and the Dayan Empire. It would buy the Junwu Empire a lot of time.","Feng Wu was thrilled at that thought.","Lord Jing had already made up his mind. As his most capable guard, Feng Wu, aka Jing Wei, would definitely be sent out. When that happened...","Feng Wu smiled a little, and there was a cunning look in her eyes.","Lord Jing was a cautious man. He wouldn’t act alone but would consult Night Owl.","But before that...","Lord Jing summoned Feng Wu. “Jing Wei, how have I treated you?”","Feng Wu thought, “Here we go!”","Despite her excitement, she didn’t let it show on her face. She immediately bowed and said, “My lord it was you who helped me to reach the Spiritual Saint stage. You’ve done me a great favor, and I’m all yours now!”","Lord Jing stared at Feng Wu with a stern look on his face. “Do you mean it?”","Feng Wu said earnestly, “Yes, of course.”","Lord Jing nodded and told Feng Wu, “Eat it, then.”","He handed Feng Wu a black pill.","Other people might not recognize it, but Feng Wu recognized it as soon as she smelled it. It was a Bloodthirsty Bone-Destroying Pill, and a Supreme Level one at that. Normal people wouldn’t be able to neutralize it.","Feng Wu was a Semi-divine medicine refiner, so she could make an antidote.","Lord Jing looked at Feng Wu and said indifferently, “Take this pill, and I’ll trust you wholeheartedly. From now on, you’ll be the person I trust the most!”","In fact, only a handful of people in the Jing Manor had become Spiritual Saints.","The Spiritual Saint stage was very rare. Thanks to the fact that Lord Jing was the king’s only brother, he was able to raise a Spiritual Saint subordinate.","In the Junwu Empire, a Spiritual Saint could be the principal of Imperial College.","That was to say, with the help of Dayan, the Dongsang Kingdom was indeed more powerful than the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu took the pill, stuffed it in her mouth, and swallowed it without hesitation!","Lord Jing looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","The more capable a cultivator was, the harder it was to control them. Therefore, Lord Jing had his suspicions about this subordinate from time to time, but he didn’t expect the man to be so obedient..","“Why aren’t you hesitating at all? Aren’t you worried that I’ll feed you the poison?!”","The look on Feng Wu’s face had never been so serious. “My lord, you’ve done me a great favor, and I feel I was born again. I’m at your disposal now, and this pill is nothing. Even if you order me to stab myself right now, I won’t hesitate!”","Feng Wu was an expert in acting. She almost believed it herself, let alone Lord Jing...","“What a fool,” thought Lord Jing.","However, such a fool was much more reliable.","Moreover, the toxin would kill him after he used it, so there was no need for Lord Jing to kill Jing Wei.","The look on Lord Jing’s face was indecipherable, but Feng Wu could see the ferocity in his eyes.","But soon, Lord Jing smiled, patted Feng Wu on the shoulder, and heaved a sigh. “You’re the best guard in this manor. You’re the one I trust the most...”","Feng Wu cursed inwardly.","But she couldn’t let it show, so she kept her face straight.","Lord Jing said, “Of the four guards, I’ve always considered you the most talented and loyal one. I was right. You didn’t disappoint me.”","Feng Wu played along and looked touched.","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “My lord, feel free to order me around! I’ll do anything for you","Lord Jing said, “That won’t be necessary. You only need to kill one person.”","Feng Wu said earnestly, “My lord, please tell me who you want to kill. I’ll go fetch their head and present it to you!”","Lord Jing looked pained. “That person has humiliated me and tried to sabotage my plan. I can’t stand it. That person is Princess Yan Ling!”","Feng Wu looked surprised.","Lord Jing said sternly, “Are you afraid?”","Feng Wu said, “There’s nothing I’m afraid of. I’ll even cut off His Majesty’s head, let alone Princess Yan Ling’s.”","Hearing that, Lord Jing smacked the armrest of his chair. ‘Good! Good! I was right about you!”","“Shall I go now, then?”","Feng Wu turned to leave after that.","“Wait.” Lord Jing shook his head. “We’ll have to think about it. Go get ready.”","“Yes.”","Feng Wu went back to her room, leaving Little Phoenix here as her mouthpiece.","No Lord Jing’s plan could fool her.","Little Phoenix stopped nagging about its cultivation because it knew that they were at a critical moment now, and it needed to play along with Feng Wu.","In Lord Jing’s study.","After Feng Wu left, Lord Jing walked around the room with his hands behind his back.","He murmured, “I have to find a way to lure Ma Quanquan away, and I have to make it look like someone else is the culprit. It won’t be easy. Owl is a smart man, and I need to talk to him about it.”","Little Phoenix then saw Lord Jing open the secret door of the study.","“Wait!” Little Phoenix cried out in amazement. “Oh my, this is incredible!”","Sitting cross-legged in her room, Feng Wu communicated with Little Phoenix in her head. “How so?”","Little Phoenix said excitedly, “Didn’t you go into Lord Jing’s study before? You’ve searched the area, haven’t you?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right.”","Little Phoenix said, “You’ve been in that cultivation room, haven’t you?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Little Phoenix said, “But you don’t know that there’s a secret passageway!”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Little Phoenix said, “Lord Jing is incredible. He really knows how to do it. If we’re not careful, he’ll keep everything from us!”","Little Phoenix told Feng Wu in detail, “The mechanisms in that secret room are deliberately exposed so that if someone found out about it, nothing would happen. However, on the other side, Lord Jing has dug a secret passageway!","“This tunnel is very well-hidden. I wouldn’t have been able to find it if I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes.” Little Phoenix chattered with Feng Wu in excitement. “You don’t say. Lord Jing really knows his stuff.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Where does it lead to?”","Little Phoenix shook its head. “I’m following him now. I’d like to see where this passageway leads to.”","About five minutes later.","“Holy crap!”","Little Phoenix’s surprised voice rang out in Feng Wu’s head. “I finally know where this tunnel leads to.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it Night Owl’s manor?”","Little Phoenix said, “How did you know that?”","Feng Wu said, “I remember Night Owl said that he didn’t want the Dongsang","King to know about his relationship with Lord Jing. However, Lord Jing and","Night Owl are very close, so there should be a secret passageway.”","Little Phoenix said, “Yes. Lord Jing has gone up there and is sitting with Night","Owl in a secret tea room. I think they’re going to discuss how to kill Princess","Yan Ling now.”","Feng Wu said, “Listen carefully, then.”","Little Phoenix said, “Don’t worry. I love to hear other people’s secrets.”","Lord Jin and Night Owl sat opposite each other at the tea table, but they had no idea that a bird was staring at them curiously.","Night Owl asked, “Have you reached an agreement with that lousy princess?”","Lord Jing shook his head and told Night Owl what happened in the princess’s residence.","“Listen to her? Even when I take the throne?” Night Owl smirked. “Does she mean that we’re going to be her servants? Puppets?”","Lord Jin nodded. “But she’ll help you win the throne.”","Night Owl smirked. “I don’t need her help! The throne is mine!”","Lord Jing said, “But His Majesty is still in good health.”","Night Owl clenched his fists and stared at Lord Jing. “I want them dead!”","Lord Jing asked, ‘What?”","Night Owl said, “Can’t we kill Princess Yan Ling and that old bastard?”","Lord Jing suddenly nodded. “It’s doable.”","Night Owl stared at him in disbelief. “What did you say?”","Lord Jing stared at Night Owl. “I think it’s doable.”","Night Owl looked up and let out a breath of relief when he saw that no one was around. He stared at Lord Jing and leaned forward. “You were only joking, weren’t you?”","Lord Jing stared at Night Owl. “What do you think?”","Night Owl was elated.","Growing up, other people only called him smart, and even Mr. Sakiya often praised him. What they didn’t know was that Lord Jing would often come here in the middle of the night to tutor him and teach him a lot of things. That was why he was so smart.","Therefore, to Night Owl, Mr. Sakiya was only sent by the Dongsang Kingdom to keep an eye on him, and Lord Jing was the father he had trusted since he was little.","“Father!”","Night Owl cried out, “So, can we do it? But if Princess Yan Ling dies, won’t Dayan take revenge?”","Lord Jing said, “So, we’re going to kill her with a borrowed knife.","“Princess Yan Ling can die, but it has to be the Dongsang King’s doing. That way, if the Empire of Dayan wants to take revenge, it’ll be targeting that old man. He’ll pay with his own life, and you’ll inherit the throne.","“Therefore, you don’t have to do anything. All you need to do is sit there and wait to inherit the throne.","“When that happens, you can marry whomever you want, and no one can interfere.”","“Yes!” Night Owl nodded. “So, what should we do?”","“How about...’","To other people, they were uncle and nephew, but in fact, they were father and son. They were discussing in low voices.","What they didn’t know was that Feng Wu had heard everything they said.","Feng Wu listened carefully and heard every word.","“So, that’s what Lord Jing is planning...” Feng Wu nodded inwardly. “He’s so malicious. Although, Night Owl was the one who came up with the idea.","However, it was a dog-eat-dog thing, and Feng Wu could just stand there and watch.","Lord Jing only went back after they were done discussing the details.","“Jing Wei.” Lord Jing stared at Feng Wu. “I need you to do something very difficult.”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, my lord.”","Lord Jing enunciated each word.","Feng Wu said, “But Princess Yan Ling has such a capable man with her. I’m afraid...","Lord Jing smirked. “Don’t worry. Someone will stall him! All you need to do is take Princess Yan Ling away. You won’t need to do anything else!”","Feng Wu nodded.","She felt sorry for Princess Yan Ling.","If Princess Yan Ling had listened to Ma Quanquan, Lord Jing’s plan wouldn’t have succeeded.","Lord Jing had been waiting for his chance.","During that time...","Princess Yan Ling flared up again.","“What? He sent someone to the Junwu Empire to propose a marriage? Has he lost his mind?!”","Princess Yan Ling was well-informed and soon learned that Mr. Sakiya had gone to the Junwu Empire. She smirked and said, “Night Owl is nothing! He’s not good enough for me! He doesn’t get to say no!","“He’s just a dog.. Why would I marry him? Don’t make me laugh!","“But why should he fall in love with someone else when I don’t even like him?","“And there’s Feng Wu!”","Princess Yan Ling turned to Ma Quanquan. “Uncle Ma, kill her! ”","Ma Quanquan frowned. “Princess...”","Princess Yan Ling said, “I don’t want to see her alive again! If she’s alive, it’ll affect my mood, and I won’t be able to focus on my cultivation! Uncle Ma, that’s why I haven’t been able to cultivate recently!”","Princess Yan Ling looked into Ma Quanquan’s eyes. “Uncle Ma, please kill her for me and remove her from this world.”","Ma Quanquan frowned. “Princess...”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Uncle Ma, there’s Her Majesty the empress dowager and the imperial princess above me in the Dayan, and my life is so depressing. Can’t I do whatever I want on this continent? Do I have to follow other people’s orders? Uncle...","Ma Quanquan said, “Feng Wu isn’t capable enough, so it’ll be very easy to get rid of her, but that master...","Princess Yan Ling said, “Just lure her out of the imperial capital. I thought that powerful cultivator couldn’t leave the imperial capital. If he could, Huyan wouldn’t have gone to save them! And there’s her family. Apart from Lady Xuanji, kill everyone else.”","Ma Quanquan finally agreed. “Princess, you need to work on your cultivation and reach the Spiritual Saint stage as soon as possible. You’re so close.”","Princess Yan Ling smiled. “Of course! Please wait seven days. I’ll become a Spiritual Saint in seven days!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what was going on with Princess Yan Ling. If she did, Princess Yan Ling would be in a much worse state.","Lord Jing had been waiting for an opportunity, but to his surprise, he received news that Ma Quanquan had left Donglin City.","“Really?!”"]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017: Feng Wu’s Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4017: Feng Wu’s Plan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Is that true?”","Lord Jing was thrilled when he heard the news. He stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu nodded. “It’s true. According to the princess, Senior Ma went to the front line and told her to stay in Donglin City for the time being and not go anywhere else.”","Lord Jinh walked back and forth in excitement.","He couldn’t wait any longer, so he went to Night Owl.","Night Owl was cultivating at the moment. After the breakthrough, he had risen from a Level-2 Spiritual Saint to a Level-4 one.","“Is Ma Quanquan gone?” Night Owl rose to his feet in excitement.","Lord Jing nodded in excitement.","Night Owl said, “Ma Quanquan won’t be gone for too long. He’ll be back in a day. This is our only chance.”","Lord Jing nodded.","Night Owl said, “My father has been showing my second brother favor recently, trying to make him my competitor. If that’s the case, we’ll blame it on him.”","Lord Jing asked, “Not on His Majesty?”","Night Owl said, “Father has too many capable cultivators. Even if all your people join hands, they’ll still be suppressed and won’t have any chance of winning. They’ll only suspect us. When they realize what’s going on, they’ll counterattack. So...’","Night Owl smirked. “We’ll destroy his favorite son. Of course, if this gets out, he’ll be incriminated as well. After all, that’s his favorite son. Only then will he be implicated.”","Lord Jing nodded. “Good.”","What they didn’t know was...","Little Phoenix was recording their conversation with a Spiritual Fossil Stone.","The Spiritual Fossil Stone was very hard to come by. Feng Wu used to have one, but she had used it already and couldn’t use it again.","Luckily, they were in the Dongsang Kingdom.","With the help of Dayan, the Dongsang Kingdom was relatively advanced in technology. Therefore, Night Owl and Lord Jing both had several Spiritual","Fossil Stones in their vaults. The one in Little Phoenix’s hand was found by Feng Wu after she raided Lord Jing’s vault.","He then handed Feng Wu a piece of paper.","Feng Wu opened it to find an address.","35th Court, Donggu Avenue.","“Got it?” Lord Jing stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was at a loss, but she still nodded. “Yes.”","He stared at Feng Wu and said, “This is the second prince’s private residence. After you took Princess Yan Ling away, knock her out and throw her into this manor. Then...","He finally said, “You can leave after that. That’s all you need to do.”","Feng Wu could guess what Lord Jin was going to do, so she nodded and said, “Alright.”","As for Ma Quanquan’s trip to the Junwu Empire, Feng Wu believed that as long as Master Linghu was in the imperial capital, no one would dare to touch her family. Therefore, she wasn’t worried.","While Feng Wu was taking action, so was Lord Jing.","Apart from Jing Wei, he also had secret guards.","However, Feng Wu was so capable now, which was why he had sent her to kidnap Princess Yan Ling. Otherwise, he would have sent his secret guards.","Princess Yan Ling’s current residence was in the most prestigious part of the imperial capital apart from the imperial palace.","The Dongsang King had given her a place to live in the palace, but Princess Yan Ling didn’t like the atmosphere in the palace, so she chose an exquisite manor to live in.","It was more like a garden than a manor.","The courtyard was filled with pavilions, and a stream flowed down the slope. It was quite exquisite.","Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t send Feng Wu alone. He had also sent a team of secret guards to help Feng Wu with the possible trouble.","Feng Wu jumped into the manor and moved as swiftly as a cat. The night watchmen didn’t notice her at all.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up as soon as she set foot inside. So, this garden was covered with formations.","Ma Quanquan must have set it up before he left to protect Princess Yan Ling.","But Ma Quanquan would never expect to meet a formation master like Feng wu.","It only took Feng Wu five minutes to solve the formation. She then quickly moved around the formation until she arrived at a courtyard.","It was a two-story building built against a slope and was surrounded by lush green grass. The cornices were hidden among the trees.","The room was dimly lit by candles.","This was the core of the formation and the safest spot. Therefore, Princess Yanling should be living here.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but slow down when she reached the core.","She Imew that it was the safest place for Princess Yan Ling, but for an intruder like her, it was the most dangerous place.","There were traps everywhere, waiting to cut off the invaders’ heads.","Holding her breath, Feng Wu carefully bypassed the buttons that triggered the mechanisms.","All of a sudden, Feng Wu halted.","When she dodged a button over her head, she stepped on something hard.","That was...","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","If she guessed right, she was stepping on a secret landmine of the Dongsang Kingdom. Once she let go, it would explode.","The explosion alone wouldn’t be able to hurt her, but if all the traps were triggered, Feng Wu would probably die here. Just then, she heard noises a short distance away.","It sounded like two maids.","One was crying, and the other was trying to calm her down.","The crying one said between broken sobs, “The princess is so terrifying... I saw with my own eyes that Xiaodi...”","The one who tried to talk her out of it said, “Stop it! You’ll be decapitated if word gets out!”","The crying one sobbed. “So be it. I don’t want to live anymore. It’s better to die than to have my skin peeled off. Xiaodi was only a little slow in her reaction...”","The other one said in a hurry, “That’s why we have to keep our eyes open from now on. We can’t afford any mistakes!”","The one crying said, “I don’t know how long we’ll live.”","They were getting closer and closer. Soon, they would reach Feng Wu.","She had no choice but to take the risk.","Feng Wu bent down and pressed the dagger on the landmine. Only then did she carefully move to the side.","After that, Feng Wu crouched down and carefully removed the landmine. When she hid in the shadows, she saw two maids coming her way.","Feng Wu noticed that both maids were very pretty, and their skin was so fair that one could almost squeeze water out of it.","“Is the Dongsang Kingdom so good at raising pretty people?” Feng Wu thought to herself.","Feng Wu noticed that each of them was holding a sack, as if they were discarding something big.","Feng Wu only walked out of the shadows after they were gone. She moved as swiftly as a cat.","In the blink of an eye, Feng Wu was outside the window.","However, she would be easily spotted here, so Feng Wu jumped onto the roof without making a sound.","It was frighteningly quiet.","One could hear the sound of the wind.","Feng Wu sniffed, for she could smell blood, which seemed to come from this building.","Sniffing around, Feng Wu soon located the spot where the smell of blood was the strongest. She leaned over the roof, lifted a roof tile, and looked down.","What Feng Wu saw was a shocking red color.","It was the color of blood.","She saw a bath.","The bathtub was supposed to be filled with water, but Feng Wu saw that it was blood red.","It wasn’t dyed red.","It was filled with blood.","The smell of blood was repulsive, but Feng Wu saw that Princess Yan Ling was the only one in the room. She had taken off her clothes, and her skin was glowing.","She slowly walked into the blood pool.","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","There was so much blood in that pool. It had to be hundreds of people’s blood!","Princess Yan Ling was taking a bath in the blood pool?!","Feng Wu saw her lying in the pool with a satisfied smile on her face.","Feng Wu was astonished.","Had Princess Yan Ling been killing hundreds of people every day to fill the bath with her blood so that she could take a bath?","Why did she do that?","Soon, Feng Wu realized that Princess Yan Ling had absorbed all the blood in the pool. There was no trace left.","And Princess Yan Ling’s cultivation level had risen!","Feng Wu noticed that she was about to become a Spiritual Saint.","Princess Yan Ling said coldly, “Double the amount of blood every day from now on!”","A hesitant voice rang out. “Princess, Master Lei said that it’s already very difficult for them to find teenage girls with spiritual essence... It’s already very hard to find the current ones. However, we’ll do our best to send people out. They won’t delay your cultivation.”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Yuexin, you’re so stupid. Why stop at the Dongsang Kingdom? Just expand the circle and go to the other kingdoms, especially the Junwu Empire. If they can raise someone like Feng Wu, they have to have a lot of resources. We don’t need to reason with them! It’s their honor to give their lives to the people of the empire! The emperor will do it anyway, and no one will blame us for it. Just go get it!”","Yuexin said, “...Yes.”","Feng Wu drew in a breath.","And she was going to the Junwu Empire?","Feng Wu took a deep breath. One more day of Princess Yan Ling’s life, and hundreds of teenage girls would die. Her life would be a sin! Yuexin was about to leave when Feng Wu jumped off the roof.","She struck down with her hand.","Yuexin fell to the ground.","Inside, Princess Yan Ling didn’t notice anything. She said coldly, “What kind of a place is this? There’s so little spiritual essence in the blood, which has kept me from reaching the Spiritual Saint stage.","“But my father wouldn’t allow me to practice this amazing skill in Dayan, saying that it’s unorthodox. That was why I had to come here.","“Do they think I like to stay here? Feng Wu, just wait and see! You were the first person to humiliate me!","“Who do you think you are? How dare you fight me? You’re going to die a miserable death!","“Do you know...”","Princess Yan Ling was still venting her frustration when she noticed a figure behind her.","“You!”","When Princess Yan Ling turned around, Feng Wu sprinkled the truth serum at her face, and the princess immediately fell into a trance-like state. Feng Wu threw a dirty look at her and cut to the chase. “What’s your name?”","“Yan Ling.”","“Where are you now?”","“The Dongsang Kingdom...” “Why did you come from Dayan to the Dongsang Kingdom?”","“The blood... cultivation... destroy...”","Something inside Princess Yan Ling seemed to be acting up, stopping her from talking.","“Destroy what?” Feng Wu added more truth serum.","Ordinary people would have turned into idiots by now, but Princess Yan Ling wasn’t just anyone. She could withstand a lot of truth serum.","Even so, it was still too much.","“Destroy the Junwu Empire... All of them...”","Gritting her teeth, Feng Wu crouched down and asked again, “Why do you have to kill everyone in the Junwu Empire?!”","“Because... because... it hurts...","Princess Yan Ling buried her head in her hands and rolled around in the bathtub in pain.","Feng Wu noticed that Princess Yan Ling was giving off blood-red light.","Her face, her arms, and her legs looked like they were going to explode at any moment!","Feng Wu was utterly confused. She had no idea what was going on.","“I can’t tell you... It’s a curse... I can’t tell you...” Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth.","Feng Wu sprinkled the truth serum on Princess Yan Ling’s face again.","She asked again, “Why do you want to kill everyone in the Junwu Empire?","Why?!”","“Because... because Grandpa Ma said... because the altar... turn it into an altar... Ah!” Princess Yanling screamed and fainted.","Feng Wu was lost in her thoughts.","An altar?","What altar?","Feng Wu couldn’t figure it out for the time being, but she decided to ask her sixth or fifth senior brother when she got back. Mavbe thev would know.","As for Princess Yan Ling... Feng Wu hoped that she hadn’t been turned into an idiot.","Feng Wu pulled a sheet over, wrapped it around Princess Yan Ling, and dashed off.","Princess Yan Ling used to be guarded by two top Spiritual Saints, but one of them had left for another country. Ma Quanquan, on the other hand, had been sent away by Princess Yan Ling, which was why Feng Wu could succeed.","Carrying Princess Yan Ling over her shoulder, Feng Wu left the courtyard and headed for the address Lord Jing gave her. It was the second prince’s private residence. 35th Court, Donggu Avenue.","Feng Wu saw that Jing Bao was there to pick her up.","“You’re amazing.” Seeing that Feng Wu had brought Princess Yan Ling back, Jing Bao looked at her in excitement. “I thought you wouldn’t even be able to make it.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “It took me a lot of effort. You’ll be on your own from now on.”","Jing Bao nodded. “Don’t worry. Lord Jing has left instructions. I know what to","“","Feng Wu left as soon as she could, for she had to stay there while Princess Yan Ling was away, so that no one would notice.","Feng Wu didn’t know what Lord Jing did, but she knew that he wouldn’t let her down.."]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018: Missing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4018: Missing","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Two hours later, Feng Wu took Princess Yan Ling back to the building.","Meanwhile, Princess Yan Ling was still unconscious under the curtain.","Feng Wu took Princess Yan Ling back to her room and looked at her indifferently.","If killing Princess Yan Ling would stop Dayan from attacking the Junwu Empire, Feng Wu would do it without hesitation.","But it didn’t work that way.","According to the information she received from Princess Yan Ling, Dayan wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire for the sake of some altar. Although Feng Wu wasn’t sure yet, she knew that it was a strategy that Dayan was bound to carry out. Therefore, killing Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t change anything.","Moreover, the Dongsang Kingdom would only start squabbling if Yan Ling was alive.","Therefore, Princess Yan Ling was more useful alive than dead.","But was she going to let Yan Ling off the hook just like that? Feng Wu smiled. There was a pill in her palm..","The next day, Princess Yan Ling woke up.","She felt as if she had been run over by a mountain and was in so much pain that she wished she were dead. When she saw herself naked and covered in bruises, she bolted up!","What was going on? Princess Yan Ling blanched after examining herself. She was...","Damn it!","Meanwhile, in the crown prince’s residence.","Lord ??? and Ni?ht Owl sat opposite each other.","“It’s all taken care of.” Lord Jing smiled at Night Owl. “Here’s the evidence, Princess Yan Ling and the second prince.”","He then handed the Spiritual Fossil Stone to Night Owl.","Night Owl smacked the table in excitement. “That’s great! With that, she won’t be able to do whatever she wants to us anymore!”","Lord Jing said, “But if she knows about this Spiritual Fossil Stone, she’ll know that we did it.”","Night Owl said, “We can make my second brother the scapegoat.”","Lord Jing asked, ‘What do you mean?”","Night Owl nodded. “I’ll let my brother threaten Princess Yan Ling with it.”","Lord Jing said, “Do you think Princess Yan Ling will kill him on the spot?”","Night Owl said, “That’s why we can’t say it explicitly. Let’s give her a hint. Wasn’t that my brother’s private residence yesterday? Princess Yan Ling is very good at tracking people down. I’m sure she’ll find out where she was last night.","“So, we can blame it on my brother and get rid of him through Princess Yan Ling. In the end, we can say that he gave it to us.” Night Owl smiled.","King Jin said, “Why would he do that? Isn’t he afraid that Princess Yan Ling will take her revenge? What’s his motive? Princess Yan Ling has to be convinced.","Otherwise, she won’t believe it and will suspect us.”","Night Owl smirked. “I’ve thought of a reason already.”","Lord Jing asked, “What is it?”","Night Owl said softly, and Lord Jing’s eyes lit up. He patted Night Owl on the shoulder and said, “My son is so smart!”","After separating from Night Owl, Lord Jing went back to the Jing Manor. When he saw Feng Wu, he raised his eyebrows and thought, “Jing Wei did it himself, so I can’t let him live.”","However, he realized that Jing Wei was going to die from the toxin, so he said,","“I need you to do something for me.”","Feng Wu rose to her feet. “At your command.”","Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t give Jing Wei any task. His top priority now was to get rid of Jing Wei, so that the latter would die from the toxin and turn into a pool of blood.","Therefore, he said indifferently, “Go to the Wang family’s valley 1500 km away and fetch something for me..”"]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019: Change the Location","paragraphs":["Chapter 4019: Change the Location","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu knew perfectly well why Lord Jing had sent her out.","Wang familu’s valley? That was just an excuse.","More importantly, Lord Jing wanted to send her out so that she could die out there.","Feng Wu felt that it was time to get rid of the current disguise, for she still had a lot to do.","At that thought, Feng Wu readily agreed. “Yes.”","After Feng Wu left, Lord Jing turned to another guard.","Two days later.","“My lord, Jing Wei is dead.” Jing Jia came back with the news.","Lord Jing let out a breath of relief.","Finally, that person was out of the picture.","He told ling Wei to take the D0ison, and Ting Wei was such a fool. Lord Jing sighed inwardly and waved at Jing ia. “Good job. I’ll entrust you with the task from now on.”","What he didn’t know was that Feng Wu had snuck up on Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling had a maid, whose name was Yuexin.","Feng Wu was going to pretend to be her, but when she snuck into the manor, she realized that Yuexin was gone.","After asking around, she realized that Yuexin had been killed.","After what happened to Princess Yan Ling, how could Yuexin, her personal maid, still be alive? Even if Princess Yan Ling didn’t suspect her, she would still vent her anger on her. It would be a miracle if she survived.","Feng Wu didn’t want to get too close to Princess Yan Ling either, for according to Sakiya, Princess Yan Ling could smell treasures, and Feng Wu had a lot of treasures on her. Therefore, she wanted to stay out of Yan Ling’s way.","Moreover, Ma Quanquan was a peak Spiritual Saint who was very close to Princess Yan Ling. Therefore, Feng Wu decided to take a detour.","Hence, Feng Wu pretended to be Xingxiang, a third-ranked cleaning maid.","Feng Wu had been hiding here for three days.","She had been mimicking a cleaning maid for the past three days, but no one could tell.","Needless to say, Feng Wu had something to do.","She was going to bring calamity to the Dongsang Kingdom.","Unfortunately, Princess Yan Ling had been severely injured this time and hadn’t left her room for three days. As a result, Feng Wu hadn’t been able to see her.","Without seeing Princess Yan Ling, Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to carry out her plan.","However, Feng Wu wasn’t the type to sit around and wait. With a little trick, the senior maid inside soon had a stomach ache.","“Xingxiang, bring the food box to the princess.” The chief maid pressed the box to Feng Wu’s hands, then rushed off, holding her stomach.","“Yes.”","After the maid left, Feng Wu smiled a little.","Inside, Feng Wu saw that the curtain was lowered, and Princess Yanling was nowhere to be seen. She had to be behind the curtain.","After what happened, Feng Wu felt sorry for Yan Ling as well, but Yan Ling had always been so arrogant and wanted other people dead. It was only an eye for an eye.","Feng Wu was about to leave when Princess Yan Ling suddenly lifted the curtain and stared at her.","“Princess...” Feng Wu feigned a terrified look.","Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu with cold eyes. “Where’s Shijian?” Feng Wu whispered, “Her stomach wasn’t feeling well just then, so...”","“If she’s not here, you come with me!” Princess Yan Ling dashed off after that.","Where were they going?"]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020: The Second Prince (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4020: The Second Prince (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling led the way out, and Feng Wu followed her in a hurry.","Feng Wu had thought that Princess Yan Ling was going to the imperial palace, but she didn’t seem to be heading in the right direction.","Feng Wu noticed that Princess Yan Ling was sniffing as she walked, as if she was searching for some scent.","Feng Wu chuckled inwardly. She knew what Princess Yan Ling was looking for.","After sulking in her room for three days, Princess Yan Ling finally decided to come out and find the truth.","Who had taken her?","Where was she taken?","Who had raped her?","Who was behind this?","Feng Wu knew that Yan Ling would find the second prince’s private residence because she had cut Princess Yan Ling’s arm on purpose when she carried her out, leaving a bloody wound.","Her blood had dropped to the ground along the way. It had been three days, but Princess Yan Ling would be able to find it if she wanted to.","Didn’t Mr. Sakiya say that the princess had a very sharp nose?","As expected, Feng Wu saw Princess Yan Ling sniffing as she walked. In the end, she arrived at a manor.","It was the second prince’s residence.","Princess Yan Ling stood in front of the manor and narrowed her eyes.","She jumped over the wall and entered the courtyard, followed by Feng Wu.","She followed Princess Yan Ling all the way to one of the bedrooms. Princess Yan Ling pushed the door open, walked in, and stared at the bed that had been cleaned.","The bed looked spotless, but Feng Wu noticed that there was a storm brewing in Princess Yan Ling’s eyes.","It was the calmness before a storm!","Suddenly, Princess Yan Ling turned around and stared at Feng Wu. “Find out whose house this is!”","She headed for the door after that.","Feng Wu noticed that Princess Yan Ling had clenched her fists. She had to be furious.","Just then, a maid walked in and shouted at the two of them. “Who are you? Why are you—”","Before she could finish, Princess Yan Ling struck out.","She reached out with her slender arm and grabbed the maid by the neck. The next second, the maid fell to the ground and was dead. Princess Yan Ling said, “I need to know in 15 minutes!”","Feng Wu immediately said, “Yes.”","Princess Yan Ling didn’t notice the smile on Feng Wu’s face after she left.","By now, the web Feng Wu had set up was slowly closing in.","When it was over, Princess Yan Ling, the second prince, Lord Jinh, Night Owl, Ma Quanquan, and the Dongsang King would all be involved.","Fifteen minutes later.","Feng Wu went back to Princess Yan Ling.","Seeing Feng Wu come back, Shijian frowned. “Where have you been? Do you think you can come and go as you please? Do you know how long I’ve been looking for you?!”","Feng Wu said, “I.. ‘","Before Feng Wu could say another word, Princess Yan Ling walked out of the room.","She glanced at Shijian, and the latter didn’t dare to say another word.","Shijian and Yuexin were Princess Yan Ling’s two maids brought here from the Dayan Empire, but Yuexing was missing, and Shijian feared Princess Yanling to the bone.","Seeing Feng Wu, Princess Yan Ling waved at her.","Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu with a stern look on her face. “Have you figured it out?”","Feng Wu played the role of a maid perfectly, and she was perfect in her tone and posture.."]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021: The Second Prince (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4021: The Second Prince (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She said gingerly, “I’ve checked. That manor is very well-connected... It’s...”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu. “Speak!” Feng Wu gritted her teeth and said, “It’s the second prince’s private residence.” “It’s him?!” Princess Yan [ling wouldn’t believe it.","She frowned. How could it be the second prince? At first, she thought it was Night Owl’s private residence.","“Shijian, look into it again!” Princess Yan Ling gave Shijian an address.","Shijian came back fifteen minutes later.","“Princess, that private residence indeed belongs to the second prince,” said the Shijian in a serious tone.","Princess Yan Ling then jumped out of her seat and picked up the sword hanging on the wall.","“Princess, you...” Shijian was surprised.","She had no idea what the princess was doing!","Apart from Feng Wu, no one else in the manor knew what had happened to Princess Yan Ling, including the peak Spiritual Saint.","Meanwhile, Princess Yan Ling’s face had turned livid.","“This Dongsang Kingdom! My family treated them well over the years! Dayan has helped them and given them so many things!","“Do they really think they’ve risen so high on their own?","“If the empire hadn’t supported them and suppressed the Junwu Empire, they would have been devoured by the Junwu Empire already. How dare they do this to me!”","Princess Yan Ling was still fuming, and she kept yelling as she dashed off.","Soon, she arrived at the second prince’s residence.","The princes would move out of the imperial palace when they turned 12 and start their own residences. Therefore, the second prince’s residence was in the imperial capital, but not in the imperial palace.","Four guards guarded the front gate.","They didn’t recognize the angry Princess Yan Ling.","After all, Princess Yan Ling lived in seclusion, and not many people could recognize her.","Without another word, Princess Yan Ling charged out with her sword.","Feng Wu and the Shijian followed her.","Shijian was genuinely anxious, but Feng Wu was only pretending. In fact, she was over the moon.","The Dongsang Kingdom and the Dayan Empire had joined hands to destroy the Junwu Empire, and they were about to break into a fight between themselves. Of course, Feng Wu was happy.","The four guards didn’t recognize Princess Yan Ling. Seeing that someone was going to charge into the second prince’s residence with a sword, they blocked the door and shouted, “Who are you? How dare you...”","However, before the four guards could finish their sentence...","Whoosh!","Three of them had been decapitated.","It was Princess Yan Ling.","The last guard watched with his mouth agape. He came back to himself, turned around, and rushed in, shouting, “We’re under attack!”","Princess Yan Ling didn’t care what he shouted. She was still furious, so she walked into the manor with her bloody sword.","Shijian and Feng Wu quickly followed him.","The maid was a little anxious. She didn’t know why her princess had suddenly lost her mind. This wasn’t some random place. She couldn’t just kill someone and cover it up. This was the second prince’s place...","Hence, Shejian stopped Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, wake up! Wake up!”","Princess Yan Ling’s eyes were bloodshot red, and she looked like she had lost her mind.","“Princess, why are you here? You can’t kill people here... Argh!”"]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022: The Second Prince (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4022: The Second Prince (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling looked like she had really lost it.","When Shijian came out to stop her, she stabbed Shijian in the shoulder blade and sent her flying.","Although it wasn’t enough to kill Shijian, it was enough to destroy most of Shijian’s cultivation.","Feng Wu gave the maid a sympathetic look. The maid really didn’t know how to read faces. Right now, Feng Wu was hiding behind Princess Yan Ling and wouldn’t say anything.","Many people in the second prince’s residence were alarmed.","There were guards and advisors, but most of them were servants.","Naturally, the servants didn’t dare to show their faces, and the guards were the first to come out.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","A team of armed guards stepped out.","Whoosh!","A team of crossbowmen arrived after them.","The saber guards surrounded Princess Yan Ling in a circle, while the crossbowmen fanned out. They were ready to shoot at any moment.","A bloodbath was imminent!","Seeing this, Princess Yan Ling smirked.","“How dare these people offend me?!”","With a wave of her hand, all the guards in the front row were decapitated.","“Go to hell!”","Intimidated, Princess Yan Ling showed no mercy.","She turned all the humiliation she suffered in the past few days into a murderous intention and was going to kill all these people.","More than half of the a hundred saber guards were killed by Princess Yan Ling in the blink of an eye.","“Saber guards, retreat! The crossbowmen, get ready!”","There came a cold voice.","It was the captain of the guards of the second prince’s residence!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","They were ready to shoot Princess Yan Ling.","Just then, Night Light, the second prince, rushed out, and his pupils contracted when he saw Princess Yan Ling.","“Stop! Stop!” Night Light shouted.","The crossbowmen stopped at the last moment, or the consequence would have been unimaginable.","“Princess Yan Ling...”","However, before Night Light could finish, Princess Yan Ling stepped forward and slapped him hard in the face.","Princess Yan Ling had used all her strength, and the second prince couldn’t withstand it. He stumbled back.","Behind him, the others all glared at Princess Yanling. The battle was going to start again.","Night Light was filled with hatred, but he knew that she was from the Empire of Dayan. If he offended her, he would be in a lot of trouble.","At that thought, Night Light glared at Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, why don’t you tell us what you’re here for first before you decide what to do?”","Princess Yanling stared at him in disgust and smirked. “Fine. Since you’re asking for it, I’ll give you a chance to speak!”","“Princess, would you like to come in, then?” Night Light beamed at her, although the smile didn’t reach his eyes.","Princess Yan Ling walked in without hesitation, followed by Night Light.","“Your Royal Highness...” The captain of the second prince’s guards was about to follow him, but the second prince waved at him. “Wait outside. No one is to come in without my permission!”","“But Your Royal Highness...” The captain was worried about him.","Night Light waved him off. “Don’t worry. She won’t dare to kill me. She doesn’t know what I have. Tell Yuanhe to come here!”","Yuanhe was Night Light’s most trusted guard and had always been by his side. He was also the one who brought Princess Yan Ling to Night Light.."]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023: Secret Conversation (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4023: Secret Conversation (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Light and Princess Yan Ling entered the main hall.","They were the only people in the hall.","Night Light smiled obsequiously. “Princess Yan Ling, please take a seat. Let’s talk like civilized people. You’re a lady, and it’ll be very embarrassing if you lose your temper...”","However, Princess Yan Ling slapped him before he could finish. Night Light, how dare you!”","The second prince was infuriated as well. He looked at Princess Yan Ling with a malicious look in his eyes.","Princess Yan Ling ignored him and looked into his eyes. “Choose which way you’re going to die. Standing or kneeling?”","Night Light stared at Princess Yan Ling. “I see that you don’t want to talk to me anymore.”","“Talk to you?” Princess Yan Ling sneered at him. “About what?”","Night Light found a seat and said, “Princess, we’re...”","Turning around, Princess Yan Ling glared at him and was about to stab him with her sword.","But this time, Night Light caught the tip of the sword between his fingers.","Princess Yan Ling said, “How dare you?!”","Night Light chuckled. “I’ve done what I did. Why should I be afraid?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “So, you admit that you did it.”","Night Light studied Princess Yan Ling from head to toe before asking with a smile, “What did I do?”","Princess Yanling said, “You’re shameless!”","Night Light smirked. “I’m shameless? You’re the one who went to my bed, aren’t you? What are you if I’m shameless? Are you trying to humiliate yourself?”","Princess Yan Ling’s eyes were bloodshot red. “Night Light! I’m going to kill you!”","Night Light smirked. “Did I say something wrong? Didn’t you come to me on your own? I was at home. I opened the door to find you lying in bed.”","Princess Yan Ling’s face was livid. “Bullshit!”","Night Light said, “Of course, I’m telling the truth. You were the one who came to me that day.”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Night Light. “I’m not your match, but are you sure you want me to bring Grandpa Ma here?”","Wasn’t he the peak Spiritual Saint?","Night Light was a capable cultivator, but he was nowhere near as capable as a peak Spiritual Saint, who could easily kill him with a finger.","Jun Linshen’s face darkened.","Princess Yanling stared at him. “Tell me everything that happened that day! I know you aren’t bold enough!”","Night Light didn’t want to say anything at first, but under Princess Yan Ling’s pressure, he had no choice but to say, “Princess, you were lying by the side of the road when you were injured. Yuanhe didn’t know who you were, but he had to carry you back home when he saw your naked body and the wounds on you!”","Princess Yanling flared up. “Nonsense! Since when am I injured? Why would I lie on the side of the road naked?!”","Night Light shrugged. “Princess, it doesn’t matter if you don’t believe me. That was how Yuanhe found you. All the maids and servants saw it when he carried you in. I’m sure of it!”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth.","How could this happen?","How could she...","Princess Yan Ling tried her best to recall, but she couldn’t remember anything.."]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024: Secret Conversation (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4024: Secret Conversation (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Light glanced at Princess Yan Ling and told the chief steward, “Go fetch","Yuanhe!”","The chief steward wanted to say something but hesitated.","Night Light said angrily, “What are you waiting for?!”","Only then did the chief steward go in and whisper something in his ear. Night Light asked, “What? He’s dead?”","The chief steward nodded. “He was sitting at his desk and was ambushed from behind.”","Night Light turned around and stared at Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling frowned. “Why are you staring at me?","Night Light rose to his feet and quickly headed for Yuanne’s courtyard.","Yuanhe was the second prince’s most capable guard and most trusted strategist. How could the second prince not be worried when he was assassinated?","“Stop right there!” Princess Yan Ling bellowed, but Night Light wouldn’t stop,","so she had to follow him.","Night Light rushed into the room to find Yuanhe lying dead on the table.","Staring at the dead body on the desk, Princess Yan Ling’s eyes glinted coldly.","Was this the person who had carried her into the manor?","If the second prince was telling the truth, then Yuanhe was the lead. But now, Yuanhe had been killed. Who killed him?","The most profitable person should be the most suspect. Could it have been Night Light?","Just then, Night Light found some words carved on the table.","To be more precise, there was only one and a half words, which Yuanhe had carved with his nails before he died.","The first word was Yan’.","The second word was “Lit‘.","Night Light jolted.","That was it!","The fact that Princess Yan Ling had come to the private residence meant that she remembered what happened the other day! Naturally, she remembered that Yuanhe had carried her in, and now, she had taken her revenge on the man, making it difficult for Night Light to explain himself.","Princess Yan Ling was trying to set him up.","Night Light thought that Princess Yan Ling had killed Yuanhe, and Princess Yanling thought that it was Night Light’s doing. As a result, the misunderstanding grew bigger.","Feng Wu was the one who had set the trap.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was watching things happen according to her plan, and she was only a facilitator and a bystander.","“You killed him!”","“You killed him!”","They spoke in unison.","“Heh!”","They snorted in unison again.","Princess Yan Ling said coldly, “He’s dead. What more do you have to say now?","Do you have anything to say about what happened the other day?”","Night Light frowned. “Didn’t you kill Yuanhe?”","Princess Yanling said, “Are you trying to frame me?!”","Night Light said, “You killed him! If you don’t believe me, we’ll take it to my father and ask for his opinion!” The Dongsang King?","Princess Yan Ling didn’t want to!","Because it was her privacy. If what happened to her got out... As a woman she would be in a lot of trouble.","When that happened, the Dongsang Emperor would make Night Light marry her for the sake of their dignity.","At that thought, the look in Princess Yan Ling’s eyes turned grimmer, and she was filled with rage!","Night Owl didn’t even dare to make a sound in front of her. Who the hell did this second prince think he was?","“If you can’t explain yourself, go to hell!” Princess Yan Ling struck out without","hesitation.","Night Light jumped.."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025: Secret Conversation (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4025: Secret Conversation (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You’re a shrew! You used to call me your husband in bed, but now you’re treating me like this. Princess Yan Ling, do you think I’m that easy to bully?!” She bullied him?","Princess Yan Ling almost laughed out of anger. “You can say whatever you want! You are going to die today anyway!”","With that said, Princess Yan Ling grabbed Night Light’s throat!","There wasn’t much difference between their cultivation levels. Princess Yan Ling was slightly stronger, and Night Light was caught off guard, so Yan Ling succeeded.","“Die!” A dagger flew out from Princess Yan Ling’s sleeve and was about to stab into Night Light’s heart!","But at this critical moment!","“Yan Ling, do you think that I won’t leave any evidence for what happened that night?!” Night Light sneered.","Princess Yan Ling was stunned. “What did you say?”","Night Light sneered again, but this time, he was much more confident. He looked at Princess Yan Ling mockingly. “Don’t tell me you forgot that you gave us a gift when you came to the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Princess Yan Ling naturally remembered.","What she gave the Dongsang Kingdom were ten Spiritual Fossil Stones.","The ancient technology of the Dayan Empire was advanced, and such divine fossils with recording functions weren’t rare. Therefore, she casually grabbed some from her mansion and threw them in her luggage. When she saw the Dongsang King, she took them out as gifts.","Night Light stared at Princess Yan Ling and sneered. “Father gave me two of the Spiritual Fossil Stones that you gave to Dongsang.”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth and glared at the Night Light. “What did you do with the Spiritual Fossil Stone!”","Night Light said, “Take a wild guess.”","Princess Yan Ling sneered. “I don’t believe you would do that!”","Night Light sneered, “You don’t believe me? In that case, you can see for yourself! ”","After saying that, Night Light took out a Spiritual Fossil Stone from his sleeve and put it in front of a white wall. Immediately, an image appeared. The scene slowly unfolded. First, it was the bed, then the woman on the bed...","Princess Yan Ling’s pupils constricted!","At that time, she was in a semi-conscious state. She...","“Damn it!”","Princess Yan Ling destroyed the wall with a slap, but she couldn’t destroy the image in the Spiritual Fossil Stone.","“Give it to me!” Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth in anger!","Damn it!","How could such a scene be recorded?!","Night Light still felt that she wasn’t upset enough. He stared at her with a smile. “Do you know why I keep this Spiritual Fossil Stone with me every day?” Anger gathered in Princess Yan Ling’s eyes.","However, Night Light continued to provoke her. “Because I’ll... watch it day and night. ”","“You deserve to die!” Princess Yan Ling grabbed his collar!","She had never suffered such humiliation in the Dayan Empire, but in the tiny Dongsang Kingdom, she was actually forced to this extent!","Night Light sneered. ‘Whv should I die? You were the one who crawled into mv","bed and begged for my love. As for the future...","“Yan Ling, with this Spiritual Fossil Stone in hand, do you still dare to kill me?","Do you still dare to disobey me? Do you still dare to disobey my orders?","Everything you have is in my hands!”","Night Light had never felt so confident before!","“From now on, I am your master. Now, kneel!” Night Light sneered as he stared at her.","Princess Yan Ling looked at Night Light as if she was looking at a retard.","However, Night Light was still urging her, “Hurry up, kneel and call me master.”","Princess Yan Ling was furious.."]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026: Kill Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 4026: Kill Him","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Light threatened her, “If you don’t listen, the scene in this Spiritual Fossil Stone... You don’t want everyone in Donglin City to see it, right?” Princess Yan Ling glared at him!","A sinister smile appeared on Night Light’s face. “Come on. Kneel!”","Night Light thought everything was going well.","He had a trump card in his hand. If he controlled Princess Yan Ling, wouldn’t the Dayan Empire be able to help him in the future? With the help of the Dayan Empire, why would he be afraid of Night Owl?","Even the Dongsang King couldn’t do anything to him, let alone Night Owl. At that time, it wasn’t impossible to force the king to abdicate! Thinking of this, Night Light was in a state of excitement.","However, he never dreamed that... A hand grabbed his neck!","“Yan Ling, you...”","Soon, Night Light couldn’t make a sound.","Princess Yan Ling stared at him fiercely. In the next moment, she snatched the Spiritual Fossil Stone from his hand.","“You want to threaten me?” Princess Yan Ling sneered. “Those who can threaten me are no longer alive. You’re no exception!”","Crack, crack...","There was the sound of bones breaking. “You... will... regret... this!”","That was the last thing that Night Light said.","At this moment, a group of people rushed in!","Some of them were Princess Yan Ling’s subordinates, including Feng Wu.","But most of them were Night Light’s subordinates.","When the chief steward and the chief guard saw Night Light’s body on the ground, they were completely stunned!","They could not believe what was happening in front of them!","That was Night Light...","The prince of the kingdom had died just like that?! That was impossible!","“Your Royal Highness?”","The chief steward and the guard captain rushed up and shook Night Light with all their might. As they shook him, they roared at the top of their lungs!","Blood trickled down the corner of Night Light’s mouth...","“He’s not breathing.”","“There’s no pulse.”","The chief steward and the chief guard exchanged a look and then stared at Princess Yan Ling.","There were only two people in the room. Night Light was dead, and the murderer was...","Princess Yan Ling ignored these people. She scanned her surroundings coldly and looked up at the person on the roof. “Grandpa Ma, I’ll leave it to you.”","Ma Quanquan frowned slightly and looked a little displeased.","He heard the conversation inside.","He knew everything.","He could understand Princess Yan Ling’s anger, but...","“Grandpa Ma, help me destroy this mansion. No one is allowed to leave!”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth. “What if there are backup divine fossils? What if someone leaves with the Spiritual Fossil Stone? I will not allow such a thing to happen!”","Although Ma Quanquan was at the Spirit Saint Stage, he was still an employer of Prince Yan’s residence. He had to listen to Princess Yan Ling.","After all, it was the resources of Lord Yan’s Residence that supported him back then.","“Sure.”","What Night Light had done to the princess was enough to have his whole family destroyed.","Feng Wu watched in shock...","The Night Light Manor was filled with screams, tragic cries, and fire...","Princess Yan Ling was standing on the street outside, staring at the flames that filled the sky!","The Night Light Residence occupied an entire street, and the next street was Night Owl’s residence.","At this moment, Night Owl was already alarmed.","“Night Light’s mansion is on fire?”","Night Owl stared at the chief steward. “What happened?”","The chief steward hurriedly said, “There was a commotion in the Night Light residence. Cries kept coming. Some said that Prince Night Light is dead.”","Night Owl suddenly stood up!"]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027: Night Light Died (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4027: Night Light Died (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Owl suddenly stood up from his seat and looked at the chief steward in disbelief!","He wanted to run out, but he quickly stopped.","“Hurry up and investigate!” Night Owl ordered anxiously.","There might be a reason for this. Could Night Light really have... No, that’s impossible. This kid had always been arrogant and domineering. After so many years, who could...","Could it be...","Thinking of this, Night Owl went straight into the secret room and met up with Lord Jing.","“You mean that Night Light and Princess Yan Ling have already gotten into a conflict?!”","Lord Jing thought that his plan was starting to work, so he got up excitedly.","Night Owl nodded. “Indeed.”","Lord Jing said, “Let’s go and take a look.”","The two of them separated and walked out of their respective residences before heading toward Night Light’s residence.","Princess Yan Ling had already left.","Therefore, when Night Owl and Lord Jing arrived, they saw the ruins.","Night Owl fished out a person from the well in the ruins. It was the chief steward of the mansion.","In broad daylight, the entire Night Light Residence was massacred!","Only the chief steward saw that things were getting out of hand and quickly jumped into the well, which was why he survived.","“Your Royal Highness! Lord Jing!”","The steward, whose face was half-burnt, knelt down and wrapped his arms around their thighs, crying until he almost fainted.","“What happened?”","Night Owl and Lord Jing looked at each other with joy in their eyes.","Night Light was the biggest obstacle in Night Owl’s path to power. Getting rid of him would only be beneficial to Night Owl.","Furthermore, they had succeeded in pinning the blame on Night Light. Furthermore, Princess Yan Ling had actually massacred almost everyone in the Night Light Residence in broad daylight. This accusation... Did she think that she could get away so easily?","There were only two people that Night Owl hated in the Dongsang Kingdom. Now that one was dead, the other wouldn’t have an easy time...","It was then that the chief steward realized that Night Light and Night Owl were mortal enemies. He couldn’t ask Night Owl for help, so he turned to Lord Jing and said, “My Lord, it was Princess Yan Ling! She killed Prince Night Light with her own hands, and they wiped out our whole residence! I want to see His","Majesty! Please take me to see His Majesty!”","Lord Jing gave Night Owl a hint, and Night Owl nodded.","It was indeed inconvenient for him to handle it, so Lord Jing was the best person for the job.","At this moment, there were already a large number of commoners around. They were pointing at the scene in front of them.","However, the news of Princess Yan Ling killing Night Light and destroying the Night Light Residence in broad daylight had already spread like wildfire in Donglin City.","Night Owl, who had returned to the mansion, couldn’t help but guffaw. He laughed so hard that tears were about to fall.","What an incredible move!","However, Princess Yan Ling was so arrogant. She actually killed Night Light on the spot. She was so bold! Meanwhile, in the palace.","“What?!","The Dongsang King slammed the table and stared at Lord Jing. “What did you say?!”","Lord Jing said sadly, “Princess Yan Ling killed Night Light and killed more than 400 people in the mansion. She left in broad daylight without hiding anything.”","“This isn’t happening!”","The Dongsang King wouldn’t believe it.","How was this possible?","Princess Yan Ling had come to the Dongsang Kingdom to work with them.. How could she dare..."]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028: Night Light Died (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4028: Night Light Died (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“His Majesty, Night Light is dead...” Lord Jing cried and sounded angry.","The king was anxious and angry. He shot a look at the eunuch beside him. The chief eunuch hurriedly bowed and said, “I’ll go and investigate now!”","In less than five mintues, the eunuch returned. His face was pale, and he stumbled along the way, panting heavily!","“Your Majesty! Your Majesty!”","The eunuch knelt down in front of the Dongsang King and said mournfully, “Prince Night Light is dead. Prince Night Light... is dead...” “What did you say?!","The Dongsang King stared at his most trusted eunuch.","The chief eunuch nodded solemnly.","The king was shocked.","“What happened? Tell me the truth!”","The chief eunuch said the same thing as Lord Jing. The murderer he was talking about was Princess Yan Ling as well.","Princess Yan Ling was really arrogant.","She didn’t hesitate to kill the prince and destroy the mansion. Moreover, she didn’t hide after the killing. She stood in front of the burning mansion and watched. After that, she left.","What did that mean?","She was clearly extremely arrogant!","After hearing the eunuch’s words, the Dongsang King clenched his fists, and the blue veins on his forehead throbbed.","There was dead silence all around.","Lord Jing knew that although the king was angry, he was still hesitating and weighing the pros and cons. In the end, he would probably make peace.","“But there’s no witness...” said the Dongsang King.","Lord Jing stood up and said seriously, “When I got there, Princess Yan Ling had already left, but I still picked up a man from the well. He’s the steward of Prince Night Light. He can testify for this matter.”","The Dongsang King stared at Lord Jing coldly.","Lord Jing pretended not to understand. He lowered his head and looked very loyal.","The Dongsang King looked much older. He waved his hand and said, “Bring the witness up.”","Night Light’s chief steward was immediately brought up.","The Dongsang King narrowed his eyes dangerously and stared at him warningly. “Tell me what exactly happened!”","The chief steward prostrated and told the Dongsang King about Princess Yan Ling’s attack on the mansion. In the end, he cried and said, “Princess Yan Ling and Prince Night Light were alone in the room. When we barged in, the prince was already on the ground, and Princess Yan Ling was standing with her hands behind her back. She admitted that she was the one who killed him. “It’s not enough that she killed the prince. She even ordered Senior Ma to kill everyone in the residence.","“His Majesty, that was Prince Night Light!","“Why would she dare? Why would she...”","The chief steward cried uncontrollably. He felt like his head was going to","explode.","In his eyes, the royal family was an honorable and dignified existence. But now, Princess Yan Ling had humiliated the entire royal family, telling them that the Dongsang Kingdom was like an ant in her eyes. She could beat and kill anyone she wanted!","How humiliating was this...","The Dongsang King clenched his fists in anger, his knuckles turning white!","However, the old steward cried and added, “Your Majesty, is this still your Dongsang Kingdom? Is this still our Dongsang Kingdom? Are we really not the inferior slaves of the Dayan Empire? If they dare to treat our prince like this, then Your Majesty...”","“Shut up!” Before the Dongsang King could speak, the eunuch beside him kicked the old steward and sent him flying.","“Please calm down, Your Majesty...” The chief eunuch knelt down and asked for forgiveness.."]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029: Arrogant Words (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4029: Arrogant Words (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, the Dongsang King was indeed furious!","The Dongsang Kingdom and the Dayan Empire were allies, and the Dayan Empire was like a big brother, but that was all. Killing a prince in broad daylight was simply indescribable!","“Go and arrest that princess!” The Dongsang King said to Lord Jing.","Lord Jing said, “Princess Yan Ling has a peak Spiritual Saint...’","“Don’t tell me my kingdom doesn’t have a peak Spiritual Saint? Senior Brother Min!”","As soon as the Dongsang King finished speaking, a figure appeared in front of everyone.","It was a green-robed middle-aged man dressed like a Daoist priest. He looked sage-like and quite unapproachable.","Senior Brother Min, please come with me.” The Dongsang King called him Senior Brother with a sincere gaze.","Lord Min nodded at the Dongsang King and walked out without saying anything else.","Lord Jing followed him.","He couldn’t help but mutter inwardly. He had always heard that the Dongsang","King had a super expert protecting him, but it turned out to be this Senior Brother Min. Could he really be the king’s Senior Brother? Then the king’s cultivation level...","Lord Jing had all kinds of guesses, but he didn’t slow down.","Just as they were heading to Princess Yan Ling’s residence...","That’s right, Princess Yan Ling had made this residence, Prince Yan’s residence, just like the one in the Dayan Empire.","In Prince Yan’s residence, Princess Yan Ling was sitting in her room. She stared at the Spiritual Fossil Stone in her hand with an ashen expression!","Just the thought of that bastard Night Light taking it out from time to time to admire it made Princess Yan Ling want to destroy the entire Night Light family.","However, she still had some rationality, so she only killed Night Light to vent her anger.","“This is simply unacceptable!”","Princess Yan Ling paced around the room angrily. As she walked, she said to","Ma Quanquan, “Grandpa Ma! I’m still very angry. I can’t help but want to kill someone!”","Ma Quanquan frowned.","She knew the reason for Princess Yan Ling’s anger. To be honest, he was also very angry, but...","“Princess, we need to think about the big picture.” Ma Quanquan could only say this.","“The big picture! It’s always the big picture! Screw the big picture! I’ve never been humiliated like this since I was a child. He humiliated me, but he still dared to threaten me and manipulate me! Killing him alone won’t be enough!”","Ma Quanquan had a headache. “Princess, what do you mean?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “He wasn’t born from a rock. I can’t kill his father, but I can kill his mother? Yes, that’s it!”","Princess Yan Ling clapped her hands and said to Ma Quanquan, “Grandpa Ma, please bring me the head of Night Light’s mother!”","Ma Quanquan refused this time. “Princess, it’s not wise to offend Dongsang.”","Princess Yan Ling was enraged. “What’s wrong with that? It’s just a petty kingdom! What’s wrong with me offending them? What’s wrong with me humiliating them? What’s wrong with me killing their prince? No one in the Dongsang Kingdom can stop me from doing anything!”","“Princess, you’re an ambassador now. You can’t be willful!” Ma Quanquan’s eyes were cold.","“So what? If the strengths of both sides are equal, then I will naturally respect them. However, the Dongsang Kingdom is only Dayan’s dog. Why should I give them any respect? It’s their honor to be enslaved by me.. Hmph!”"]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030: Arrogant Words (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4030: Arrogant Words (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This time, Ma Quanquan frowned. He glared at Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, keep these thoughts to yourself in the future!”","Princess Yan Ling didn’t think much of it. “Why should I? I always say what’s on my mind. What’s the point of hiding it?”","“Princess, is that how you see the Dongsang Kingdom?”","A voice rang out outside.","Princess Yan Ling turned around and saw a familiar face. It was Lord Jing.","“You?” Princess Yan Ling glanced at Lord Jing.","Princess Yan Ling held grudges against him for the conflict they had.","Lord Jing and Master Min came in together.","When Lord Jing looked at Princess Yanling, Ma Quanquan and Master Min exchanged looks.","One look and they knew each other’s cultivation level. They were about the same level.","Master Min remained unperturbed, but Ma Quanquan’s stomach lurched.","Why did the Dongsang Kingdom bring a peak Spiritual Saint here?","However, Master Min had concealed his energy, so Princess Yan Ling had no idea how capable he was. Therefore, she gave Lord Jing a contemptuous look.","“Why, what brings you here?” Princess Yan Ling didn’t think much of Lord Jing at all.","Lord Jing said coldly, “Don’t you know what you’ve done?”","Outside, Feng Wu was thrilled to see them.","While served the tea, she stole a glance at Master Min.","Although Master Min didn’t exert his full power, Feng Wu had a feeling that he was very capable.","“Who gave you the permission to serve tea? You should know better! You’re humiliating the empire!” Princess Yan Ling scolded Feng Wu.","Naturally, Feng Wu feigned a terrified look.","Staring at Princess Yan Ling, Lord Jing smirked. “Princess, there’s no need to make indirect accusations. What’s the point of stalling?”","“Stalling?” Princess Yan Ling turned to stare at Lord Jing. “Are you saying that I’m stalling? Who am I to stall for time? Do you think I’ll do that for you?”","Lord Jing gave her a half-smile. “Princess Yan Ling, who do you think you are? And what about the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Although he had heard Princess Yan Ling’s bragging in the courtyard, he still felt that it wasn’t enough. He had to give the silly princess an opportunity to make a fool of herself.","Of course, the arrogant Princess Yan Ling couldn’t stand such provocation. She smirked and said, “Dayan is superior, and the Dongsang Kingdom is inferior. Do you have no self-awareness at all? Do you have to wait for me to say it?” Ma Quanquan stared at her and said sternly, “Princess!”","She could say that in Dayan, but she couldn’t say it aloud in the Dongsang Kingdom.","The empire was indeed more powerful than the Dongsang Kingdom, but if the Dongsang Kingdom was infuriated, the people would join hands to fight against the empire. It wouldn’t be a good thing. What Princess Yan Ling didn’t know was that...","Her words had been recorded.","The one recording it was none other than Little Phoenix.","It was Feng Wu’s instruction.."]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031: Arrogant Words (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4031: Arrogant Words (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix gave Feng Wu a proud look, and Feng Wu gave it an approving look.","Little Phoenix was even more enthusiastic, and its Spiritual Fossil Stone almost hit Princess Yan Ling in the face.","Ma Quanquan looked around and said, “If word gets out, it won’t do the empire or the Dongsang Kingdom any good!”","Ma Quanquan was Lord Jing’s nominal master, so of course he had to listen.","But...","Lord Jing’s face was livid, and his hands were trembling from agitation.","“An inferior race?” Lord Jing pointed at Princess Yan Ling. “Say that again!”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “What? Are you afraid to listen? I’ll repeat myself.","The Dongsang Kingdom is—”","“Princess!” Ma Quanquan bellowed.","Meanwhile, Master Min, who was standing next to Lord Jing, exerted all his power, crushing Princess Yan Ling until she blanched. Only then did he say coldly, “There are things you can and can’t say. Princess, please think it through!”","“You...”","Princess Yan Ling’s teeth chattered as she stared at the blurry face.","The energy the man gave off was very similar to that of Grandpa Ma. Could he be...","Seeing that Princess Yan Ling was in a lot of pain, Ma Quanquan blocked her way and stared at Master Min.","Master Min stared back at him.","Instantly, spiritual essence gathered around them, and the air seemed to fluctuate.","As Princess Yan Ling stumbled back, so did Lord Jing.","The two of them had to jump out of the circle to let out a breath of relief.","The powerhouse at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage was so terrifying that they could barely breathe.","Ma Quanquan frowned at Master Min. “Is that how the Dongsang Kingdom treats the empire?”","Master Min threw the question back at him. “Does Princess Yan Ling represent the empire?”","Ma Quanquan said, “Of course not.”","Only then did Master Min snort. “Good.”","He then walked toward Princess Yan Ling. Ma Quanquan blocked his way. “What are you doing?”","Master Min said, “Leave her to me.”","It was obvious that Master Min was going to interrogate Princess Yan Ling.","“No!” Princess Yan Ling turned him down right away. “I’m not going anywhere!","The Dongsang Kingdom wants to incriminate me, but I won’t have it!”","Lord Jing said, “His Majesty wants to see you. Princess Yan Ling, please come with us.”","The Dongsang King?","The father of the second prince that she had killed?","“Do I have to see him just because he wants to see me? Don’t make me laugh!” Princess Yan Ling smirked.","Lord Jing asked, “Princess, is it true that you’ve killed the second prince?” Princess Yan Ling said, “That’s right! I killed him myself! I won’t deny it!”","Lord Jing said, “That’s it. Princess, please come with us.”","Princess Yan Ling shook her head.","Lord Jing smirked. “Princess, aren’t you supposed to be dauntless? Didn’t you say you had the right to kill Prince Night Light? What now? Are you afraid of telling his father what happened?”","Infuriated, Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Fine. It’s just a meeting with the Dongsang King, isn’t it? Why should I be afraid? Because of what Night Light did, I killed him to get rid of the evil for the Dongsang Kingdom! Lead the way!”","Princess Yan Ling followed Lord Jing to the imperial palace. The Dongsang King looked down at Princess Yan Ling.."]},{"number":4032,"title":"Chapter 4032: What Are You Doing? (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4032: What Are You Doing? (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling didn’t back down either.","The Dongsang King’s face was livid.","Princess Yan Ling wasn’t in a good mood either. When she came here before, the Dongsang King had been very warm toward her and wouldn’t let her just stand there. He would offer her a seat right away.","A young eunuch would come up to her with a chair and let her sit on the side.","But not this time.","The Dongsang King let her stand there.","That infuriated Princess Yan Ling.","After exchanging a few cold looks, Princess Yan Ling spoke first.","“Your Majesty, are you here to ask about Night Light?” Princess Yan Ling asked first, but her tone was still very arrogant. The Dongsang King said coldly, “Tell me what happened!”","Feng Wu looked at them curiously.","As a matter of fact, she had no idea what Princess Yan Ling saw in her. The princess had let Feng Wu go to court with her but left Shijian in the residence.","This was the first time Feng Wu saw the Dongsang King with her own eyes.","While he and Princess Yan Ling were at daggers drawn, Feng Wu stole a glance at the king.","The king was younger than she had expected. Compared to Emperor Wu, Feng Wu realized that he was more capable, but he didn’t have the domineering air of a ruler. It was as if he had been suppressed and compromised all the time.","That wasn’t what Feng Wu imagined of the Dongsang King.","A country with a blood contract system should have an iron-blooded ruler, but after seeing the Dongsang King, Feng Wu knew that he wasn’t tenacious enough because he had compromised too much.","Feng Wu shook her head inwardly. Emperor Wu had to be living a much more comfortable life.","While Feng Wu’s mind was wandering off, Princess Yan Ling and the Dongsang King were confronting each other.","Princess Yan Ling walked up the stairs and went up to the Dongsang King.","No one in the Dongsang Kingdom had ever dared to do such a thing.","Master Min’s face was livid, but Lord Jing smirked.","If God wanted to destroy someone, he would make them insane first.","With Princess Yan Ling’s arrogance, something was bound to happen! Lord Jing was sure of it!","“Night Light deserved to die!” Princess Yan Ling smirked.","The Dongsang King’s face darkened.","“Of course, I have proof, but why should I show it to you?!” Princess Yan Ling stared at the Dongsang King. “All you need to know is that Night Light deserved to die!”","The Dongsang King was frustrated.","“That’s all I have to say. Believe it or not!” Princess Yan Ling turned to leave after that.","“Stop!”","The Dongsang King stared at Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, please show us the evidence before you leave.”","Princess Yan Ling turned to look at the Dongsang King.","She knew better than anyone else that the Dongsang King needed the support of the empire, which was why she dared to kill the second prince.","Was the Dongsang King going to punish her now?","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Your Majesty, are you going to turn against the empire now? Are you going to fight the Junwu Empire on your own?” The Dongsang King’s face was livid, but he fought back his anger. “Proof! ”","Princess Yan Ling asked, ‘What if I don’t give you any?”","The Dongsang King was so angry that he laughed.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “So, will Your Majesty make me pay with my own life? Heh!”","The Dongsang King didn’t answer, but it was obvious what he meant.."]},{"number":4033,"title":"Chapter 4033: What Are You Doing? (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4033: What Are You Doing? (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling laughed. ‘Who the hell does he think he is? I can kill him if I want to, but do you think I’ll pay with my own life?”","The Dongsang King still didn’t say anything, but Feng Wu could see anger and frustration on his face.","Feng Wu wondered if the Dongsang King would regret getting so involved with Dayan.","Seeing that the Dongsang King was on the verge of exploding and that Ma Quanquan was giving her a warning look, Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Of course, the empire treats its allies well. The Dongsang Kingdom is our ally, so I","have to be reasonable.”","However, Princess Yan Ling would never show the Spiritual Fossil Stone to the king.","“Night Light offended me,” said Princess Yan Ling arrogantly.","The Dongsang King fought back his rage. “What did he do?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “He was peeping at me while I was bathing! What do you think?!”","The Dongsang King said, “You don’t have any proof.”","Princess Yan Ling glared at the Dongsang Klng impatiently. She had gone to so much trouble to make up the evidence, but the king still wouldn’t believe her.","Princess Yan Ling threw a dirty look at him. “I’ve made myself very clear. There’s no need for any more proof! Night Light is dead, and that’s the best proof! If he didn’t do anything, why would I kill him?!","“That’s my explanation!” Princess Yan Ling turned to leave after that.","“By the way,” Princess Yan Ling suddenly turned to look at the Dongsang KING. “The second batch of capable cultivators of Dayan will be here soon, and they’re much more powerful than the first batch. I’m sure Your Majesty can guess how powerful they are.","“I don’t think Your Majesty wants us to defeat the Dongsang Kingdom first.","Right?”","She marched off after that.","The Dongsang King clenched his fists, and his face went stiff, but those who knew him well could tell that he was furious.","“Your Majesty, are we going to let her leave just like that?”","Lord Jing frowned at the Dongsang King. “If she can kill the second prince so easily, what about the others?”","Did that mean she could kill anyone as she pleased?","The Dongsang King had wanted to take Princess Yan Ling down, but she had threatened him with what she said in the end.","Two top Spiritual Saints arrived in the first batch. One was Ma Quanquan, and the other one went to visit other kingdoms of the continent and hadn’t come back yet. The second batch was going to be much more capable.","The Dongsang King took a deep breath, glanced at Lord Jing, and said coldly,","“You can leave now.”","“Your Majesty!” said Lord Jing. “Are we going to let Princess Yan Ling do whatever she wants to us? Is there really no way to stop her? Everyone in Donglin City saw that she killed the second prince. She—”","The Dongsang King stopped him with a wave of his hand. “Leave!”","Under the king’s intimidating gaze, Lord Jing finally sighed and left.","After the others were gone, the king sat down in the dragon chair.","It was his dragon throne and the symbol of his prestige, but a king had just been humiliated by a girl. That was unacceptable!","How was he supposed to live with that?!","“Your Majesty is only thinking about the big picture,” Master Min said indifferently.."]},{"number":4034,"title":"Chapter 4034: What Are You Doing? (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4034: What Are You Doing? (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Dongsang King said dejectedly, “Senior Brother Min, do you think I’m such a coward as well?”","Master Min said indifferently, “Your Majesty is doing this for the greater good.”","The Dongsang King shook his head with a wry smile. After a while, he said quietly, “Emperor Wu has never felt so aggrieved before, has he?”","Master Min didn’t reply.","The Dongsang King didn’t seem to need his reply. He smiled bitterly and said, “If the Dongsang Kingdom hadn’t become so involved with the Dayan Empire, would we... Well, forget about it. I hope we can let it drop.”","The Dongsang King was furious over Night Light’s death, but he could endure it when the throne was concerned.","But...","The Dongsang King thought that he would let the matter drop, but what he didn’t know was that a pair of invisible hands were stirring things up in Donglin City.","It was Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu didn’t expect that someone would see everything she did.","It was Chu Tianxiao.","Chu Tianxiao had noticed Feng Wu because he was living in seclusion in a straw hut. A blurry figure had appeared on the white jade wall in front of his dwelling.","Chu Tianxiao was so shocked that his hand trembled.","He was the most capable swordsman in the world, and of course, he wouldn’t lose his balance. What he saw on the jade wall was the only reason he lost his composure.","Chu Tianxiao had been looking for someone, and that was what his master told him to do before he went missing.","His junior sister.","He didn’t know which family his junior sister was born into, but if she was close enough, he would be able to find some clues on the jade wall.","As expected!","A blurry figure appeared on the wall.","That tall man was her junior sister? That was so...","However, it was still a lead.","Chu Tianxiao was about to start searching when the silhouette on the wall changed again. This time, it was the outline of a teenage girl.","Judging by her body shape, she was nowhere near as stunning as his junior sister back then, but... it was still a lead.","Chu Tianxiao could see what the girl did every day... Yes, he could see it through the jade wall.","However, he couldn’t move a muscle after he saw the image.","“I’m semi-paralyzed. That’s a sign that I’m possessed!” Chu Tianxiao said solemnly.","He couldn’t leave the valley, so he could only sit there and watch the girl on the wall.","The image would change like a camera changing angle.","When the girl was alone, he could see things from her point of view.","When the girl was with other people, he would see an overview.","What Chu Tianxiao saw was that after Feng Wu turned herself into a guard, she snuck into the Jin manor, faked Jing Wei’s death, and then tricked Princess Yan Ling. She then snuck up on Princess Yan Ling.","Chu Tianxiao watched as Feng Wu, a Level-3 Spiritual Saint, made her way through Donglin City, which was filled with capable cultivators. She was able to throw the Dongsang Kingdom into chaos.","“This girl is so...” Chu Tianxiao was speechless. “Is she trying to set the Dongsang Kingdom up?”","At the thought of all the capable cultivators in Donglin City, Chu Tianxiao couldn’t help but worry.","He had forgotten that he was the master teacher of the Dongsang Kingdom.","For the next few days..."]},{"number":4035,"title":"Chapter 4035: It Wasn ‘t Night Light?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4035: It Wasn ‘t Night Light?","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the next few days...","Chu Tianxiao was going to see something amazing.","Of course, that hadn’t happened yet.","Feng Wu followed Princess Yan Ling the whole time.","For some unknown reason, Princess Yan Ling had been treating Feng Wu much better recently. Instead, she had neglected Shijian, who used to be her maid. Hence, Feng Wu could now see how things were going with her directing.","She realized that things had slowed down a little.","After Princess Yan Ling killed Night Light and flaunted her power in front of the Dongsang King, she was taken away by Ma Quanquan.","Feng Wu didn’t know exactly what Ma Quanquan had taught her, but judging from how dispirited Princess Yan Ling was, she suppressed her arrogance.","She didn’t even mention Night Light anymore.","Feng Wu thought to herself, “That won’t do.”","She had come up with a series of traps. What was the point of sticking here? The death of Night Light wouldn’t affect the Dongsang King at all, let alone the entire Dongsang Kingdom.","She had to keep it going until she got Lord Jing, Night Owl, and the Dongsang Kingdom involved. In the end, she might even get her third senior brother involved.","That way, she wouldn’t have to look for her third senior brother and could just meet him.","At that thought, Feng Wu stole a glance at Princess Yan Ling.","Right now, Princess Yan Ling was reclining on a chaise lounge with a look of distaste on her face and a malicious look in her eyes every now and then.","Seeing that Feng Wu had come back with some refreshments, Princess Yan Ling glanced at Feng Wu and said coldly, “Come here!”","Feng Wu carefully walked up to her.","Staring at Feng Wu, Princess Yan Ling snorted. “Do you know why I wanted to kill Night Light?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Princess Yan Ling then asked Shijian, “Do you know?”","Shijian was about to answer when Princess Yan Ling said indifferently, “Shijian, you were on duty outside that day. Tell me in detail. What happened three nights ago?”","Shijian dropped to his knees and looked flustered.","Seeing how flustered she was, Princess Yan Ling frowned. “So, you know?”","Shijian shook her head. “I don’t know. I really don’t...’","Princess Yan Ling said coldly, “Since you know what happened that night, tell me the details. Don’t worry. Not only won’t I kill you, I’ll also reward you.” Shijian shook her head.","Princess Yan Ling suddenly smiled. “Haven’t you been trying to serve my brother? He’s been asking for you as well. Don’t worry. If you help me this time, I’ll take you to him. How does that sound?”","Shijian was elated. She almost asked, “Princess, is that true?” Luckily, she was able to control herself.","However, she couldn’t hide her joy. Therefore, Feng Wu noticed the contemptuous look on Princess Yan Ling’s face.","However, Shijian didn’t see it because she had lowered her head.","Shijian was about to speak when Feng Wu spoke first. “Princess, I have a stomachache and really need to...”","Princess Yan Ling glanced at her and said indifferently, “Alright. Go.” Feng Wu left in a hurry.","Princess Yan Ling looked at the Shijian and said indifferently, “Good. We’re alone now. If you have anything to say, just say it. If you say the wrong thing, I promise you that you won’t be punished.”","Shijian looked at Princess Yan Ling in pleasant surprise. “Princess, are you sure?”","Princess Yan Ling said coldly, “Of course, I am. Have I ever gone back on my words? Plus, my brother likes you so much. Why should I hurt you? You’ll have to work for me after you become his concubine.”","Shijian liked the sound of that. After some thought, she said to Princess Yan Ling, “Yuexin was on duty in the inner room that day, and I was on duty in the outer room.”","Princess Yan Ling nodded.","She had asked Shijian before, but the girl wouldn’t say anything and only said that she didn’t know. Now that Yan Ling had promised to give Shijian to her brother, Shijian could finally tell the truth.","Shijian searched her memory. “I didn’t know what happened in the room, but I saw a figure come back with a sack.”","A ferocious look flickered in Princess Yan Ling’s eyes!","Apart from herself, who else could it be?","Princess Yan Ling stared at Shijian. “Then?!”","Shijian said in a trembling voice, “Then... I didn’t think much of it. I only thought that the person who came back with the sack looked familiar, but I was scared... so I didn’t tell anyone.”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth. “Why didn’t you tell anyone?!”","Shijian said, “If... if that person went out with a sack over his shoulder, I","wouldn’t have kept my silence, but that person came in with something over his shoulder... So I thought that since it wasn’t stealing, I might as well keep it to myself.","“But the next day, Sister Yuexin...” Shijian took a deep breath. “I was so scared that I didn’t dare to say a word... So, I lied to you when you asked me the first time.”","Princess Yan Ling was secretly frustrated.","However, in order to force more truth out of Shijian, Princess Yan Ling fought back her rage and stared at the latter.","“Didn’t you say that the man with the sack looked familiar? Who was he?” That person was the key!","Princess Yan Ling thought to herself, “That person should be on Night Light’s side.”","If that was the case, she would be able to charge Night Light with kidnapping. That way, the Dongsang King wouldn’t have anything to say. At that thought, the listless Princess Yan Ling immediately cheered up.","“Although I still don’t know who he is, I’m good at drawing. I can draw a portrait of him.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Do it!”","She had to have some talent to work for Princess Yan Ling.","In less than five minutes, Shijian had drawn the painting and presented it to Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling narrowed her eyes when she saw the painting.","That man...","Even she found him familiar, let alone the Shijian.","However, she couldn’t remember who it was.","Who was he?","Where had she met him before?","Crossing her hands behind her back, Princess Yan Ling frowned and walked back and forth into the room.","Princess Yan Ling’s eyes suddenly lit up!","She had indeed met him in Night Owl’s manor.","It was him!","Princess Yan Ling immediately locked onto a person.","“He’s a guard of the Jing Manor... Lord Jing has been taking around.” Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth and stared at the Shijian. “Are you sure he’s the one who brought me back?!”","Shijian said in tears, “Princess, I’m telling the truth! I’m telling the truth!”","Princess Yan Ling frowned. “It’s dark and windy, and everyone has to cover their faces when they commit crimes. Why would someone show their face?”","Shijian said, “Princess, the person indeed had a black scarf over his face, but Master Ma arrived in time, and that man panicked. When he jumped over a tree branch, he accidentally lifted the scarf, so I saw his face.”","“What a coincidence.” Princess Yan Ling frowned.","Seeing that Princess Yan Ling was suspicious, Shijian burst into tears. “Princess, I’m telling the truth.”","Princess Yan Ling was neither angry nor anxious. She only said indifferently, “I hope that’s the case as well. If you can prove that you’re telling the truth, I’ll reward you.”","Shijian said, “I still remember which tree. Shall I show you there? Maybe I can detect something on that branch.” Princess Yan Ling said, “Lead the way.”","Soon, Shijian led Princess Yan Ling to an old tree that was so thick that ten people could wrap their arms around it.","“Princess, it’s this tree,” Shijian said matter-of-factly.","Princess Yan Ling examined the tree carefully. At first, she couldn’t find anything, but soon, she spotted a footprint.","It was a man’s footprint.","“Wait a minute..”"]},{"number":4036,"title":"Chapter 4036: Guilty Conscience","paragraphs":["Chapter 4036: Guilty Conscience","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling saw a piece of black cloth hanging on a branch. It was obvious from the man’s clothes.","She picked it up and sniffed it.","Other people wouldn’t be able to smell it, but Princess Yan Ling had a very sharp nose!","Just like what Mr. Sakiya said, she had a sharper nose than anyone else.","“It was him!” Princess Yan Ling’s pupils contracted, and she was furious!","Lord Jing’s guards had kidnapped her!","While Grandpa Ma was away on some errand?!","The more Princess Yan Ling thought about it, the more likely it seemed.","Who was Princess Yan Ling? She was the fiend that would kill the second prince, Night Light, and all his servants in a fit of rage. Of course, she wouldn’t let anyone lie to her, set her up, or use her!","“To the Jing Manor!”","Princess Yan Ling jumped onto her horse first and headed for the Jing Manor.","As Princess Yan Ling’s favorite minion at the moment, Feng Wu had to follow her everywhere. Hence, she jumped onto her horse and went along to watch the show as well.","As the horses galloped along, Princess Yan Ling’s train of thought became clearer and clearer.","It had to be Lord Jing!","She had only threatened him, but he had done such a thing to her! Not only had he humiliated her, but he had also used her to destroy Night Light!","Night Light was Night Owl’s archenemy.","Lord Jing!","The more Princess Yan Ling thought about it, the angrier she became. She cracked her whip!","Soon, Princess Yan Ling arrived at Lord Jing’s residence with a group of people.","She didn’t stop at the door. Instead, she ran straight into the manor.","The concierge had met Princess Yan Ling before and recognized her right away.","He shot warning glances at the others, telling them to report to the lord as soon as possible. He then said to Princess Yan Ling, “Princess, the horses can’t gallop into the manor. Please get off!”","However, Princess Yan Ling was too angry to care about anything else. She raised her whip.","Poor man. He only said one sentence before he was whipped up and sent flying into the air!","Other people would be injured at most.","They were right outside the main gate, and the crowd was so dense that everyone would notice it.","The people on the street were shocked, and the news soon spread out.","Princess Yan Ling used to be so arrogant that she didn’t care about the consequences at all. She rushed into the manor.","She would run into anyone she met.","If anyone tried to stop her, she would whip them.","All hell broke loose in the Jing Manor, and people kept calling for help. Lady Jing and her son received the news as well and were on their way.","As for Lord Jing...","He wasn’t home.","To be more precise, Lord Jing had arrived at Night Owl’s residence through the secret passageway and was drinking with Night Owl.","Lord Jing said, “Princess Yan Ling is such a fool. She actually helped us kill your brother.”","Night Owl gloated as well. “That’s right. She was quite rough.”","Lord Jing added, “Now that we have something on her, we don’t have to worry about her.”","Night Owl said, “But she knows our secret. After all, it’s a threat. Who knows when she’ll lose her mind? If she tells other people about it, we’ll...”","Lord Jing said confidently, “She has killed the second prince. What else can she do? Don’t worry. She won’t.”","They were still talking excitedly about the second prince’s death when Gong Ming, Night Owl’s personal guard, came in. “Your Royal Highness, something’s wrong.”","Night Owl frowned. “What is it?”","Gong Ming said, “Princess Yan Ling has broken into the Jing Manor like a crazy person and is killing innocent people!” WHAT?!","Lord Jing dropped his wine glass.","He had just said that Princess Yan Ling wouldn’t lose her mind, but... “Why is she out of control again?!” Lord Jing’s face was livid.","“Let’s go have a look!” Night Owl urged Lord Jing.","Lord Jing told Night Owl, “Go ask His Majesty for help. That crazy woman has Ma Quanquan with her. We’ll be at a disadvantage if we fight her! Go get Master Min !","“Yes!”","Night Owl jumped onto his horse and rode toward the imperial palace.","Meanwhile...","Lord Jing went into the secret tunnel and soon returned to the Jing Manor. Someone was banging on the door when he walked into the study.","“My lord! My lord!”","It was Jing Jia, his guard.","Lord Jing opened the door as if he had just finished cultivating.","Jing Jia said anxiously, “My lord, Princess Yan Ling has lost her mind. She’s been asking for you, but you haven’t shown up, so she said that she would kill a person every three minutes, starting from Lady Jing and the young prince...”","Lord Jing blanched.","“Where is she?!”","Jing Jia immediately took Lord Jing there.","When he arrived at the main hall, he saw Princess Yan Ling holding a dagger and gesturing at the young prince’s neck.","The younger prince rolled his eyes and almost fainted.","Princess Yan Ling sneered at the chubby little boy. “After you die, even if you turn into a ghost, you can’t blame me. Your father is to be blamed!”","His voice was hoarse from all the crying, and he couldn’t make a sound. All he could do was tremble, and his eyes were filled with fear.","“Die!”","Princess Yan Ling was about to stab the young prince in the throat. “No!” Lady Jing tried to rush over, but Princess Yan Ling kicked her away.","“Stop!”","Entering the room, Lord Jing glared at Princess Yan Ling and bellowed, “What’s wrong with you?! Stop it!”","It was a mess.","Members of the Jin Manor were scattered all over the ground.","Many of them were barely breathing and were almost dead.","Seeing this, Lord Jing wanted to cut Princess Yan Ling into a thousand pieces.","Princess Yan Ling turned around and smirked when she saw Lord Jing. “Why, I thought you wouldn’t come out. I didn’t expect to see you here.” After that, she threw the scared prince on the ground.","Ignoring the pain, the boy hid behind his father.","He stared at Princess Yan Ling with a venomous look in his eyes.","Princess Yan Ling couldn’t care less what the brat thought. She only stared at","Lord Jin and said, “Since the master is here, you people can leave now.”","After throwing the Jing Manor into chaos, Princess Yan Ling had calmed down a little.","However, once she calmed down, she would be the most difficult to handle. Lord Jing didn’t want his secret to get out, so he waved at them. “You guys can leave now.”","Lady Jing couldn’t wait to see that happen, so she led the young prince and his servants out of the room.","Feng Wu didn’t dare linger in such a dangerous place, so she followed the crowd out.","Soon, Princess Yan Ling and Lord Jin were the only ones left in the main hall.","Lord Jing stared at Princess Yan Ling and asked coldly, “Princess Yan Ling, what’s this about?”","Princess Yanling sneered at him. “What’s it about? Can’t you tell?!”","Lord Jing said angrily, “I saw Princess Yan Ling charge into the manor and beat up many people. As for why... I have no idea. I’ll need an explanation from you, Princess Yan Ling, or I’m afraid it won’t be settled.”","“Hahahaha!”","Princess Yan Ling guffawed. “It won’t be settled? Hahaha! I’m sorry, but do you think I’m going to let you do whatever you want?!”","“Princess, what did you say?” Lord Jing stared at her. “How many people have you killed?!”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Tell me, then. Why did I kill them?” Lord Jing gritted his teeth.. “Princess, why did you want to kill them?!”"]},{"number":4037,"title":"Chapter 4037: I Know Everything!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4037: I Know Everything!","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Don’t you know?” Lord Jing asked, “Why should I?”","Princess Yan Ling sneered at Lord Jing. There was anger, mockery, and utter contempt in her eyes.","Under Princess Yan Ling’s intimidating gaze, Lord Jing felt a little guilty...","However, when he looked up and saw Princess Yan Ling’s undisguised contempt, he flared up.","“I really can’t remember when I offended you to make you take revenge like this. In that case, how about we go to His Majesty and reason with him?”","Princess Yan Ling had just destroyed the second prince’s residence the day before. Was she really going to destroy the Jing Manor now? Even if she wanted to do that, Ma Quanquan would stop her.","He thought that Princess Yan Ling would be stopped by that, but as soon as he said those words, Princess Yan Ling smirked.","Princess Yan Ling said, “Lord Jing, I see that I’ve been too polite to you. How dare you be so arrogant in front of me? You’re inverting justice!”","Lord Jing frowned.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “If you want to talk to His Majesty so badly, I’ll go with you. Let’s go!”","She then turned to leave.","That righteous tone frightened Lord Jing.","He didn’t move.","Princess Yan Ling turned around and gave him a taunting look. ‘What? Lord","Jing, are you afraid to go?”","Lord Jing gritted his teeth. “Why should I? I’m leaving!”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “Why not? I’d like to know why! How dare you do such a thing to me! Fine! Fine!”","The look made Lord Jing uneasy. “Princess, I have no idea what you’re talking about!”","Instead of following his lead, Princess Yan Ling asked, “Don’t you have a guard? What’s his name? Jing Wei?”","Those words scared the wits out of Lord Jing.","How did Princess Yan Ling know about Jing Wei?","Lord Jing forced himself to calm down and said indifferently, “I do. Princess, what do you want?”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth. “Bring him here! ”","Lord Jing shook his head. “I don’t think that’ll work.”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Lord Jing and asked aggressively, “Why not?”","Lord Jing smiled in pity. “Princess, that guard... Well, he had an accident during his cultivation and died because of his cultivation deviation.” Princess Yan Ling stared at Lord Jin with a livid face.","Lord Jing only smiled innocently, as if he felt sorry for Jing Wei.","He even asked, “Princess, did this guard offend you?","“Sigh. Ever since his cultivation went berserk, he was delirious and couldn’t control his behavior. If he does anything to offend you, please forgive him for the sake of his death.”","Princess Yan Ling was so frustrated!","Lord Jing’s attitude infuriated Princess Yanling even more.","She stared at Lord Jing. “Did you kill him to silence him?”","Lord Jing’s stomach lurched.","From what Princess Yan Ling said, Lord Jing was certain that she knew what had happened.","Lord Jing’s mind went blank.","How did Princess Yan Ling know about this?","How much did she know?","What evidence did she have?","However, Lord Jing was as experienced as he was said to be. He calmed down almost right away_ and his face went hack tn normal","Lord Jing looked calmly at Princess Yan Ling and even smiled a little.","Lord Jing asked, “Princess, are you making things up?”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth. “You’re so scheming. Not only did you kill him to silence him, but you’ve also made it impossible for me to find any evidence.","“Even if I find the evidence, you can still insist that the guard did it and that you had nothing to do with it. You made sure it would never be traced back to you!","“If I insist on getting to the bottom of it, there’ll be no witness, and the dead have to be respected!","“I can’t say for sure. In the end, I’m going to be accused of being arrogant and despotic!","“Lord Jing, you’re so cunning!”","In a few words, Princess Yan Ling had figured out Lord Jing’s plan.","Lord Jing wasn’t offended by the fact that Feng Wu had seen through his plan. He only pretended to be innocent.","“I really don’t know what you’re talking about. Please leave. Don’t make a scene. I’ll pretend it never happened.","“Princess, what happened in the second prince’s residence yesterday has already blown up, His Majesty is having a headache over it,","“Everyone has a temper, and so does a kingdom. Princess, you’re so aggressive. I don’t think it’s the attitude of the Dayan Empire.","“Once His Majesty is really angry, he’ll send a letter to the empire. I don’t think it’ll do you any good.","“Princess, please respect yourself!”","The Dongsang King indeed had a way to deliver the news to Dayan, which was left behind by the emissary in case of emergencies.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “As expected of the father of the crown prince.","Impressive!”","She headed for the door after that.","The mention of the secret made the usually calm Lord Jing panic a little.","“Where are you going?!” He grabbed Princess Yan Ling’s sleeve.","Princess Yan Ling said, “Go to court!”","Those words were so lethal to Lord Jing that he glared at Princess Yan Ling. “Why do you want to go to court?!”","Princess Yan Ling turned around and gave him a taunting look. “Since Lord Jing insists on being innocent, I’ll tell His Majesty a story from 18 years ago!” Lord Jing panicked a little.","He smiled obsequiously at Princess Yan Ling. “There’s nothing to tell. Princess, please take a seat. Let’s talk.”","Princess Yan Ling sneered at Lord Jin. “If that’s the case, Lord Jing, please hand it over.”","“What is it?” Lord Jin asked innocently.","Princess Yan Ling narrowed her eyes.","She had been defeated by Lord Jing once, and she wouldn’t let it happen again.","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Lord Jing, you have the wrong attitude.”","Lord Jing smiled bitterly. “I really...’","Princess Yan Ling rose to her feet.","Lord Jing grabbed her sleeve. “It’s just that Prince Night Light has indeed sent me an object.”","Of course, he wouldn’t let Princess Yan Ling do whatever she wanted, so he began to take the initiative.","Princess Yan Ling turned around and stared at him with cold eyes.","He took out a Spiritual Fossil Stone and handed it to her.."]},{"number":4038,"title":"Chapter 4038: She’s Going to Tell","paragraphs":["Chapter 4038: She’s Going to Tell","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This Spiritual Fossil Stone...","Princess Yan Ling’s face darkened.","She was so familiar with this stone!","She had taken a Spiritual Fossil Stone from the second prince, and what did he say? He would put it in his sleeve and play with it every now and then.","That idea disgusted Princess Yan Ling.","However, she still hoped that the record wasn’t what she had expected. However, when Princess Yan Ling activated the Spiritual Fossil Stone, one look and she knew what had happened. Damn it!","Princess Yan Ling slapped Lord Jing.","However, Lord Jin was much more powerful than her and had a much better defense. As a result, Princess Yan Ling’s hands turned red from the impact, but Lord Jing remained unscathed.","“You’re shameless!” Princess Yan Ling bellowed.","Lord Jing smirked. “Would you believe me if I told you that Prince Night Light sent me the Spiritual Fossil Stone?”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “I know perfectly well that your guard took me away when Grandpa Ma wasn’t around. You set Night Light up, didn’t you?!”","Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t admit it. He smiled and said, “Princess, I’m afraid you think too highly of me.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “I don’t care if you did it or not. I’m going to tell the Dongsang King about you and Night Owl. You’re all going to die!”","Lord Jing said, “Princess, wait.”","But Princess Yan Ling didn’t stop. She was determined to leave.","Behind her, she heard Lord Jing’s taunting voice. “Princess, do you think that there’s only one such Spiritual Fossil Stone in the world?”","Holding the Spiritual Fossil Stone, Princess Yan Ling stared at Lord Jing. “What did you say?”","Lord Jin g chuckled. “Princess, you brought us ten Spiritual Fossil Stones. His","Majesty has three, and the remaining seven...”","Princess Yan Ling said, “You’re shameless!”","Lord Jing chuckled. “If I don’t keep some cards up my sleeves, I’ll have to do whatever you say. Am I right, Princess?”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Lord Jing. ‘You kidnapped me, dragged Night Light into this, and tricked me into killing him. Now that you have my Spiritual Fossil Stone, aren’t you afraid that I’ll ask Grandpa Ma to kill you?”","Lord Jing smiled again, but the smile didn’t reach his eyes, and there was a threatening look in his eyes. “Princess, if you don’t mind these Spiritual Fossil Stones being watched by all the people of Donglin City...”","Princess Yan Ling was furious. “You!”","Lord Jing smiled at her. “Now that things have come to this, Princess Yan Ling, please don’t be mad at me. It’s so boring. Why don’t we sit down and talk it over?”","Princess Yan Ling asked, “How do you want to do that?!”","Lord Jing smiled and said, “It’s very simple. Now that you have something on me, and I have something on you, why don’t we pretend that nothing happened and keep it to ourselves?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “In your dreams!”","Lord Jing said, “If that’s the case, you can go to His Majesty and make a scene, while I’ll show the entire city what’s recorded in the stone.”","Princess Yan Ling glared at him. “Go to hell!”","Lord Jing shrugged. “What do you think, then?”","Princess Yan Ling jumped to her feet and glared at Lord Jing. “Remember this!","I’ll never let you off the hook! Never!”","After saying those words, Princess Yan Ling cracked her whip and left!","Naturally, Feng Wu left with Princess Yan Ling.","“Is she really not going to tell anyone?” Night Owl stood behind Lord Jing and looked worried.","Lord Jing said, “Not for now, but she will one day.”","Night Owl narrowed his eyes. “When will that happen?”","Lord Jing said, “After the second batch of reinforcements arrives from Dayan.”","Right now, Princess Yan Ling had a peak Spiritual Saint with her, and the other one was roaming the continent, looking for something. She didn’t have enough manpower, so she had to live with it.","However, when the second wave of reinforcements arrived, things would become much more complicated.","“What should I do now?” Night Owl asked anxiously.","Lord Jing made a throat-slitting gesture.","“You...” Night Owl stared at Lord Jing. He didn’t expect the latter to be so relentless.","Night Owl had killed quite a few people over the years, but Princess Yan Ling was backed by Lord Yan and the Dayan Empire. The consequence was very severe.","“We have to get rid of her once and for all.” Lord Jing stared at Night Owl. “She can expose your secret at any moment. I’ve talked to her. I know she doesn’t care about anything when she loses control!","“Although I’ve temporarily restrained her with the Spiritual Fossil Stone, she’s too arrogant and willful. After what she has gone through, she has to take her revenge.","“What will the king do if she tells other people? We’ll both die!","“Princess Yan Ling has to die, and so does the king!”","“How do we kill the king and Princess Yan Ling without incriminating ourselves? It’s easy!”","Lord Jing smirked. “That’s to make the king Princess Yan Ling’s murderer.” “But my father won’t kill Princess Yan Ling,” Night Owl said with a frown. Lord Jing nodded. “That’s true, but we have to make him the scapegoat.”","Night Owl stared at him. “Do you have a plan?”","Lord Jing nodded. “The plan is taking shape, and we still need to perfect the details. So, let her live a little longer.”","What they didn’t know was that a little bird had heard their conversation again.","It was none other than Little Phoenix.","When Little Phoenix sent the message to Feng Wu, Feng Wu couldn’t help but give Lord Jing a thumbs up. What a capable man. He was even trying to frame the Dongsang King.","But she was looking forward to it.","As long as the Dongsang Kingdom was in disarray, they wouldn’t have the energy to bother the Junwu Empire. This would be the best time for the empire to improve its capability.","Feng Wu didn’t do it for nothing. Apart from working on important figures like Lord Jing, Princess Yan Ling, Night Owl, and Night Light, she was also in charge of moving the supplies.","Such as Night Light’s stuff.","Night Light’s manor had been destroyed by a fire, and Feng Wu was the one who had taken all the treasures.","The Dongsang Kingdom was rich in resources, and with the support of the","Dayan Empire, the second prince had a lot of good stuff in his residence. Feng","Wu put them all in her ring and waited to take them back to the Junwu Empire.."]},{"number":4039,"title":"Chapter 4039: Step by Step","paragraphs":["Chapter 4039: Step by Step","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Not only did Feng Wu take all the wealth of Night Light, but she also took a lot of the treasures of the Jing Manor.","Feng Wu had made up her mind that after Lord Jing and Night Owl fell, all their things would be hers.","As for the research and development departments of the Dongsang Kingdom...","Feng Wu would sneak in whenever she found a chance. She took stuff when no one was looking and left a bloody handprint behind.","So far, the Dongsang Kingdom was still investigating the handprint, and no one knew that Feng Wu had done it.","Sometimes when Feng Wu was too busy, she would let Little Phoenix do it.","What was better about Little Phoenix was that it had an invisibility skill, which enabled it to succeed every single time. Moreover, it was out of reach, and the incidents had been reported to the Dongsang King, who had handed it over to Night Owl, the crown prince.","Night Owl was too busy trying to kill Yan Ling to keep his secret and to kill the Dongsang King to take the throne. He couldn’t care less about such petty things. Therefore, the incident was put on hold for the time being.","Feng Wu followed Princess Yan Ling back home.","Princess Yan Ling was so angry that she wanted to hit someone. Seeing the look on Princess Yan Ling’s face, Feng Wu immediately told her that she wasn’t feeling well and needed to go to the toilet. Hence, she pushed Shijian toward Yan Ling.","Shijian was indeed arrogant in front of Feng Wu, but she didn’t dare to utter a word in front of Princess Yan Ling and had to go in to serve her.","But Princess Yan Ling was still angry, so she whipped Shijian until she was covered in blood.","“Get her out of here!” Princess Yan Ling bellowed.","rlWvo people quickly came in and carried Shijian out.","“Xingxiang, come in!” Princess Yan Ling bellowed.","Feng Wu had no choice but to walk in slowly.","Holding her whip, Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu with a brooding look in her eyes, as if she was going to explode at any moment.","Feng Wu spoke first before Princess Yan Ling lost her temper. “Princess, did the Dongsang Kingdom pick on you? I don’t think there’s a good person in the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Princess Yan Ling hated the Dongsang Kingdom at the moment, but she couldn’t tell her maid that she had been recorded, which was why she was so flustered. Now that Feng Wu was complaining about the Dongsang Kingdom, she liked Feng Wu a lot more.","Feng Wu was very good at reading faces. She saw Princess Yan Ling seemed a little relaxed, so she said, “Night Light offended you first, and then Lord Jing offended you. Doesn’t that mean that there’s still the crown prince and the others? How are we supposed to stay in the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu. “You’re not a member of the Dayan","Empire. You’re from the Dongsang Kingdom. How can you speak up for me? You’re betraying the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Feng Wu said in a hurry, “From the moment His Majesty gave this manor to you, I’m yours. Since you’re a member of the Dayan Empire, so am I. I’m loyal to you.”","Princess Yan Ling asked, “How can I trust you?”","Feng Wu said, “Princess, I’ll do anything for you.”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “What if I give you to ten strong men?","Damn it! Feng Wu cursed inwardly, but she only smiled bitterly. “I’m sure you won’t do that, princess, because you’re the kindest person and you care about your servants the most...”","Feng Wu was very good at singing praises.","Hearing Feng Wu’s compliment, Princess Yan Ling forgot about her evil plan. She stared at Feng Wu and asked, “What do you think I should do now?” Feng Wu hesitated and didn’t say anything.","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Feng Wu and snorted. “You followed me to the second prince’s manor and then to the Jing manor. Of course, you know what happened to me!”","Feng Wu looked panicked. “...Princess, please forgive me.”","Princess Yan Ling glanced at Feng Wu. “If you can come up with something nice, not only will I forgive you, but I’ll also reward you. But if you can’t, I’m going to kill you, too! Speak!”","As she spoke, Princess Yan Ling exerted her formidable energy.","Feng Wu said, “Actually, I do have an idea. Princess, you can go to His Royal Highness.”","“Night Owl? Why do I need him?”","Feng Wu had a plan. Princess Yan Ling might seem to be forcing her, but in fact, Feng Wu had everything under control.","Feng Wu’s acting was so amazing that Princess Yan Ling thought that she was the winner.","Feng Wu said quietly, “Lord Jing and Night Owl are working together against you. Princess, haven’t you thought about splitting them up? Or even killing him with a borrowed knife?”","As smart as Princess Yan Ling was, she immediately said, “Are you saying that we should separate Night Owl from Lord Jing and use Night Owl to kill Lord Jing?","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. Night Owl and Lord Jing have always been good friends. If Lord Jing finds out that Night Owl did it, he’ll be the most upset.”","Princess Yan Ling thought to herself, “It’ll be worse than death because Lord","Jing is Night Owl’s father!”","“That’ll be great news!” The thought of Night Owl killing Lord Jing excited Princess Yan Ling. She stared at Feng Wu in excitement.","Princess Yan Ling said, “It’s just that Lord Jing and Night Owl are closer than you can imagine. They’re as close as father and son. How can they turn against each other?”","Feng Wu chuckled. “They didn’t fall out because you haven’t tempted them enough. With enough temptation, of course, they’ll fall out.” Princess Yan Ling said, “They’re father and son! They both know that!” Feng Wu seemed frightened by the news.","Princess Yan Ling sneered at Feng Wu. “Now you know that they won’t turn against each other.”","Feng Wu acted as if she had digested the information and shook her head at Princess Yan Ling. “But why are they so sure that they’re father and son? Even if that’s the case, what if they aren’t? Even if they are, we can still make up the evidence to say otherwise. Can’t we accuse Lord Jing of falsifying the evidence so that the crown prince would believe that they’re father and son? That way, wouldn’t the crown prince hate Lord Jing? Wouldn’t they turn against each other?”","Princess Yan Ling gave Feng Wu an indescribable look.","Feng Wu said, “Princess...”","Princess Yan Ling suddenly reached out, patted Feng Wu on the shoulder, and smiled.. “You’re really my lucky star! That’s a great angle! I need to study it!","Night Owl’s mother is the current queen...”"]},{"number":4040,"title":"Chapter 4040: Dark, Windy Night","paragraphs":["Chapter 4040: Dark, Windy Night","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I can make an issue of something from the queen, and Lord Jing won’t be able to escape. I can then tell Night Owl that I’m the one who can work with him, and I can even marry him!”","To defeat Lord Jing, Princess Yan Ling had worked very hard.","There was no time to waste. Since they were going to drive a wedge between Lord Jing and Night Owl, they had to start right away.","Feng Wu didn’t know what Princess Yan Ling did, but she knew that Yan Ling had gone to negotiate with Night Owl, and Little Phoenix, who was hiding in Night Owl’s residence, told Feng Wu everything.","That was right. Little Phoenix had been staying in Night Owl’s manor these days, for Lord Jing would visit every now and then. The two of them hid in a secret room and talked among themselves, trying to come up with a plan to deal with Princess Yan Ling.","After the Dongsang King learned what had happened in the Jing Manor, he summoned Lord Jing.","Seeing Lord Jing, the Dongsang King asked with a frown, “Why is Princess Yan Ling attacking you again? What’s going on? Did you offend her?” Of course, Lord Jing wouldn’t admit his crime.","He looked like he had been wronged. “Your Majesty, please help me.”","The Dongsang King had a headache.","He loved it when the people of the Dongsang Kingdom didn’t have any conflict with Princess Yan Ling, the Dayan Empire’s ambassador, so that she could stay safe and sound until the second batch of reinforcements arrived.","As it turned out, the Jing manor was in trouble again in such a short time!","“What’s going on?!” The Dongsang King stared at Lord Jing.","Tears welled up in Lord Jing’s eyes, and he was sobbing. He looked so aggrieved.","“Your Majesty, it has something to do with Night Light.","“Princess Yan Ling didn’t like Night Light, to begin with, so she made up a random accusation, saying that he peeped when Princess Yan Ling was bathing, and she killed Night Light because of it.”","Lord Jing stole a glance at the Dongsang King. As expected, the emperor’s face was livid.","“And then?!” Dongsang King’s face darkened.","Lord Jing wiped his tears and said, “Then, Princess Yan Ling showed up out of nowhere. She said...","Dongsang King asked angrily, “What did she say?","Lord Jing looked terrified. “She said... she said that Your Majesty was too disobedient...","“How dare she!”","Before Lord Jing could finish, the eunuch next to the Dongsang King bellowed.","How dare she say that His Majesty was disobedient? That was so offensive!","Lord Jing prostrated on the ground and said loudly, “That was what I told her, but she said that the Dongsang Kingdom was only a parasitic seed of the Dayan Empire. His Majesty was disobedient, and she was displeased on behalf of the empire...”","Lord Jing looked like he wanted to say something but hesitated. He noticed that the Dongsang King’s face was livid as if he was going to explocle at any moment.","“Keep talking!” The Dongsang King pointed at Lord Jing. “Tell me everything she said!”","“Yes...”","Lord Jing said, “She said Your Majesty was too disobedient and opinionated. You’re not the ruler of the Dongsang Kingdom that the Dayan Empire wants.","so...","The Dongsang King drew in his breath.","He glared at Lord Jing.","His eyes were as sharp as blades.","He wanted to cut Lord Jing open.","Lord Jing didn’t try to dodge the Dongsang King’s glare. He knew that if he tried to dodge now, it would mean that he had a guilty conscience, and the Dongsang King would be suspicious.","He and Night Owl had carefully thought through many details. They were sure that they could win this battle.","As expected, the Dongsang King believed Lord Jing when he saw that he wasn’t looking away.","But deep down, he was in so much pain.","He had given in to Princess Yan Ling. He had even tolerated the fact that his own son had been killed... But Princess Yan Ling was still accusing him of being disobedient?!","The Dongsang King didn’t believe Lord Jing right away and said angrily, “One more lie and I’ll cut you into little pieces!”","Lord Jing kowtowed and said, ‘Your Majesty, of course, I’m telling the truth. I’m telling the truth. If not, Your Majesty can take the head of my entire family.”","Hearing that, the Dongsang King slumped back in his chair, and his face was filled with anger, disappointment, and frustration.","“Your Majesty... Princess Yan Ling is going to replace you!” Seeing this, Lord Jing tried to appease the Dongsang King.","“If she has come to me, she must have gone to someone else!","“She’s going to replace you now. Your Majesty, you have to reconsider!”","The Dongsang King was so frustrated that he threw a dirty look at Lord Jing. “I’ll talk to Princess Yan Ling myself. If you’re not telling the truth, I won’t forgive you. If you are, I won’t mistreat you either. You can leave now.”","Lord Jing grew up with the Dongsang King, and he was the only royal lord with a different surname. That was to say, the Dongsang King was very kind to him.","However, the Dongsang King was so frustrated that he needed to think straight.","Lord Jing knew that he had laid the groundwork, and it was Night Owl’s turn now. Hence, he said, ‘Your Majesty, you’ve given me all the glory and wealth I’ve enjoyed over the years. Even if everyone is against you, Ziqi will still be on your side.”","Ziqi was the name of Lord Jing.","Only then did Lord Jing leave the room.","As soon as Lord Jing left, the Dongsang King turned to his most trusted eunuch.","“Dabang, do you think Lord Jing can be trusted?”","Liu Dabang, the head eunuch, had been with the Dongsang King since he was little, so the Dongsang King trusted him.","Liu Dabang said, “I think there’s some truth in Lord Jing’s words, but it may not be the whole truth... But I’m sure that he wants Princess Yan Ling dead.”","The Dongsang King asked, “Really?”","Liu Dabang said, “Princess Yan Ling charged into the Jing Manor. If Lord Jing hadn’t intervened in time, the Jing Manor would probably end up like Prince Night Light’s manor.","The Dongsang King smacked the table. “How dare she?!”","Liu said solemnly, “Your Majesty, have you noticed the marks on Lord Jing’s face? Princess Yan Ling must have done it.”","Poor Princess Yan Ling. She had whipped quite a few people but never hit Lord Jing in the face. This time, it was all Lord Jing’s doing.","Liu Dabang said, “Princess Yan Ling is too presumptuous. She has no respect for the Dongsang Kingdom.."]},{"number":4041,"title":"Chapter 4041: Night of the Murder","paragraphs":["Chapter 4041: Night of the Murder","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Liu Dabang said, “If she treats Your Majesty that way, she can do whatever she wants to everyone else in the kingdom. To Princess Yan Ling, maybe Lord Jing is worse than a dog.”","“Damn it! Damn it!” Recalling how disrespectful Princess Yan Ling had been to him, the Dongsang King was furious.","Liu said, “So, it’s true that Lord Jing hates Princess Yan Ling. As for what Princess Yan Ling said about you being disobedient... I’m afraid we’ll have to look into it. ”","Dongsang King nodded. He wasn’t the type to trust Lord Jing unconditionally.","“Summon the crown prince.” The Dongsang King smirked. “According to what Lord Jing said, Princess Yan Ling failed to conspire with him and was angry. However, she has the perfect potential partner. Of course, she would go to him!”","It was Night Owl, the crown prince.","Since she wanted to replace the king, Night Owl would be the first partner Princess Yan Ling would work with,","Liu nodded with a smile. “Your Majesty, you’re so wise!”","The Dongsang King waved his hand, still feeling sad.","Because it was a losing battle.","If he could prove that what Lord Jing said was true, then Princess Yan Ling would make up her mind to replace him. What other choice did he have? Of course, she wouldn’t let him abdicate. Death from some illness would be the best option.","If he could prove that Lord Jing was lying, he would be so disappointed that his best friend had betrayed him.","The Dongsang King believed Lord Jing, but he also hoped that the latter was telling the truth.","Human nature was so complicated.","Night Owl was in his residence, and soon, Liu Dabang came to fetch him.","Seeing Liu, Night Owl sighed inwardly. His father was indeed the best strategist in the world. He had planned everything perfectly.","Night Owl looked like he was going out as well.","“Master Liu!”","Night Owl asked loudly, “What are you doing here?”","Master Liu was confused. “Your Royal Highness, are you going out in the middle of the night?”","Night Owl nodded. “I need to go to court.”","Master Liu asked, “What’s the matter? Can’t it wait until tomorrow?”","Night Owl said anxiously, “This is a serious matter, and the entire Dongsang Kingdom is at stake. I can’t wait any longer. I have to go to court now. By the way, Master Liu, you’re...”","Master Liu immediately changed his wording. “His Majesty cares about Your","Royal Highness, so he sent me here to see if you’re doing well.”","Night Owl pleaded, “Let’s put that aside for now. Master Liu, can you take me to His Majesty?”","Night Owl sounded quite sincere.","Eunuch Liu seemed troubled, but he nodded in the end.","He couldn’t let the crown prince know that he had been sent by His Majesty to fetch him.","In the palace.","“Father!” Night Owl dropped to his knees as soon as he saw the Dongsang King.","“Father, I’m sorry. Please punish me!”","Emperor Wu stared at Night Owl. “What did you do?”","Night Owl said, “I... I... I didn’t know that Princess Yan Ling would come to me and say such things. Father, I have no ill intentions!”","The Dongsang King stared at Master Liu and wondered if he had revealed the secret.","Master Liu shook his head.","Only then did the Dongsang King look at Night Owl again and say coldly, ‘What did Princess Yan Ling say to scare you so much? You’re the crown prince, so you should be more level-headed.”","Night Owl said between broken sobs, “Father, I can’t stay calm this time! Princess Yan Ling is a usurper!” Thump!","The Dongsang King dropped his teacup.","“What did you say?!” The King walked up to Night Owl and stared at him. “Say that again!”","Night Owl cried as if he was scared out of his wits.","“Father, Princess Yan Ling has lost her mind! She’s insane! I’m not on friendly terms with her! I’ll never be in cahoots with her! I...","Seeing that Night Owl was eager to clear his name, the Dongsang King waved his hand. “I believe you’re innocent. Tell me what Princess Yan Ling told you.”","Night Owl said, “Father, Princess Yan Ling said... She accused you of not being qualified to be the king. She said that she was going to write a letter to her father and ask him to let her find a new king. That person she was talking about was me...","“Your Majesty, you’re like a god to me. You were the one who taught me when I was little. The throne can’t change that.","“Princess Yan Ling also threatened me. If I don’t agree, she’ll find someone else to be the king, or even herself. As for me... Since she can kill my brother, it’ll be a piece of cake for her to kill me.”","“How dare she?!” The Dongsang King bellowed.","Before, he only believed 30% of what Lord Jing said, but now, he was 50% convinced.","Night Owl had practiced his act with Lord Jing. He said in a sad voice, “Father, she really said that. She really threatened me... Father, what should I do? I don’t want to die.”","The Dongsang King took a deep breath. “Don’t worry. I won’t let you die.","“But I’ll summon Princess Yan Ling to see what she wants!”","So, he was going to confront Princess Yan Ling?","He would be able to tell who was telling the truth.","Night Owl couldn’t help but compliment Lord Jing in his head. Meanwhile, he said, “Father, if we bring Princess Yan Ling here, you’ll alert her immediately!”","The Dongsang King gave Night Owl a suspicious look. He wouldn’t let Princess Yan Ling come? Was the crown prince lying?","Night Owl saw the suspicion in the Dongsang King’s eyes, but he was prepared for it.","“Father, when Princess Yan Ling came to see me, I was worried that she would try to harm me, so I used the Spiritual Fossil Stone. That was why I recorded everything Princess Yan Ling said when she came to see me. Father, please have a look.”","Was that even possible?","The Dongsang King took the Spiritual Fossil Stone and saw what was inside.","Princess Yan Ling had indeed proposed to work with Night Owl to remove the king from the throne.","There wasn’t much footage, but it was enough to make the Dongsang King furious.","What the Dongsang King didn’t know was..."]},{"number":4042,"title":"Chapter 4042: Everything Is Ready","paragraphs":["Chapter 4042: Everything Is Ready","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Night Owl had tampered with the recording. It used to contain information about Night Owl’s father, but it had long been edited out.","“I can’t believe it. How could she...” The Dongsang King was genuinely angry.","He had thought that he had compromised enough with Princess Yan Ling, but she still wanted him dead!","Did she want to find a new king just because she had the power?","The Dongsang King stared at Night Owl.","Night Owl felt a chill run down his spine when he saw the look in Dongsang King’s eyes. Kneeling on the ground, he said, “Father, I’m loyal to you! Why would I come here to tell you all this if I’m not loyal? And why did I record the Spiritual Fossil Stone in advance? If that was the case, I would have gone to plan it with Princess Yan Ling. Why would I come here to tell you now?”","Dongsang King nodded inwardly. The crown prince had a point. He wasn’t plotting against his father.","If he really wanted to work with Princess Yan Ling, who had Lord Yan behind her, there was a high chance that he would become the new king.","Poor Dongsang King. He had no idea what the crown prince was up to. He was trying to make Dongsang King the scapegoat.","The Dongsang King was as experienced as he was said to be. He only took a few deep breaths before he calmed down.","“What do you think we should do?” Dongsang King asked Night Owl.","Night Owl and Lord Jing carefully considered the options in the secret room before they came up with the best one, and Night Owl brought it up now.","“Kill Princess Yan Ling?” The Dongsang King frowned.","“Yes!” Night Owl had a solemn look on his face. “Father, as long as Princess Yan Ling isn’t dead, we won’t be able to solve this problem. She’s so eager to make a new king that she can control that she’s on the verge of going berserk. No one can make her get rid of that idea.”","The Dongsang King was worried. “But she represents the Dayan Empire, and she’s also a member of Lord Yan’s residence.”","Night Owl said, “Father, I’ve noticed that it was Princess Yan Ling’s individual choice, and even Ma Quanquan doesn’t agree with her. As soon as the princess is dead, they’ll send someone else. It can’t be worse than Princess Yan Ling’s.” The Dongsang King shook his head after some thought.","Night Owl knew that the Dongsang King was intimidated by the Dayan Empire, which was behind Princess Yan Ling.","If the Dayan Empire learned about the assassination of Princess Yan Ling, they would be furious.","Night Owl whispered something in the Dongsang King’s ear.","Night Owl and Lord Jing had been thinking about this plan for a long time, and they had considered all the details. Based on their understanding of the Dongsang King, he would definitely be tempted.","As expected, the Dongsang King’s eyes lit up when Night Owl told him the plan, and he looked much better.","“If that’s the case... If that’s the case... I’ll have to invite Lord Jing here, and he’ll have to participate,” the Dongsang King said excitedly.","Night Owl feigned a frown. “Father, Uncle Jing is a nice man, but it’s too big a deal. If word gets out... It’s not that I don’t trust him, but we have to be careful.”","The more Night Owl said that he was estranged from Lord Jing, the happier Dongsang King was.","went to?”","“What?”","The crown prince looked frightened. “Father, what’s that supposed to mean? Has she gone to see Uncle Jing?","The Dongsang King looked at the crown prince and nodded. “That’s right. Lord","Jing came to report to me just before you arrived.”","The Dongsang King saw the lingering fear in the crown prince’s eyes.","He thought, “The crown prince must think that if he hasn’t come here to report to me, or if he was too late... Heh, I should make him nervous from time to time.”","Lord Jing soon arrived at the imperial palace and was surprised to see the crown prince there.","Until the Dongsang King revealed the truth.","“Princess Yan Ling went to see you as well?” Lord Jing looked at Night Owl. “It seems that Princess Yan Ling is trying every possibility. If that’s the case, after we turn her down, she’ll find someone else. Now that Night Light is gone, will she go to the other princes...”","Realizing what he had said, Lord Jing immediately stopped talking.","The Dongsang King had a brooding look in his eyes.","His third, fourth, and fifth sons hadn’t come to report to their father yet!","One had to admit that Night Owl and Lord Jing were excellent actors. They had successfully fooled the Dongsang King.","In the end...","“Fine. The two of you, go back and come up with a plan. Show it to me as soon as possible! ” The Dongsang King gave the order.","After they left the imperial palace, Lord Jing and Night Owl exchanged looks, and both saw satisfaction in each other’s eyes.","The two of them arrived at the crown prince’s residence.","Since His Majesty had told them to come up with a plan, they naturally had to come up with a plan to deal with Princess Yan Ling. However, they had already come up with one.","“I didn’t expect the king to be so stupid. He actually believed me.” Night Owl looked at Lord Jing. “You’ve set him up.”","Lord Jing waved his hand in satisfaction. “The throne is his top priority, so as long as it’s built around this throne, he has no choice but to fall into it.”","Night Owl asked, “Is everything ready?”","Lord Jing smiled. “We’re only missing one thing.”","Night Owl frowned and said, “We have to kill her in one go. Princess Yan Ling must die.”","Lord Jing nodded. “Of course. Princess Yan Ling has to die, as do all the maids and servants in the residence. As for Yao Yuan, he’s in another kingdom. We’ll have finished the battle by the time he gets here.","“As for Ma Quanquan, we’ll let Master Min lead him away.”","Night Owl asked, “Are you sure that the person you hired can leave behind the scent of the Junwu Empire?”","That was right. That was why the Dongsang King was tempted.","Night Owl and Lord Jing had plotted to kill Princess Yan Ling and the others, leaving behind the scent of the most capable cultivators of the Junwu Empire.","Lord Jing smiled. “You’re right.”","Night Owl asked, “Whose scent do you want to leave?”","Lord Jing stared at Night Owl.","Night Owl’s pupils contracted. “Is it someone I know? Feng Wu?”","Lord Jing said, “Feng Wu alone isn’t enough. We’ll also leave Jun Linyuan’s scent. ”","Night Owl was confused. “How did you get their scent?”","Lord Jing said, “We only need to leave a few hairs behind. The Dayan Empire is","so advanced in technology that they can tell who that person is from a hair or a drop of blood. It’s amazing..”"]},{"number":4043,"title":"Chapter 4043: Begin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4043: Begin","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“As for the hair and blood... Well, they didn’t pay much attention to it before. If they want to obtain it, they just have to use some tricks. After all, the princess of the Senal Grassland is still in Emperor Wu’s harem.”","Night Owl gave Lord Jing an appreciative look.","Feng Wu had no idea that the black-robed man who had lured the princess into the Junwu Empire’s harem in the Senal Grassland was Lord Jing himself.","They thought that no one would hear them, but Little Phoenix was in the secret room.","Because of how critical the situation was, Little Phoenix had been following Night Owl around the entire time, and Night Owl had no idea.","Feng Wu was equally shocked when Little Phoenix told her the plan.","So, Lord Jing had her and Jun Linyuan’s blood and hair?!","And the princess of the Senal Grassland got it for him!","Feng Wu flared up!","He was trying to frame her and Jun Linyuan... So be it!","Feng Wu asked Little Phoenix to collect the hair and blood of Night Owl and Lord Jing for her.","Night Owl didn’t want anything to happen, so he wanted to finish the battle as soon as possible.","He couldn’t wait anymore. What if the Dongsang King suddenly changed his mind?","On a dark, moonless night...","A figure rushed into Princess Yan Ling’s residence and tried to assassinate her.","“Assassins!”","When Princess Yan Ling realized what had happened, she cried out.","Ma Quanquan was cultivating in his room with his eyes closed.","To a cultivator at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage, the attacker was indeed very capable. They almost fooled him.","“Who’s there?!”","Ma Quanquan shouted angrily.","He drew out his sword.","Soon, he heard the sound of fighting outside.","Ma Quanquan frowned.","The person was so powerful that they almost destroyed the formation around the princess’s room.","Ma Quanquan immediately sent a message to Yao Yuan.","Yao Yuan had arrived from the Dayan Empire with Ma Quanquan and was also at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage. Ma Quanquan and Princess Yan Ling had been staying in the Dongsang Kingdom, while Yao Yuan had gone to the far north. He had some important tasks to do as well.","However, Ma Quanquan felt threatened today, so he sent out the message.","The Dayan Empire was a technologically advanced empire, and they soon got in touch with each other.","“Come to Donglin City now!!!”","Ma Ouanauan made three exclamation marks in a row.","After Yao Yuan received the news, he headed for Dongsang as fast as he could.","He moved so fast that no one had time to react.","However, at Yao Yuan’s current speed, it would take him at least 15 minutes to reach Donglin City.","However, there was no time to waste.","Thump, thump, thump!","The sound of fighting kept coming in the chilly night.","Ma Quanquan fought and fell back, but his opponent kept closing in. In the end, he had no choice but to tear the space open and run into it.","Ma Quanquan was astonished.","Who was trying to assassinate the princess tonight?","Were they from the Dongsang Kingdom?","Or someone from the Junwu Empire?","Ma Quanquan’s eyes lit up. He stared at the Spiritual Saint and smirked. “This is Donglin City, and I’ve sent a letter to the royal palace. If the Dongsang King hears about it, he’ll send a capable cultivator to help us. Who are you? Are you sure you want to keep fighting?”","His opponent was none other than Senior Brother Min of the Dongsang King.","If the Dongsang King really wanted to send reinforcements, it would have to be Master Min.","Master Min knew that Ma Quanquan was trying to sound him out, so he didn’t say anything, but he struck out even harder.","Ma Quanquan looked in the direction of the imperial palace, but it was pitch black.","Given Master Min’s capability, he should have heard about the battle.","Moreover, there was more than one peak Spiritual Saint in Donglin City.","That was to say...","Ma Quanquan looked terrified.","“You’re from the Dongsang Kingdom! “Do you people want to kill the messenger of the Dayan Empire?!”","Ma Quanquan was astonished.","The Dayan Empire had been supporting the Dongsang Kingdom all these years. How could the Dongsang Kingdom dare to do that?","Master Min looked frustrated.","Things were getting out of hand.","The original plan was to only kill Princess Yan Ling, leave Ma Quanquan alive, and let Ma Quanquan find the hair... In the end, it would prove that Jun Linyuan of the Junwu Empire was the culprit. That way, the Dayan Empire would be able to vent all their anger on the Junwu Empire, but now...","Since Ma Quanquan had found out the truth, he couldn’t live anymore.","Therefore, Master Min, who had been holding back, activated his sword intent.","Ma Quanquan murmured in disbelief, “How dare you?!”","He was answered by Master Min’s explosive power.","After Master Min lured Ma Quanquan away, the residence became a piece of cake for Lord Jing.","Because the guards had betrayed him before...","Feng Wu pretended to be Jing Wei to let Princess Yan Ling know that he was a guard of the Jing Mansion.","Therefore, Lord Jing decided to do it himself.","He was a Level-2 Spiritual Saint, whereas Princess Yan Ling was only a peak Spiritual Overlord. Therefore, Lord Jing was confident that he was going to win.","The formation around the building had been destroyed, so Lord Jing arrived in no time.","Princess Yan Ling didn’t realize how dangerous it was.","She was having the greatest time of her life.","She had been stuck at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage for a very long time. Tonight, she suddenly had an epiphany and had comprehended a new stage. As a result, she was making a breakthrough into the Spiritual Saint stage.","The door opened with a click.","Shijian was guarding Princess Yan Ling’s door.","Feng Wu was supposed to be there, but she was too smart to be exposed in a critical moment like this.","She wasn’t afraid of Lord Jing, but she was afraid that a peak Spiritual Saint might pop out of nowhere, and she might be killed.","She had planned this battle so carefully that all she needed to do was watch it from afar.","Hence, Feng Wu had hidden herself away.","As expected...","When Lord Jing arrived at the door and saw Princess Yan Ling’s maid, he struck down with his sword. Shijian was dead before she could react.","Lord Jing entered the room.","The door made a cracking sound, which made Lord Jing frown a little. However, he soon realized that the sound didn’t affect Princess Yan Ling’s cultivation at all, for her breathing was well-proportioned and she didn’t seem nervous.","With a sword in his hand, Lord Jing soon went into the inner room.","He immediately spotted Princess Yan Ling, who was sitting on a cushion and absorbing spiritual essence.","He didn’t know if he should call Princess Yan Ling lucky or unlucky.."]},{"number":4044,"title":"Chapter 4044: Imminent Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4044: Imminent Death","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After dreaming for so long, Princess Yan Ling was finally going to make a breakthrough tonight. She couldn’t be more excited.","However, when she opened her eyes, she saw a sword on her shoulder.","Involuntarily, Princess Yan Ling looked up and saw a man dressed in black. He looked rather familiar, especially those eyes, which reminded her of someone she had seen before.","Princess Yan Ling was perplexed. Wasn’t Grandpa Ma guarding the door? How could someone reach her and point a dagger at her?","“Don’t you know who I am?” Princess Yan Ling found the act idiotic. “How dare you point a dagger at my neck? Who are you? Do you have a death wish?”","The person under the black scarf smirked, and there was contempt in his eyes as well. He was looking at Princess Yan Ling as if she was a stupid pig.","Feeling humiliated, Princess Yan Ling flew into a rage out of humiliation. “You must have a death wish! How dare you treat me like this? Die!”","Princess Yan Ling suddenly raised her hand and shot an arrow in the person’s face.","However, she realized that the other party seemed to have come prepared and was very familiar with her behavior. As soon as she raised her hand, the other party pressed her sleeve back down and said sarcastically, “Princess, save your energy. It’s useless to me.”","Princess Yan Ling was furious. “You!”","Since the other party had subdued her so easily, Princess Yan Ling immediately realized that she wasn’t his match.","She was already a Level-I Spiritual Saint, but she still wasn’t his match.","“Grandpa Ma! ”","Princess Yan Ling cried out. She needed Ma Quanquan to save her.","However, Ma Quanquan couldn’t even save himself now.","Princess Yan Ling wasn’t stupid. She knew how serious the situation was when Ma Quanquan didn’t show up after she asked for help.","Princess Yan Ling used her spiritual essence to communicate with the spiritual jade, but she realized that the spiritual essence around her had been sealed, and she couldn’t send out any distress signals.","Only then did Princess Yan Ling realize how dangerous the situation was.","“You!” Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth and stared at the man. “Who on earth are you? What do you want? I’m the princess of the Dayan Empire. I can give you anything you want.”","The man smirked as if he was amused by Princess Yan Ling.","“You!”","An idea then struck Princess Yan Ling. She suddenly remembered someone, and her face went ghastly pale!","“You! I know who you are!” Princess Yan Ling stared at the man. “You’re Lord Jing! You’re him!”","Seeing that Princess Yan Ling had recognized him, Lord Jing took off his black scarf.","Since he was here to assassinate her, he shouldn’t have done that.","But Lord Jing was so pleased with himself that he thought he had everything under control. Moreover, he wanted to see the astonished look on Princess Yan Ling’s face, so he decided to remove his mask.","“It really is you! ”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth and stared at him. “Are you going to kill me?!”","Lord Jing nodded.","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “You’re just a petty Lord Jing. How can you kill me? Aren’t you afraid that the Dayan Empire will take revenge?!” Lord Jing gave Princess Yan Ling a strange look.","Princess Yan Ling stuck out her chest and glared at him.","“Princess, why do you still not understand?” Lord Jing patted Princess Yan Ling on the shoulder and said in an earnest tone, “As a matter of fact, your life is in my hands now.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Grandpa Ma is...”","Lord Jing smiled. “Are you still counting on your Grandpa Ma? If he could show up, he would have done so as soon as you called him. Why wait?”","Princess Yan Ling gritted her teeth and stared at Lord Jing. “Who’s behind you? Why do you want to kill me?!”","Lord Jing heaved a long sigh.","He said, “Princess, are you stalling for time? Do you think your Grandpa Ma will come to save you? You’re mistaken. Master Min is a better fighter than your Grandpa Ma. He won’t come back in time.”","Princess Yan Ling said, “How dare you?!”","Lord Jing smiled. “Since I know you’re stalling, do you know why I’m still answering your questions?","“Because I’m sure of my plan, Princess Yan Ling.","“Everything’s been arranged. You can go to hell.","“Don’t worry. If you’re dead, the Dongsang Kingdom won’t be implicated. Even if the Dayan Empire wants to do something, it’ll have to go to the Junwu","Empire.”","Princess Yan Ling took the hint right away.","“So, you’re not the only one who wants to kill me. Night Owl and the Dongsang King want to kill me as well! Without the Dongsang King, you won’t be able to","persuade Master Min to restrain Grandpa Ma!”","‘Yes!”","“Why?!” Princess Yan Ling stared at Lord Jing. ‘Why?! I understand that you and Night Owl want to kill me because Night Owl is your son. If you want to keep it a secret, you have to kill me. But why did the Dongsang King want to kill me? Why?!”","Lord Jing gave her a half-smile. “Do you want to know?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Tell me!”","Lord Jing chuckled. “It’s nothing, really. If you hadn’t been so aggressive, Princess Yan Ling, we wouldn’t have attacked you. Do you know how difficult it is to set you up?","Princess Yan Ling said, “You set me up? That’s right! You set me up from the very beginning! You took me away on purpose so that Night Light could humiliate me. You then provoked me to kill Night Light after you recorded us. What did you do after that? How did you trick the Dongsang King?!”","Lord Jing suddenly said, “Princess Yan Ling, you must regret that you didn’t tell","His Majesty in advance, right?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Yes, I regret that I didn’t tell His Majesty that Night","Owl was your son. Otherwise, you and Night Owl would have been dead by now.","You would never have had the chance to act so arrogantly in front of me!” Lord Jing patted Princess Yan Ling on the cheek. “That’s right. You’re kinder than me.’","Princess Yan Ling said angrily, “I’m going to die. Can’t you answer my question?! How did you fool the Dongsang King? Tell me!”","Lord Jing seemed to be magnanimous. “Alright, alright. It’s getting late. I’ll let you know before you die.”","Hence, Lord Jing told them how he and Night Owl had joined hands.."]},{"number":4045,"title":"Chapter 4045: Kind Words","paragraphs":["Chapter 4045: Kind Words","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Jing then told Princess Yan Ling how he and Night Owl had made the Dongsang King misunderstand her, how they had invited Master Min, and how they had framed the Junwu Empire.","After hearing that, Princess Yan Ling was astonished.","“How... how...” She stared at Lord Jing and gritted her teeth. “How dare you set me up? You deserve to die!”","Lord Jing smiled at Princess Yan Ling. “Princess, you should live with the fact that you’ve lost the bet. Since you’re not as good at scheming as I am, there’s no need to blame other people for being scheming. Don’t you agree?”","He moved closer to Princess Yan Ling as he spoke.","Seeing that things were turning against her, Princess Yan Ling turned to flee.","However, Lord Jing was prepared. He struck out when Princess Yan Ling turned to flee.","Thump, thump, thump!","The sound of fighting filled the air.","Princess Yan Ling was already outside the building, but Lord Jing caught up with her in no time.","Before long, Princess Yan Ling fell to the ground.","Lord Jing slid his sword across Princess Yan Ling’s throat.","Princess Yan Ling lay in a pool of blood and stared at Lord Jing with wide-open eyes.","Lora Jing smirKe(1. Fearing tnat princess yan Ling was still alive, ne raised ms sword again and stabbed her in the chest.","Blood gushed out of Princess Yan Ling’s mouth, and she shuddered. Finally, she was dead.","But he still wasn’t convinced. After casting a stern look at Princess Yan Ling and making sure that she wasn’t breathing, he waved his hand, and a streak of flame jumped onto her.","Whoosh!","Flames spread out and soon devoured Princess Yan Ling.","“You’re dead after all.” Lord Jing sneered at Princess Yan Ling. “From now on, no one will know my secret. You’ll have a worthy death after my son takes the throne. Go to hell.”","He stepped on Princess Yan Ling’s dead body.","With a wave of his hand, flames gushed out.","Night Owl had killed all the servants in the courtyard where Princess Yan Ling lived. All Lord Jing needed to do was set fire to everything.","As for why?","That was to destroy the evidence.","Lord Jing had no idea how advanced the technology of the empire was, so he decided to burn everything to the ground, just in case. Even if they wanted to look into it in the end, they could only trace it back to Jun Linyuan and Feng wu.","Lord Jing deliberately left a smear of blood in Princess Yan Ling’s room before he left.","The Divine Phoenix Blood.","The Divine Blood of the Dragon Phoenix.","The two drops of blood were too recognizable for Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu to escape.","When he walked out of the manor, flames rose behind him, setting the entire place on fire.","“Is it done?” Night Owl looked at Lord Jing.","Lord Jing nodded. “We’ll talk about it when we get back.”","Night Owl was still concerned. “Have you left the blood and the hair? Is Princess Yan Ling really dead? And...”","Lord Jing waved his hand. “Don’t worry. I’ve prepared everything.”","Night Owl was relieved when he saw the raging fire and knew that Princess Yan Ling was dead.","“Let’s go. Someone’s coming.”","Lord Jing dragged Night Owl back to the crown prince’s residence.","But they still couldn’t calm down. They had done what they needed to do, but Ma Quanquan, Princess Yan Ling’s aid, was a tough enemy. They hoped that Master Min would take care of him.","“Don’t worry. Master Situ is there as well,” said Lord Jing. “They’re both His Majesty’s top cultivators. Ma Quanquan won’t make it out alive.”","Night Owl glanced at him and asked, “Isn’t he your master? Aren’t you sad at","Lord Jing snorted. “Ever since he took me in as his pupil, he hasn’t harbored any good intentions. It’ll only make it easier for him to work in the Dongsang Kingdom. Why should I miss such a person?” Meanwhile in the princess’s residence.","They all thought Princess Yan Ling was dead.","It was true. Lord Jing had made many lethal attacks and even set Princess Yan Ling on fire. How could she still be alive?","But what he didn’t know was that the girl who had been hiding in the dark was showing her face now.","Princess Yan Ling’s formation had a secret safe zone, which was a well. Feng Wu had been hiding in the well when the fire broke out in the courtyard.","Feng Wu dodged to the side in a hurry, only to find a fireball falling into the well.","It was Princess Yan Ling.","Well water couldn’t put out the fire Lord Jing put on her, but Feng Wu put out the fire in no time.","However, by then, Princess Yan Ling was barely breathing. She turned her head and saw someone. It was so...","“Xingxiang... you’re not dead!” Princess Yan Ling looked excited. She wanted to grab her maid, but she couldn’t even lift a finger.","Feng Wu feigned a surprised tone as well. “Princess, Princess, is that you? Why are you here? Are you alright?”","Feng Wu sounded very concerned.","Princess Yanling said, “Why are you here?”","On her way here, she had seen that the courtyard was filled with dead bodies. Almost everyone in the courtyard was dead, but there was still a living person here.","Feng Wu said between broken sobs, “I... I’ve always had a weak stomach, and it was the same this time. I couldn’t stand the abdominal pain in the middle of the night, so I went to use the toilet in secret, but I saw someone running into the courtyard and setting things on fire. I... I was scared, so I hid in the well and waited until now.”","Princess Yan Ling took a deep breath. She knew that she had almost reached her limit...","“Princess, please don’t worry. I’m sure you’ll be alright. I’ll go get the medicine. I’ll...” Feng Wu was a good actress, and at the last moment, she still wanted to set Princess Yan Ling up.","Feng Wu believed that Princess Yan Ling was beyond saving. Even a Semi-divine refinement master like her couldn’t do anything about it, let alone pills. Princess Yan Ling had to know that answer herself.","“Don’t!”","As expected, Princess Yan Ling stopped Feng Wu, who was about to climb out of the well, and said slowly, “I don’t have much time left. Remember everything","I’m going to tell you.”","Feng Wu agreed in tears.","Princess Yan Ling said, “I was killed by Lord Jing, Night Owl, and the Dongsang King..”"]},{"number":4046,"title":"Chapter 4046: Three Things","paragraphs":["Chapter 4046: Three Things","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Princess Yan King said, “There’s a Spiritual Fossil Stone on top of a bookshelf in my room. It contains everything Lord Jing told me. Take it later and keep it safe. Wait for the second batch of reinforcements to arrive.","“If I remember it correctly, my brother will be among the second reinforcements. When you give him that Spiritual Fossil Stone, everything will be clear. My brother will take revenge for me.”","Princess Yan Ling smirked. “They thought they had eliminated the root of the problem, but they didn’t know that I had recorded everything. The Dongsang Kingdom is going to die with me! “That’s the first thing. Understood?”","Feng Wu said in a hurry, “Of course.”","Princess Yan Ling nodded, took a breath, and went on. “Secondly...” Feng Wu feigned astonishment. “No, no, no. That’s impossible. Absolutely impossible. I don’t believe it. I don’t... Princess Yan Ling glared at Feng Wu. “Shut up.”","Feng Wu immediately shut up.","It took Princess Yan Ling a while to recover a little strength. “I don’t have time for this. Just remember everything I say.","“Tell my brother to kill Feng Wu for me. He must kill her! As for Jun Linyuan, kill him and make him my husband after death. Understood?”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened.","Princess Yan Ling asked, “Got it?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes!”","Princess Yan Ling didn’t hear the change in Feng Wu’s tone, for she was already in a trance-like state.","“Thirdly, take this.” Princess Yan Ling took out a brocade box from her chest pocket. “This is a map. The things Mu Jiuzhou took with him when he left the empire are buried here. Grandpa Ma and Grandpa Yao have explored this place. Hand it to my brother and let him find the treasure. Remember, even if it’s destroyed, you can’t let the Junwu Empire take it. Otherwise...","“If they have it, the Junwu Empire will become much more powerful, and it’ll be much more difficult for us to turn the people of this continent into a sacrificial offering.","“Since the Yan Manor has such a responsibility, we have to finish it! “It’s the mission of the Yan family for generations to come!","“Alright, that’s it.","“If you can remember all three, my brother will give you a reward. I know you like my brother. Although you can’t become his official wife, he can still make you a concubine.”","Princess Yan Ling coughed violently and trembled. She had almost reached her limit.","Feng Wu glanced at her.","When Princess Yan Ling finally stopped coughing and was able to breathe normally again, she noticed that the look in Feng Wu’s eyes wasn’t right.","“What are you waiting for? Go get that Spiritual Fossil Stone from the living room!” Princess Yan Ling prompted Feng Wu, and she began to cough violently again.","Feng Wu noticed that blood was oozing out of her mouth.","She asked Princess Yan Ling, “Are you done?”","Princess Yan Ling looked at her in bewilderment. “What did you say?”","Feng Wu looked at her and suddenly smiled. There was a mischievous and teasing look in her smile, and there were many things that Princess Yan Ling didn’t understand.","“You...”","Princess Yan Ling came back to herself and trembled violently. “You’re not Xingxiang! You’re not Xingxiang, are you?!”","She was shaking from head to toe and was coughing violently.","When she was finally done coughing, she was almost dead.","“Who on earth are you?!” Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu. “I’m going to","die...”","Princess Yan Ling grabbed Feng Wu’s sleeve, and her pupils contracted. She stared at Feng Wu. “Before I die, tell me... Who on earth are you?”","Feng Wu looked at her and sighed. “If you know you’re going to die, why didn’t you accumulate some good karma? That ghost marriage thing? Tsk, tsk.”","“You, you’re...”","Princess Yan Ling immediately recognized the sarcasm in Feng Wu’s voice.","“It’s you!”","Gritting her teeth, Princess Yan Ling glared at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu! It’s you, isn’t it?!”","Feng Wu didn’t try to hide it from her. She removed her disguise.","“Ahhh!!!”","Princess Yan Ling was astonished when she saw Feng Wu’s face. Her mouth fell open, and she pointed at Feng Wu with a trembling finger. She couldn’t utter a word.","When she realized what had happened, she screamed.","“It’s you! It’s you!” Princess Yan Ling’s head went blank, and it took her a while to come back to herself. “You know how to disguise yourself as my maid! Since when did you start pretending to be Xingxiang? No, you can move freely in the formation!","“Are you with Lord Jing?!","“No, it’s not like that! You’re the one who made me shift my attention to Lord Jing! You hold grudges against him, and you’re definitely not on his side! “Lord Jing and Night Owl are on the same team, so you’re not one of them.","“Who else could it be? Night Light? No!”","Princess Yan Ling’s eyes widened, and she stared at Feng Wu. “Your current level... you..","She was already a Level-I Spiritual Saint, but she couldn’t sense Feng Wu’s spiritual essence, which meant...","“Well, I’m a Level-2 Spiritual Saint now.” Feng Wu grinned at her.","Princess Yan Ling was shocked.","Her eyes widened, and she stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You... you... can’t be... You’ll need a lot of resources...","Feng Wu sighed. ‘Why not? Lord Jing’s mansion has a lot of resources, and I can use them all. So, I reached Level 2 of the Spiritual Saint stage in no time.”","Princess Yan Ling seemed to have been reminded of something, and her eyes widened. “I remember now! It was you! That guard! I saw you outside Night Owl’s manor! You were that guard, and you smell the same!”","Princess Yan Ling was a smart girl. After figuring that out, she was very close to the truth.","“Since you can stay by my side as Xingxiang, you can also become Lord Jing’s guard. You used the resources of the Jing Manor to make yourself a Level-2 Spiritual Saint, then you...”","Princess Yan Ling stared at Feng Wu. “Then, you teamed up with Lord Jing and took me to Night Light’s private residence so that he could humiliate me! You then recorded everything!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Yes, I did snatch you, but I left after I left you there. As for what happened after that, you can’t blame me..”"]},{"number":4047,"title":"Chapter 4047: Princess Is Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 4047: Princess Is Dead","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“So, it really was you! It really was you!” Princess Yan Ling was shaking from head to toe. “When Lord Jing received the Spiritual Fossil Stone, he instigated me to kill the second prince. Then, you lured me to the Jing Manor, forcing Lord Jing to attack me himself...","“And there’s the Dongsang King. Lord Jing has admitted that they lied to him on purpose, making him think that I was going to usurp the throne! “After everything you’ve done, I have to take the blame! You people are","aDommaD1e: ‘","Princess Yan Ling was so angry that she was in tears. She stared at Feng Wu and said, “Especially you! What good will it do you?!”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “What do you think?”","Princess Yan Ling didn’t know what to say, but she soon realized what had happened, and her pupils contracted. “I see! You’re trying to set the empire against the Dongsang Kingdom!","“You used me, Lord Jing, Night Owl, and even the second prince.","“And the Dongsang King and his capable men!","“You’ve been killing with borrowed knives!","“You let Lord Jing set me up, let me kill the second prince, and let Lord Jing join hands with the Dongsang King to kill me... You’re abominable!!!”","When Yan Ling realized what had happened, she thought she was going to lose her mind.","Feng Wu noticed that the veins on Princess Yan Ling’s face were popping as if she was going to explode at any moment,","Feng Wu smiled at her. “You only figured it out now? It’s too late.”","Princess Yan Ling shouted at Feng Wu, “You won’t get what you want! The empire will still take the Dongsang Kingdom’s side! Junwu has to die!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Of course not. Princess, didn’t you tell me to do three things? After I finish them for you, the Dongsang Kingdom will be the first kingdom to be destroyed.”","Recalling the three things she had told Feng Wu, Princess Yan Ling almost had a heart attack.","However, before she spat out more blood, Feng Wu had already jumped out of the well, leaving Princess Yan Ling behind, who was still spitting out blood.","Princess Yan Ling was probably dying from rage.","Before Princess Yanling closed her eyes, Feng Wu added, “Since you want the flesh of my people as the sacrificial altar, I’ll make you a blood sacrifice first.”","An altar? What on earth had she told Feng Wu?! Princess Yan Ling was furious.","She couldn’t ask because she was blind and mute. She couldn’t make a sound.","“Princess, don’t worry. I’ll help you with those three things.” Feng Wu grinned at Princess Yan Ling.","Princess Yan Ling spat out another mouthful of blood.","Calm down, calm down, calm down... However, no matter how many times Princess Yan Ling told herself not to get angry, in the end, she was still furious at Feng Wu.","What worried her the most was...","She had given such a critical map to Feng Wu. Was this a sign that the Junwu Empire was going to survive?","However, Princess Yan Ling had no way of knowing what would happen next. Because she was dead.","Feng Wu gave Princess Yan Ling a long look and shook her head. She then ran through the fire as fast as a streak of lightning.","“She’s dead.” Little Phoenix was speechless. “Her rage killed her.”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “I guess she deserved to die for her unjust behavior. ”","Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu. “I feel sorry for your enemy.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I wish everyone was my friend, but I can’t. I’ve always wanted to be a good person, but I just can ‘t.”","She was responsible for the lives of so many people of the Junwu Empire. If she couldn’t bring herself to do these things, did she have to let the Dayan Empire crush all the people of the Junwu Empire and turn them into the cornerstones of the altar?","Soon, Feng Wu arrived at the living room Princess Yan Ling mentioned. Following her directions, she found the Spiritual Fossil Stone.","She could do a lot of things with it.","“Someone’s coming!” Little Phoenix warned her.","Feng Wu nodded and left as fast as she could with Little Phoenix.","On her way out, she caught a glimpse of a familiar figure.","Yao Yuan was back, wasn’t he?","Yao Yuan was the “Grandpa Yao” that Princess Yan Ling was talking about.","Yao Yuan and Ma Quanquan were both peak Spiritual Saints, but Ma Quanquan stayed with Princess Yan Ling the whole time. Yao Yuan, on the other hand, seemed to be searching for something.","Feng Wu was about to leave when she saw Yao Yuan tear the space open and enter another dimension.","That was right. Spiritual Saint battles usually took place in different dimensions, because in this real world, one might not be able to withstand a single punch. If one couldn’t control their momentum, the damage they could cause would be too great.","They could fight freely in the other dimensions without having to worry about anything.","“Let’s go,” Little Phoenix urged Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu hesitated and didn’t move. No one knew what she was thinking.","Little Phoenix said, “Hey, don’t tell me you have another idea. My dear lady, do you have any idea what level you are now? You’re only a Level-2 Spiritual Saint!","“Do you know how capable they are? They’re peak Spiritual Saints!","“There’s so much difference between you and them. Do you still want to join their battle?”","Feng Wu was a little frustrated. “I didn’t want to. I just wanted to stay there and see if I could get something out of it.”","Little Phoenix was furious. “Benefits? You’ve received so many, and you’re still asking for more? Do you know how dangerous it is for you to go there like this?!”","Feng Wu said, “I know, I know.”","Little Phoenix said, “If you do, why don’t you leave now?”","Crouching down in the rockery, Feng Wu waved at the bird. “Just wait a little longer... Maybe everyone inside is dead. As you said, they’re all peak Spiritual Saints. I’m sure they all have storage spaces. If we can find something good...”","Little Phoenix said, “I don’t think the battle will end any time soon.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “No, it won’t be long.”","Little Phoenix asked, “Why? Which side do you think will win?”","Feng Wu said, “The Dongsang Kingdom, of course.”","Little Phoenix was confused. “Why the Dongsang Kingdom? I think Yao Yuan is more capable than Ma Quanquan. Min may not be his match.”","Feng Wu only smiled.."]},{"number":4048,"title":"Chapter 4048: Minister Chu (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4048: Minister Chu (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was a Level-2 Spiritual Saint now, so she didn’t need to wear the Qilin Armor. She could stay in another dimension without getting killed by the wind.","Feng Wu had been crouching on a slope and didn’t move any closer.","Four people were fighting in the distance.","Thev were all at the Deak of the SDiritual Saint stage. and there was no Dlace","for a junior Spiritual Saint like her.","Master Min and Master Yao belonged to the Dongsang Kingdom.","There were also Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan, two peak Spiritual Saints of Dayan.","Ma Quanquan recognized Master Min as soon as they started fighting, despite the fact that Master Min wore a black robe with a black scarf over his face.","Ma Quanquan only knew it in his head, but he didn’t call out the man’s name.","If he did, the other party would stop at nothing to silence him. Therefore, he couldn’t reveal that he already knew who the other party was. Why? Why did the Dongsang King send Min Yichen to kill him?","Thump!","There was a loud explosion.","Ma Quanquan looked in that direction and saw that Yao Yuan had severely injured his opponent.","Ma Quanquan didn’t know who Yao Yuan’s opponent was, but he was sure that they were from the Dongsang Kingdom.","Great!","Ma Quanquan was excited.","If Yao Yuan could defeat his opponent and give Ma Quanquan a hand, the latter would be able to defeat Min Yichen.","Someone was watching the battle through a Spiritual Fossil Stone.","It was none other than the Dongsang King.","He frowned.","“Your Majesty?” Lü, the steward of the eunuchs, was surprised because the king didn’t look too happy.","“Yaoxiao isn’t his match.” The Dongsang King rose to his feet.","“Your Majesty, do you mean...”","Before Lü could finish, the king dashed off. Lü followed suit.","Was His Majesty going to do it himself? But with His Majesty’s capability, even if he did it himself now...","“I know where His Majesty is going!”","As expected, the Dongsang King was indeed heading for that powerful cultivator.","The Dongsang King straightened his clothes and had a stern look on his face when he arrived at the valley.","“Minister Chu,” said the Dongsang King.","It was none other than Chu Tianxiao, Feng Wu’s third senior brother.","To the king’s surprise, Chu Tianxiao was watching the battle as well.","Chu Tianxiao frowned when he saw the Dongsang King.","The king smiled gingerly.","Chu Tianxiao frowned when he saw the Dongsang King staring at the water curtain. If he stared at it for too long, he might notice Feng Wu. The Dongsang King was a very smart man.","At that thought, Chu Tianxiao waved his sleeve, and the water curtain disappeared.","Chu Tianxiao stared at him, and the smile froze on the Dongsang King’s face. A chill ran down his spine.","“If you have something to say, say it. Cut the crap.” Chu Tianxiao found the king annoying.","The Dongsang King cleared his throat to cover up his embarrassment, then slowly told Chu Tianxiao what had happened.","“So, you’re going to kill the imperial emissary?” Chu Tianxiao looked at the Dongsang King as if he was looking at an idiot.","The Dongsang King had a bitter look on his face.","He wouldn’t have done such a thing if he had a choice, but now..."]},{"number":4049,"title":"Chapter 4049: Minister Chu (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4049: Minister Chu (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Princess Yan Ling is dead,” the Dongsang King said solemnly. “If Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan aren’t dead, it’ll be very difficult to cover it up. So... I really don’t have a choice.”","The Dongsang King had always been humble in front of Chu Tianxiao.","Chu Tianxiao didn’t even look at him. He only nodded with his eyes closed.","The Dongsang King said, “Therefore, I’d like to ask you for a favor...”","Chu Tianxiao said, “Keep going.”","The Dongsang Emperor didn’t know what to say, but he gritted his teeth and said, “Here’s what I’m thinking. Could you kill Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan and frame the Junwu Empire?”","Chu Tianxiao suddenly opened his eyes and stared at the Dongsang King with a brooding look in his eyes.","The look in his eyes was as sharp as a blade. The Dongsang King stiffened and didn’t dare to utter a word.","After a long while, Chu Tianxiao said indifferently, “I owe the late king a favor and promised to guard the Dongsang Kingdom for him three times. This is the third time.”","The king broke into a cold sweat.","“But I only promised to protect the Dongsang Kingdom, not frame other kingdoms,” Chu Tianxiao said.","The Dongsang King didn’t dare to utter a word.","“I’ll kill him for you.","“You can go.","After that, Chu Tianxiao threw his sword into the other dimension.","The Dongsang King was reassured.","Chu Tianxiao stared at the king. “Why are you still here?”","The Dongsang King nodded. “Yes, of course.”","After the Dongsang King left, Chu Tianxiao turned on the water curtain again and watched the battle in the other dimension.","He wasn’t paying attention to the battle. After all, a battle of this level was still too weak for him. All he cared about was the girl.","Feng Wu hid herself well. She was at least a few kilometers away from the battlefield.","Meanwhile, she was discussing the situation with Little Phoenix.","After observing the situation, Feng Wu said seriously, “The people of Dayan are going to win. Look, Yaoxiao is better than that man in black. After he takes care of that man, he’ll be able to help Ma Quanquan.”","Little Phoenix nodded as well. “Then the Dongsang King won’t have it easy. If","Ma Quanquan returns to Dayan, the Dongsang King will be doomed.”","After some thought, Feng Wu said solemnly, “If we can hide here and watch, the Dongsang King will have a way to see what’s going on here. If I were him..","Oh no!”","Little Phoenix was confused.","Feng Wu said, “If I were the Dongsang King, I would never let that happen. Since they’ve fallen out, the most important thing now is to kill Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan. If I were the Dongsang King, I would...","“The Dongsang King not only wants to kill Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan, but he’s also trying to frame the Junwu Empire! I’m sure of it!","“The most important thing now is, can he do it?","“When he decided to take action against Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan, he made sure that he would be able to frame them.","“We can’t just wait here. We have to take action, or all our efforts will go to waste. Not only that, but we’ll also bring trouble to the Junwu Empire..”"]},{"number":4050,"title":"Chapter 4050: News Got Back to Junwu (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4050: News Got Back to Junwu (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that news was flying toward the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu had always thought that the Junwu Empire didn’t have spies lurking in the Dongsang Kingdom, but there were.","The Dongsang Kingdom wasn’t like the Junwu Empire. In the Junwu Empire, the Dongsang Kingdom had the legendary seeded plan, but in the Junwu Empire, there was also a plan, but it didn’t have much effect.","The few spies that had been instigated weren’t in key positions, so it was very difficult to obtain critical information. However, non-essential information could still be delivered to the Junwu Empire one after another. They were all General Feng’s men, so he was the first to receive the news.","“What?!","General Feng’s eyes widened when he read the message.","Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu were right next to General Feng.","Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang were also there.","Everyone was worried about Feng Wu’s condition in the Dongsang Kingdom because they hadn’t heard from her after she went in.","That was why everyone was so nervous and amazed when they saw General Feng like this.","“What does the news from the Dongsang Kingdom say? Is it bad news? Is Xiao Wu...” Elder Helian was close to Feng Wu, so he was worried.","The others were worried about Feng Wu as well, so they all looked at General Feng.","“Ahem.” General Feng cleared his throat and said indifferently, “Here’s a letter. Go read it.”","Mr. Lu was about to read it when Elder Helian said anxiously, “Put it on the table so that we can all read it together.”","Elder Dongfang nodded as well. “That’s right. Let’s put it on the table.”","They just couldn’t wait, could they? Mr. Lu smiled bitterly. Without another word, he unfolded the letter and showed it to the others in turn.","The writer had tried to be brief, but a lot had happened, so the letter was still seven pages long.","After reading it, everyone was speechless.","Everyone looked at one another in bewilderment and expectation.","Elder Helian rubbed his chin and was the first to speak. “According to the intel, something major happened in the Dongsang Kingdom. Princess Yan Ling killed Prince Night Light in broad daylight, then rushed into the Jing Manor and tried to kill Lord Jing the same way?”","The others nodded.","Elder Helian was confused. “That’s very strange. Princess Yan Ling is an emissary sent by the Dayan Empire. She’s working with the Dongsang Kingdom on behalf of the empire to take down the Junwu Empire. But now, she’s fighting against the royal family of the Dongsang Kingdom and has killed the second prince. How can the Dongsang King stand it? If I’m not mistaken, they’re","navmg an Internal strlte.”","The others nodded.","Elder Helian frowned again. “That’s not right. They were going to fight us together. Why did they start fighting among themselves first?”","Elder Dongfang frowned as well. “Princess Yan Ling is obviously the culprit. The Dongsang Kingdom won’t dare to start a conflict.”","Elder Helian said, “Of course.”","Elder Dongfang said, “I don’t get it. Why would Princess Yan Ling do such a thing? It’s like she’s lost her mind. I feel that there’s an invisible hand behind it.”","Elder Helian said grumpily, “Didn’t the information say so?”"]},{"number":4051,"title":"Chapter 4051: News Got Back to Junwu (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4051: News Got Back to Junwu (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Helian said, “The second prince of the Dongsang Kingdom had inappropriate thoughts for Princess Yan Ling, which was why she killed him.”","Elder Dongfang shook her head. “I don’t think it’s that simple. The Dongsang","King was able to stand it when his son was killed in front of everyone.”","Elder Helian nodded. “That’s true, but it also shows that the Dongsang Kingdom is under the control of the Dayan dynasty, which is very disadvantageous for us.”","Elder Dongfang said, “That’s right. We can fight the Dongsang Kingdom, but if the Dayan Empire sends all their capable cultivators here, the Junwu Empire will... Hey, what do you think Princess Yan Ling will do? Will she kill Lord Jing?”","The information they received was stuck at the place where Princess Yan Ling had thrown a tantrum in the Jing Manor. The rest of the letters hadn’t arrived yet.","Mr. Lu suddenly said, “Isn’t Xiao Wu in the Dongsang Kingdom? She’s very smart. Let her think of a way to incite Princess Yan Ling!”","Mr. Xu smiled as well. “That girl is indeed very capable, but I think she’s still on her way to Donglin City. I don’t know when she’ll get there.”","The others sighed in unison. How they wished that the girl was in Donglin City now.","What they didn’t know was that the situation in the Dongsang Kingdom had reached a critical moment.","Just when Feng Wu was worried that Ma Quanquan would be in trouble, things turned out that way.","A sword came out of nowhere and buried itself in Yao Yuan’s back.","Yao Yuan, who had been winning, looked down at the sword that had pierced his heart from his back.","“Where did this sword come from?” Yao Yuan spat out a mouthful of blood.","Ma Quanquan was astonished.","Someone was able to destroy the wall of the dimension with a single strike, and the blade had pierced the heart of a peak Spiritual Saint. Exactly how capable was this person?","Only a handful of people in Dayan could do that.","There were many Spiritual Saints in the Dayan Empire, but only a handful of them were capable enough to surpass the Spiritual Saint stage. They were all very influential figures and could be considered overlords.","“Yao Yuan!” Ma Quanquan called his friend.","But Yao Yuan turned around and stared at him. “Run! Run!”","After that, Yao Yuan rushed over and wrapped his arms around Yaoxiao.","Yao Yuan moved so fast that he caught Yaoxiao before the latter could react.","Ma Quanquan was a relentless man. When he saw Yao Yuan holding Yaoxiao, he ran toward Yao Yuan and tapped the tip of the sword on Yao Yuan’s back.","With a whoosh, the sword in Yao Yuan’s chest pierced Yaoxiao’s chest as well.","“Argh!” Before Yaoxiao could react, the sword had pierced his chest. He screamed.","What was worse...","Yao Yuan bit Yaoxiao’s neck.","Infuriated, Yaoxiao smacked Yao Yuan on the head, while Ma Quanquan dashed off.","“Stop him!” Infuriated, Master Min dashed off. Ma Quanquan ran as fast as he could.","He protected his heart as he ran.","He knew that the master hiding in the dark was watching him and could kill him at any moment.","It wasn’t that he couldn’t die, but he couldn’t die now.."]},{"number":4052,"title":"Chapter 4052: Third Senior Brother (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4052: Third Senior Brother (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Min and Yaoxiao ran after Ma Quanquan as fast as they could, but Ma Quanquan was too fast for them to catch up.","Min Yichen and Yaoxiao looked at each other, and Min Yichen said, “He already knows who we are, so we have to silence him. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable!”","Yaoxiao nodded solemnly.","But they kept running until they couldn’t find Ma Quanquan anymore.","The two of them searched for Ma Quanquan in Donglin City for a long time, but they still couldn’t find him. Feeling utterly guilty, they went to look for the Dongsang King.","The Dongsang King panicked when he heard the news.","If Ma Quanquan lived to see the people of Dayan, then...","He had no choice but to go to Chu Tianxiao.","“Useless!” Chu Tianxiao frowned and said coldly, “Two peak-level Spiritual Saints can’t even catch up with a peak-level Spiritual Saint. They’re useless!”","The Dongsang King had no choice but to accept the criticism.","Chu Tianxiao rose to his feet and disappeared the next second.","“Minister Chu...” The Dongsang King had a bad feeling.","He had a feeling that Master Chu would never come back to the Dongsang Kingdom, so he called out involuntarily.","But Chu Tianxiao didn’t answer him and disappeared.","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu tried to figure out where Ma Quanquan could be.","Would the Dongsang King find him and kill him?","Feng Wu didn’t want Ma Quanquan dead.","If Ma Quanquan died, what the Dongsang King did to them would be covered up, and the Junwu Empire would take the fall. Therefore, Feng Wu hoped that Ma Quanquan would live to see the second batch of reinforcements from the Dayan Empire.","“The only problem is that sword that came out of nowhere,” Feng Wu said to","Little phoemx In distress.","Little Phoenix was so lost in its thoughts and didn’t hear Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at it in bewilderment. “What are you thinking?”","“The aura.” Little Phoenix smacked its own head, hopped to Yao Yuan’s side, and walked around his dead body.","The sword that had pierced Yao Yuan’s body had flown back to its owner. Yao Yuan lay there with his back soaked with blood.","“That’s very familiar.” Little Phoenix rubbed its chin and tried to think.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","Little Phoenix was very familiar with such power.","“Third Senior Brother?!” Feng Wu looked at Little Phoenix in excitement. “Was it really him?!”","Little Phoenix suddenly realized something. “That’s right! That’s his scent!","That’s why it feels so familiar!”","Feng Wu almost jumped to her feet.","Her main purpose in coming to the Dongsang Kingdom was to find her third senior brother and get the third broken star piece from him! How difficult would it be to find the elusive third senior brother?!","“Although my third senior brother has taken action, it’s still too difficult to find him.” Feng Wu was quick-witted. “Quickly, let’s go!” Little Phoenix asked, “Where are you going?”","Feng Wu said as she rushed out, “Go find Ma Quanquan!","“Since my third senior brother killed Yao Yuan, someone must have asked him to do that. It has to be the Dongsang King:","“Ma Quanquan is gone, but my third senior brother has been asked to kill him!","“If we find Ma Quanquan in time, not only will we save him, but we’ll also be able to see my third senior brother! We have to hurry up!”"]},{"number":4053,"title":"Chapter 4053: Third Senior Brother (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4053: Third Senior Brother (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But where is Ma Quanquan now?” Little Phoenix looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu recalled what she had learned from Princess Yan Ling. Rubbing her chin, she said, “Ma Quanquan must know that a Spiritual Saint wants to kill him. He won’t be able to hide.","“In that case, the place he should be at the moment is...","“The direction where the Dayan Empire’s reinforcement is coming.","“Princess Yan Ling mentioned it before. Their first stop from the Dayan Empire is the northern icefield. We’ll go that way!”","After that, Feng Wu ran as fast as she could with Little Phoenix.","“I’ll take you.”","The fist-sized Little Phoenix suddenly turned into a two-meter-long bird.","Feng Wu nodded right away.","Little Phoenix was flying much faster than she was because the journey north was covered with mountains. She would waste a lot of time if she walked on land, but Little Phoenix could fly in a straight line.","Feng Wu let Little Phoenix take her without hesitation.","Thanks to Little Phoenix, they moved very fast.","However, someone else was faster than Feng Wu.","A figure stood at the formation core of Northern Icefield.","He wore a white robe with the lower hem of it flapping in the wind. There was a stern look on his face, and he looked exceptionally handsome.","Ma Quanquan was thrilled to see the formation core, but he was alarmed when he saw the swordsman standing there with his arms crossed.","“Ma Quanquan?” Chu Tianxiao asked indifferently.","“You’re...” Ma Quanquan gritted his teeth. “Chu Tianxiao, the genius swordsman?!”","Chu Tianxiao looked at him and nodded.","Ma Quanquan stepped back involuntarily.","Ever since he reached the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage, Ma Quanquan had never been afraid of anyone. It was always other people that were afraid of him. However, he was terrified when he saw Chu Tianxiao this time.","Because Chu Tianxiao looked at him as if he was looking at a dead person.","“Make your move.” Chu Tianxiao frowned. He didn’t like talking nonsense.","Ma Quanquan took a deep breath. He knew that if he became Chu Tianxiao’s target, he wouldn’t survive.","He stared at Chu Tianxiao and tried to negotiate. “The Dayan Empire will pay you ten times what the Dongsang Kingdom will give you! Please let me go.”","Ma Quanquan, a peak Spiritual Saint, knelt down in front of Chu Tianxiao with a pleading look on his face.","He was at the peak of the Spiritual Saint stage.","Onlv a handful of DeoDle on this continent could reach that level.","However, Chu Tianxiao remained unperturbed.","He had drawn out his sword.","Fighting back his anger, Ma Quanquan went on. “I’m not doing this for myself. I’m advocating for the princess. You can kill me, but I want to make a deal with you.”","Chu Tianxiao didn’t reply.","Ma Quanquan said, “Can you tell Prince Yan of the Dayan Empire that it was the Dongsang King who killed Princess Yan Ling?","“I know they’re going to blame it on the Junwu Empire, but the Dongsang King is the culprit! The Junwu Empire is going to be destroyed, but the Dongsang","Kingdom won’t survive either!”","Chu Tianxiao drew out his sword as an answer.","He wouldn’t even make that deal?","“Chu Tianxiao, you’re not from the Dongsang Kingdom! Why are you helping the Dongsang King?!” Ma Quanquan bellowed.."]},{"number":4054,"title":"Chapter 4054: Third Senior Brother (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4054: Third Senior Brother (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chu Tianxiao said, “I owe him one.”","Ma Quanquan asked, “Is there no room for negotiation?”","Chu Tianxiao nodded.","Ma Quanquan said, “The Dayan Empire won’t forgive you.”","Chu Tianxiao said, “Alright.”","Ma Quanquan was speechless.","With a flash of the sword, blood gushed out of his throat. Ma Quanquan’s blood vessel was severed.","“Stop!”","It was too late when Feng Wu arrived on Little Phoenix’s back.","Feng Wu jumped off Little Phoenix and ran toward Ma Quanquan. She was frustrated when she saw him on the ground.","She had spared Ma Quanquan’s life so that he could tell the Dayan Empire what happened in the Dongsang Kingdom.","“You...”","Ma Quanquan, who was still alive, stared at the girl.","Feng Wu wasn’t wearing her real face now. She was pretending to be Xingxiang, Princess Yan Ling’s maid. Therefore, Ma Quanquan recognized the girl as Xingxiang, who worked for Princess Yan Ling.","Right now, Ma Quanquan could barely speak. Something dawned on Feng Wu, and she came up with a plan.","“The princess is dead. She asked me to do three things for her!”","Feng Wu said earnestly, “Lord Jing killed the princess and designed everything. Ever since he found out that the princess knew about him and Night Owl, he had planned everything to silence the princess.","“Princess told me to go to the prince and tell him about her death so that he could take revenge for her!”","Ma Quanquan wanted to say something, but he couldn’t utter a word. He then gestured at Feng Wu to search his sleeve.","Feng Wu took a storage ring out of his sleeve.","Ma Quanquan used his last bit of strength to draw back the blood he had gathered on the ring- Onlv then would Feng WII he able to use it-","“Go...” Ma Quanquan nudged Feng Wu and stared at Chu Tianxiao.","However, the swordsman put away his sword and said indifferently, “She’s not on the list.”","He would only kill those on the list.","Ma Quanquan let out a breath of relief. Chu Tianxiao was ready to leave as well. However, Feng Wu ran up to him in a hurry. “Third Senior Brother!”","What the hell? Ma Quanquan couldn’t take it anymore. He stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu couldn’t care less about his feelings now. Wiping her face with her hand, Feng Wu removed the disguise and showed her real face.","“Third Senior Brother, it’s me!” Feng Wu rushed to Chu Tianxiao’s side.","In the snowfield, the teenage girl stood there against the light. Her skin was fair and tender, her features were exquisite, and she looked stunning... She couldn’t be more beautiful.","But Ma Quanquan found it terrifying.","That wasn’t Xingxiang at all, but...","Feng wu! It was Feng wu!","However, with his throat cut, Ma Quanquan couldn’t speak anymore. He could only stare at Feng Wu.","If she wasn’t Xingxiang... If she could change her appearance at will, did that mean that she could pretend to be anyone?","An idea suddenly struck Ma Quanquan, and he seemed to understand everything.","At first, he couldn’t figure out why Night Light would suddenly attack Princess","Yan Ling. It was obvious that he didn’t have a motive, and there was also Lord Jing.. He should have agreed to work with Princess Yan Ling to keep her mouth shut, instead of killing her like this..."]},{"number":4055,"title":"Chapter 4055: Third Senior Brother (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4055: Third Senior Brother (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ma Quanquan recalled how Feng Wu had suppressed Princess Yan Ling when they first met in the Junwu Empire.","She was so smart and so far-sighted..","So, it was her, wasn’t it? She was the one who had stirred up all the trouble in Donglin City!","Ma Quanquan panted.","He stared at Feng Wu and wanted to say something, but he couldn’t utter a word.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu didn’t notice Ma Quanquan’s reaction. She blocked Chu","Tianxiao’s way and beamed at him. “Senior Brother Chu!”","Chu Tianxiao stopped, glanced at her, and gave her a slight nod.","What?","Feng Wu looked confused.","Her third senior brother’s reaction was a little strange.","She had addressed him as her third senior brother, but he didn’t seem confused. That was to say, he already knew who she was.","Before Feng Wu could ask anything, Chu Tianxiao glanced at her. “You’re quite active.”","Feng wu said, ‘What...’","Chu Tianxiao said, “You’re so weak, but you’re still able to stir up trouble in","nnn?lin City Thnt’q verv ”","Feng Wu looked up at the lanky third senior brother and felt that there was a taunting tone in his voice.","However...","“How did you know that?” Feng Wu was curious.","Chu Tianxiao wouldn’t have said a word to anyone else, but he was patient with this girl. He tossed a small ball to Feng Wu.","What was that?","Feng Wu was astonished when she saw the image of the ball.","Gosh, wasn’t it... Wasn’t it the scene where Feng Wu pretended to be Jing Wei, Lord Jing’s guard? Following the image, Feng Wu saw all the things she had done in Donglin City...","As it turned out, the ball had recorded everything she thought was very confidential.","“It recorded everything...” Feng Wu was so embarrassed that she wanted to bury her face in her hands.","Chu Tianxiao glanced at her and nodded.","Feng Wu scratched her head in frustration. The Dongsang King would be furious if he got his hands on this ball.","She gave her third senior brother a pleading look.","Her third senior brother looked up at the distant sky.","Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve and murmured, ‘Senior Brother Chu, you know that I’m your junior sister, don’t you?”","Chu Tianxiao glanced at her and nodded.","Feng Wu was a little upset by her third senior brother’s aloof attitude.","Back in the Northern Yan Kingdom, her sixth senior brother was so enthusiastic about her that he couldn’t wait to dote on her. However, her third senior brother was so unapproachable.","However, Feng Wu soon convinced herself.","She wasn’t a money bag, so of course, not everyone would like her. Her third senior brother wasn’t on friendly terms with her, so it was only natural that he would treat her like this. At that thought, Feng Wu adjusted her mood and smiled.","“You won’t give it to the Dongsang King, will you?” Feng Wu asked gingerly.","Chu Tianxiao didn’t reply.","Feng Wu went on. “Then... can I have it?”","Chu Tianxiao asked, “Do you like it?”","Feng Wu thought, “No, I don’t. I just don’t want the Dongsang King to know what I did. Otherwise, he’ll try to kill me.”","However, Feng Wu only nodded, saying that she liked it and wanted to keep it as a memento. After all, she had created quite a scene this time.."]},{"number":4056,"title":"Chapter 4056: Third Senior Brother (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4056: Third Senior Brother (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chu Tianxiao nodded.","Seeing that her third senior brother didn’t object, Feng Wu put the ball away.","Seeing that Chu Tianxiao was leaving, she rushed to his side. “Senior Brother Chu, where are you going?”","Chu Tianxiao pointed at a small black passageway ahead of them. Feng Wu looked amazed. “Don’t tell me that the black tunnel leads to the Empire of Dayan.”","Chu Tianxiao didn’t reply but only nodded.","Feng Wu said, “That’s it? We can walk in Just like that?”","Chu Tianxiao glanced at Feng Wu, his face impassive, but he still explained to her, “To get to the Dayan Empire from here, one has to be a Spiritual Saint or above.”","Feng Wu said, “Can I go? I’m a junior Spiritual Saint now.”","Chu Tianxiao shook his head.","Feng Wu was confused. “Wh- why?”","Chu Tianxiao asked, “Do you have an access token?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Chu Tianxiao said, “There you go.”","Feng Wu asked, “Then where should I get it?”","Chu Tianxiao glanced at Feng Wu and didn’t answer her. After a pause, he said,","“You don’t need to go there.”","After that, he was about to step into the black tunnel.","Feng Wu was exasperated. After everything she had gone through to find her third senior brother, she wasn’t going to let him go just like that!","“Don’t you want to save our master?”","Feng Wu shouted after him.","According to her sixth senior brother, his third senior brother wasn’t on friendly terms with him, so he couldn’t mention her sixth senior brother’s name. However, her third senior brother worshiped their master the same way her sixth senior brother did, and the beautiful master was the only one who could persuade him.","As expected, when Feng Wu said “master” , the aloof swordsman stopped and turned around to stare at her.","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t speak, he walked up to her, stopped in front of her, and stared at her with his brooding black eyes. “What did you say?”","The look in his eyes was as sharp as a sword and gloomy at the same time, giving off an intimidating feeling.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief. Finally, there was someone who could stop her third senior brother. She was secretly elated, but she didn’t let it show on her face. She smiled and said, “I’ve met my master. I know where he is.”","Chu Tianxiao stared at Feng Wu. “Is he still alive?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes, he’s still alive.”","Feng Wu could sense that the man had tears in his eyes when he heard those words.","An idea struck Feng Wu, and she said earnestly, “He’s really alive. I mean it.”","“Where?” Chu Tianxiao stared at Feng Wu. “Take me to him.”","Feng Wu hesitated. “Well... I’m afraid I can’t do that.”","Chu Tianxiao didn’t reply, but the look in his eyes was as sharp as a blade. Feng Wu explained in a hurry. “Senior Brother Chu, you really can’t go there.”","Chu Tianxiao smirked. “I can go anywhere, heaven, earth, hell, or even beyond the three worlds!”","Feng Wu said, “Well, it’s not outside the three worlds... It’s in the ring space.” Chu Tianxiao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu sighed and told Chu Tianxiao about how her beautiful master had fainted while trying to save her. “...Senior Brother Chu, that’s what happened. It was all my fault... Do you want to punish me?” Chu Tianxiao stared at Feng Wu suspiciously.","Feng Wu summoned Little Phoenix right away.","“Little Fatty?” Chu Tianxiao blurted out when he saw Little Phoenix.."]},{"number":4057,"title":"Chapter 4057: Third Senior Brother (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4057: Third Senior Brother (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix hadn’t gotten its full memory back yet, so it couldn’t remember everything, but it was displeased when Chu Tianxiao blurted out the nickname.","“Who’s the fatty? Who are you calling fatty? I’m not!”","Feng Wu chuckled when she saw the proud look on Little Phoenix’s face.","Little Phoenix turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “I’m not a little fatty. How am I fat now? Am I right?!”","Seeing the threatening look in Little Phoenix’s eyes, Feng Wu had no choice but to say yes.","Chu Tianxiao understood everything when he saw Little Phoenix.","He stared at Feng Wu. “So?”","Feng Wu said, “My master won’t wake up until I gather all four broken star pieces. I’ve collected the first one, and the second one will soon be completed...”","“I know where the third one is,” Chu Tianxiao said indifferently. “It’ll take me a while. ”","Feng Wu nodded earnestly.","“One month.” Chu Tianxiao turned to leave after that. He stopped after a few steps and tossed something to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu saw that it was a jade slip.","“Go cultivate in the valley. Come out when you’re done.” Chu Tianxiao pointed in a direction, which was the valley where he had been cultivating. His aura was there, which could help Feng Wu with her cultivation.","Chu Tianxiao left without a trace, while Feng Wu cultivated in his valley.","Feng Wu didn’t know until she opened the jade slip that it contained a","cultivation technique.","“The Swordplay of the World?” Feng Wu murmured, looking at the name in bewilderment.","Little Phoenix grew excited when it heard that. “The Swordplay of the World?","Hey, let me see it! Let me see it!”","Little Phoenix moved closer and looked excited. After it finished reading the manual, it turned around and looked at Feng Wu in excitement. Feng Wu was confused. “What’s wrong?”","Little Phoenix couldn’t hide its excitement. “Chu is so nice to you!”","Recalling her third senior brother’s darkened face, Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I don’t think so. He’s very aloof. He doesn’t like me at all...”","“That’s not true!” Little Phoenix glanced at Feng Wu. “He wouldn’t have given this to you if he didn’t like you! It’s the ultimate skill of his life!” Feng Wu said, “But I’m a Fallen Star Swordplay practitioner, and this new one...”","Little Phoenix was exasperated. “Yes, you’re cultivating Fallen Star Swordplay, but you created it. Apart from Fallen Star Swordplay, The Swordplay of the World is the best swordplay on this continent.","“After you learn World Swordplay, you’ll be much more capable. Then, you can learn by analogy and create more advanced stances for Fallen Star Swordplay.","“Your third senior brother has given the Swordplay of the World to you as a cultivation material! It’s the most famous swordplay he’s proud of!","“Do you know how big a scene it will be if the news gets out? Even the hidden families will fight for it.","“I’m sure the Dongsang King wants the swordplay, but Chu never taught him anything. Instead, he gave you the entire manual so that you can learn it.","“Quickly, learn it. Maybe you’ll make another breakthrough after that!” Little Phoenix looked expectantly at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was already a Level-2 Spiritual Saint.. If she made another breakthrough..."]},{"number":4058,"title":"Chapter 4058: Return (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4058: Return (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix was right. When Feng Wu finished cultivating the swordplay her third senior brother gave her, she was already a Level-3 Spiritual Saint.","But a month had passed since then.","Feng Wu had been cultivating for the past month without knowing what was going on outside.","Little Phoenix didn’t run around either. It was cultivating as well.","Compared to Feng Wu, Little Phoenix was much faster because it was already a Celestial Prime. Its memory had been sealed, but its cultivation level was still there.","All it needed to do now was to remove the seal.","In a month, Feng Wu had become a Level-3 Spiritual Saint, and so had Little Phoenix.","“Let’s go back to the Junwu Empire.”","Meanwhile, the Junwu Empire was on edge.","What happened in the Dongsang Kingdom couldn’t be kept a secret.","Therefore, the news spread to other countries as if it had wings.","Since Northern Yan had gotten the news, of course, the Junwu Empire knew about it. Feng Xiangnan was the first to receive the information.","General Feng was astonished when he read the report.","Just like last time, Mr. Lu, Mr. Xu, Elder Helian, and Elder Dongfang were all there.","“General?” Everyone looked at him in amazement. Had something happened in the Dongsang Kingdom again?","“It’s indeed something big.” The general smiled. “As for what happened, take this letter and spread it out on the table.”","Everyone was so curious that they all stood in front of the table and read the letter.","“Princess Yan Ling was assassinated in her residence?!”","“Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan are both dead?”","“Princess Yan Ling is dead, too?!”","Everyone was astonished and looked at General Feng in unison, wondering what he had done.","General Feng smiled bitterly. “Do you think Junwu has the capability to do that?”","Master Linghu was capable of doing that, but it was common knowledge that Master Linghu couldn’t leave the imperial capital.","Jun Linyuan wasn’t capable enough to kill two peak Spiritual Saints. Therefore, no one in the Junwu Empire was capable enough to do such a thing.","“So... who did this?” Elder Helian looked surprised.","General Feng shrugged. Who knew?","“Pfft...","Elder Dongfang chuckled. “Does it matter who did it? Princess Yan Ling died in","tne Dongsang Kingdom, and so did tne two top spiritual saints. ‘l’nat’s enough.”","Mr Lu nodded. “That’s right. The Dongsang Kingdom is backed by the Dayan","Dynasty, but Princess Yan Ling, the emissary, is dead, and the Dongsang","Kingdom is to be blamed.”","Mr. Xu said, “Princess Yan Ling had a conflict with Night Light and Lord Jing of the Dongsang Kingdom, didn’t she? The prince is dead, but Lord Jing is still alive. Did he do it?”","Mr. Lu shook his head. “Lord Jing isn’t capable enough. The Dongsang King is the only one who can do that.”","Mr. Xu said, “But the Dongsang King couldn’t wait to fawn on Princess Yan Ling. Why would he kill her?”","Hence, it was as if they had fallen into a mess.","Just then, Elder Helian’s eyes lit up. “That’s not right! Something doesn’t feel right!”","All eyes were on Elder Helian.","Elder Helian said, “Xiao Wu has been in the Dongsang Kingdom for two months, hasn’t she? Why hasn’t she told us anything? That doesn’t sound like her at all!”"]},{"number":4059,"title":"Chapter 4059: Return (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4059: Return (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mr. Lu smiled bitterly. “This girl is indeed extremely smart and talented, but she’s still not strong enough. Moreover, what can she do when she’s gone to Dongsang alone?”","Elder Dongfang nodded as well. “That’s right. She’s a little disappointing.”","Elder Helian objected. “Maybe Xiao Wu is behind what happened to Princess Yan Ling. She’s the best at it.”","“That’s not possible.” This time, even General Feng spoke. He smiled bitterly and said, “With Princess Yan Ling and the two top Spiritual Saints, no matter how smart Xiao Wu is, she’s still too weak to do it.”","Elder Helian gave it some thought and agreed with him.","“But we have to be careful.” General Feng frowned a little. “The Dongsang King isn’t stupid. On the contrary, he’s very smart. He’ll never wait for this to spread and affect his relationship with the Dayan Empire.”","Mr. Lu frowned a little. “But Princess Yan Ling has indeed died in the Dongsang Kingdom, as well as those two peak Spiritual Saints. How can the king deny that?”","General Feng asked coldly, “What if he’s trying to shift the blame to someone else?”","“A scapegoat?” Everyone looked at General Feng.","Feng Xiangnan nodded. “The Dayan Empire is targeting the Junwu Empire. What if the Dongsang Kingdom uses this opportunity to blame it on us? What if they say that we’ve assassinated Princess Yan Ling and her people?” Elder Helian said, “That’s impossible. We’re not capable enough..","Feng Xiangnan said, “It’s true that we’re not capable enough, but they can always find a way to frame us. The Dayan Empire also wants to blame it on the Junwu Empire. That way, it’ll be justifiable for them to destroy us.”","“That’s impossible...”","Although Elder Helian still tried to deny it, it was obvious that he hesitated.","By then, the others had stiffened.","The Dongsang King might actually do that.","And it was very likely!","Feng Xiangnan jumped to his feet. “No, I have to report this to His Majesty. I need to go back to the imperial capital!”","The next second, Feng Xiangnan was out of sight.","In less than 15 minutes, Feng Xiangnan was in front of Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu’s first reaction when he saw Feng Xiangnan was to ask, “Have you heard from Xiao Wu? She’s been quiet in the Dongsang Kingdom ever since she got there. There’s no news at all.”","Feng Xiangnan smiled bitterly. “No, I haven’t.”","The Junwu Empire frowned. “That girl is all by herself... Is something going to happen to her? If that’s the case, how am I going to answer to the crown prince?”","Feng Xiangnan smiled bitterly again. “No news of the girl is the best news. Your Majesty, if the Dongsang King finds out about her, he’ll have to take her hostage.”","Emperor Wu’s eyes lit up. “You’re right!”","Seeing the Junwu Empire’s bright smile, Feng Xiangnan didn’t want to disturb them.","Emperor Wu looked at Feng Xiangnan. “It’s a big deal to have you back in the imperial capital. Tell me, what happened?”","Feng Xiangnan handed in the information without another word.","Emperor Wu chuckled as he read the information, but he frowned after that.. “Princess Yan Ling and her people are dead...’"]},{"number":4060,"title":"Chapter 4060: General Star Technique (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4060: General Star Technique (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu chuckled as he read the information, but he frowned after that.","“The death of Princess Yan Ling and her people is indeed a good thing for the Junwu Empire. The Dongsang Kingdom and the Dayan Empire are at war, but do you think things will turn out the way we want?” Feng Xiangnan said solemnly, “That’s what worries me.”","Emperor Wu looked concerned.","It wouldn’t be so bad if it was only the Dongsang Kingdom, but the Dayan Empire was coming at them in a threatening manner, which gave them a lot of pressure.","“Don’t tell anyone about the competition in three months, or the people will panic,” Emperor Wu told Feng Xiangnan.","Feng Xiangnan nodded.","Just then, Feng Xiangnan heard a voice in his head.","“Come to the Wandering Temple.”","It was Master Linghu.","After Feng Xiangnan left, Master Linghu gave him a cultivation technique book without another word.","Feng Xiangnan had learned from Master Linghu. Although Master Linghu wouldn’t admit it, Feng Xiangnan still respected him as a teacher.","“Master, this is...","Master Linghu glanced at him. “Kneel.”","Without hesitation, Feng Xiangnan dropped to his knees.","Master Linghu looked at Feng Xiangnan and said slowly, “I haven’t taken you in as my pupil for years. Do you resent me for that?”","Feng Xiangnan immediately said, “No!”","Master Linghu asked, “Do you know why?”","Feng Xiangnan shook his head.","Master Linghu didn’t explain but only told Feng Xiangnan, “I can be your teacher now.”","“What?!” Feng Xiangnan stared at Master Linghu in bewilderment.","Master Linghu asked, “What? You don’t want to?”","Feng Xiangnan said, ‘Yes, of course! I’d love to!”","Master Linghu nodded. “From now on, you’re a member of the Mu Sect. Stand up.”","The Mu sect?","Feng Xiangnan suddenly looked up at Master Linghu and was so surprised that he forgot to get up.","The Mu sect?","Everyone knew what that was.","The Mu Sect was the sect of the founder of the continent!","All martial arts came from the Mu Sect.","But it was said that the Mu Sect only had seven disciples, and there had never been any increase. So, Master Linghu was...","“I’m the fifth disciple of the sect, and you have five Martial Uncles and a young Martial Aunt.”","Master Linghu’s pupils contracted a little when he mentioned the young Martial Aunt because he suddenly remembered something...","Feng Wu was Feng Xiangnan’s Martial Aunt, but Feng Xiangnan was Feng Wu’s godfather... What a complicated relationship...","Master Linghu rubbed his forehead. Whatever. He couldn’t care less.","“You’ve had enough experience over the years, but you haven’t made any progress. That’s because you’re lacking a cultivation technique. From now on, you can cultivate this ‘General Star Technique’. After suppressing you for so many years, I’m sure you’ll make rapid progress this time.”","In fact, Master Linghu had been suppressing Feng Xiangnan for years.","It was more like honing his mind to the point that he could withstand the Star General Technique.","“Master...” Feng Xiangnan was touched when he recalled how much Master Linghu had invested in him over the years. Tears welled up in his eyes.","Master Linghu waved his hand. “If you want to thank someone, thank your Martial Aunt.”","“My Martial Aunt?” Feng Xiangnan looked at Master Linghu in bewilderment.","“Where is she? Will I have a chance to meet her?”","Master Linghu nodded. ‘You know her..”"]},{"number":4061,"title":"Chapter 4061: General Star Technique (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4061: General Star Technique (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xiangnan looked at Master Linghu in bewilderment, but the latter only waved at him and said, “You’ll know who she is when the time is right.” Feng Xiangnan nodded, but he didn’t listen. He was too excited.","The Mu Sect... So, he was Master Mu’s pupil now!!!","Master Linghu said, “Go cultivate now.”","Feng Xiangnan looked concerned. “But, Master, the Peace Grassland...” Master Linghu said grumpily, “Didn’t Six buy you three months?”","Six?","Feng Xiangnan was surprised for a moment but soon looked surprised. “Master, are you saying that Patriarch Huyan is...”","Master Linghu nodded and said indifferently, “Yes, he’s your Martial Uncle.” Holy crap...","As a general, Feng Xiangnan had seen much of the world over the years, but he was still shocked when he heard the news.","Patriarch Xuanyuan and Master Linghu were brothers, and both were Master Mu’s pupils. One was the sixth, and the other the fifth...","Feng Xiangnan thought to himself, “The fifth and sixth disciples of Master Mu are overlords on this continent. They’re the pillars of kingdoms...”","How capable would his other Martial Uncle’s be? Feng Xiangnan was elated.","He had lost all hope when the Dongsang Kingdom and Dayan Empire joined hands, but he was suddenly over the moon. “Go cultivate!” Master Linghu urged her.","Feng Xiangnan nodded solemnly.","He knew that only when he was strong enough could he protect the Junwu Empire with all his effort. To do that, he was willing to sacrifice his own life.","Feng Wu asked around about the Dongsang Kingdom as soon as she left her third senior brother’s valley.","Sitting in a restaurant, she soon learned what was going on in the Dongsang Kingdom.","The Dongsang King didn’t try to keep the death of Princess Yan Ling and the others a secret. Not only that, but he had also directed the public opinion in the Junwu Empire’s direction, saying that the empire had sent someone to do it.","Anyone with eyes could tell that it was impossible.","Were people of the Junwu Empire capable of that?","To be able to infiltrate Dongsang City and kill Princess Yan Ling and the two peak Spiritual Saints without alerting the Dongsang Kingdom, how could they escape unscathed?","If they could do that, Junwu wouldn’t have been bullied by the Dongsang Kingdom.","But that was how the Dongsang King led the public opinion, and the people of the Dongsang Kingdom believed it. Therefore, public opinion was all over the place, and everyone was condemning the Junwu Empire.","“The Junwu Empire deserves to die! How dare they kill Princess Yan Ling and slander us?!”","“That’s right! The Junwu Empire is so malicious! They’re trying to create discord between us and the Dayan Empire! They’re trying to force the Dayan Empire to attack us!”","Feng Wu thought, “Well, you were right. It really was me, but you don’t have any proof.”","Someone else said, “The Junwu Empire has gone too far. I heard that our capable cultivators have gone after them, hoping to catch the assassins. That way, we’ll have proof!”","Hearing this, the spies of the Junwu Empire immediately deliver the information to the Junwu Empire.."]},{"number":4062,"title":"Chapter 4062: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4062: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","[Nest casue.","Thump!","Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu frowned when they read the report. Mr. Xu pounded his fist on the table in frustration.","“That’s outrageous!” Mr. Xu was furious. “The general is right. The Dongsang","Kingdom is trying to blame Princess Yan Ling’s death on the Junwu Empire!”","Mr. Lu frowned as well. Crossing his hands behind his back, he paced back and forth in the main hall. “This is big.”","Mr. Xu said, “You don’t say! Something big is going to happen!”","Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu had no idea that the Dayan Empire wanted to destroy the Junwu Empire. All they knew was that the Dongsang Kingdom wanted to use the Dayan Empire to destroy the Junwu Empire.","“Where’s the general?” Mr. Xu asked hastily.","Mr. Lu said, “The general has sent a message. He’s cultivating with Master Linghu and won’t be back for a while. However, Master Linghu will keep an eye on things here. The Dongsang Kingdom won’t be able to do anything to us for the time being.”","Mr. Xu took a deep breath. “The duel is only a month away, and the Dongsang Kingdom is doing this... Unfortunately, we don’t have any proof, so we can only let them slander us!”","Mr. Lu said, “That’s right. I wish I could get in touch with that girl, but I haven’t heard from her since she went to the Dongsang Kingdom... I wonder how she’s doing now.”","Mr. Xu snorted. “She was so confident that she was going to destroy the","Dongsang Kingdom all by herself... I didn’t see her do anything.”","The two principals were worried sick. Meanwhile, Feng Wu was listening to the Dongsang Kingdom’s public opinion in a restaurant.","Little Phoenix was so angry that it laughed, let alone Feng Wu.","“That Dongsang King is really interesting. I didn’t know he could say that!” Little Phoenix snorted.","Feng Wu nodded.","Just then, they heard a hubbub of voices in the restaurant, and everyone ran toward the window.","“It’s Lord Jing! It’s him!”","“I heard that Lord Jing saw it with his own eyes. It was someone from the Junwu Empire who killed Princess Yan Ling. Do you know who it was?","“Who was it?”","“Jun Linyuan!”","“Jun Linyuan? As in the crown prince of the Junwu Empire?!”","“That’s right! It’s the crown prince of the Junwu Empire! It’s said that Jun Linyuan is a very capable cultivator with unfathomable capability. He’s here to assassinate Princess Yan Ling to frame the Dongsang Kingdom!”","“Damn it! The Junwu Empire is abominable! Jun Linyuan is even worse!”","“Apart from Jun Linyuan, I heard that the master protector of the Junwu","Empire is here as well.”","“Are you talking about Master Linghu?”","“That’s right! It’s him! It’s said that he’s beyond the Spiritual Saint stage! If it hadn’t been for him, Princess Yan Ling’s two experts would never have died! His Majesty would have noticed it as well!”","“That explains everything. But how did you know that?”","“My brother-in-law’s sister-in-law’s cousin works in the Jing Manor, so she’s much better informed than you. Trust me!”","“We have to raze the Junwu Empire to the ground and take it over! We’ll enslave and humiliate them!","“How dare they do that to the Dongsang Kingdom? That’s a provocation! We have to kill them all!”"]},{"number":4063,"title":"Chapter 4063: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4063: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu’s eyes flickered when she heard that.","Little Phoenix was so furious that it walked back and forth in the ring.","“Wow! That’s so frustrating!","“That’s all bullshit! How could they do that?!","“And how dare that Lord Jing?!” Would Lord Jing dare to do that?","He would!","Lord Jing, who had ridden past the restaurant, was surrounded by a group of people, who were all asking him about Princess Yan Ling.","He said in front of everyone, “The Junwu Empire has indeed done it. Don’t worry. In a month, the Dongsang Kingdom will destroy the Junwu Empire!”","‘Yeah!”","The common people of Donglin City were thrilled.","He then used the opportunity to accuse the Junwu Empire of everything they had done, especially Jun Linyuan.","Little Phoenix noticed that Feng Wu was blushing.","“Hey, do you want to hit him now?” Little Phoenix didn’t want Feng Wu to explode.","“Hit him?” Feng Wu smirked. “That’ll be too easy for him.”","“How are you going to get back at him?” Little Phoenix was curious.","Feng Wu smiled. “When he’s at his happiest moment, of course...”","She didn’t know if it was a coincidence or not, but at that moment, she heard a clap of thunder!","There was a loud bang!","What was that?","Everyone stared at the north in astonishment.","Meanwhile, dark clouds were gathering in the north, as if endless lightning bolts were galloping toward them at full speed!","They heard rumbling sounds in their ears, and their vision went dark. The intimidating energy made their hearts race.","The pressure made them want to kneel down and kowtow.","That was...","In the crowd, Lord Jing was astonished.","Were the people of Dayan here?","Recalling what he had done, Lord Jing still felt guilty and didn’t dare to linger. He immediately ran toward the imperial palace.","Night Owl, the crown prince, had also sensed the intimidating energy and ran toward the imperial palace without hesitation.","The Dongsang King was on his way out when they ran into the imperial palace. Seeing them, he said, “Quickly, come with me to welcome the envoy of the superior state!”","A superior state... That was right. Compared to the Dongsang Kingdom, the Dayan Empire was a superior state.","Lord Jing and Night Owl looked at each other and nodded.","When their eyes met, they warned each other that they had to keep that secret.","The spacious square outside the imperial palace was empty.","The Dongsang King came out with the officials to greet the guests.","They weren’t the only ones. The people of the Dongsang Kingdom had all knelt on the ground.","Of course, the people kneeling in front of them were cultivators, not common folks. Common folks wouldn’t dare to join in the fun. They would have stayed at home already.","Those people had arrived on rare birds!","The leader of the team was a teenager wearing a purple robe. He was handsome and had a cold and arrogant look on his face. As for his capability, no one knew how capable he was.","He was riding a Qilin Beast that was covered in shiny scales. That Qilin Beast alone was already a peak Spiritual Saint.","The teenager had two guards with him.","One was a one-eyed teenager with a bow, and the other one was a black-robed teenager with a sword. Both were at least advanced Spiritual Saints.."]},{"number":4064,"title":"Chapter 4064: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4064: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Behind them was a team of Spiritual Saints.","What a terrifying team!","The Dongsang Emperor felt dizzy when he saw them.","Many drew in their breaths.","That was incredible!","For them, destroying the Dongsang Kingdom would be a piece of cake.","Feng Wu was sitting in a restaurant very close to the square of the imperial capital. Right now, she was squinting at the scene.","The other people in the restaurant were already trembling in fear. They all dropped to their knees, except for Feng Wu.","Not only wouldn’t she kneel, but she also had a cunning smile on her face.","“Why aren’t you kneeling? Kneel!”","The shopkeeper frowned when he saw Feng Wu. Gritting his teeth, he reminded her in a low voice.","Kneel?","Kneeling wasn’t part of Feng Wu’s vocabulary, so she only said two words in reply. “Get lost!”","“You!” The shopkeeper was furious.","The others also glared at Feng Wu.","But they couldn’t do anything to Feng Wu now.","If there were sounds of fighting here, the spiritual essence would fluctuate, which would immediately attract the attention of the noble people nearby. If that happened, the consequences would be unthinkable.","Hence, one of the people kneeling next to the shopkeeper tugged at him. “Please don’t be mad. She has a death wish. Why should we help her?”","“That’s right. Just wait here. We’ll teach her a lesson when they get to the imperial palace.”","The shopkeeper threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. “Do you know who’s behind this restaurant? The Jing family!”","He was the only one who could afford such an expensive place.","“It’s Lord Jing’s property?”","“How dare that girl disrespect the royal family? It wouldn’t be a big deal if she were anyvvhere else, but she’s in a restaurant in the Jing Manor now. She has a death wish!”","Feng Wu looked at the shopkeeper and said in an amused tone, “Did you just say that this restaurant belonged to Lord Jin?”","The shopkeeper smirked. “Are you scared now? Kneel!”","Feng Wu smiled a little. That would be so much fun.","She exchanged a few words with Little Phoenix in her head before looking out of the window at the square.","By then, Little Phoenix had received Feng Wu’s order and headed for that key spot.","Seeing the teenager come down from the Qilin Beast, the others landed with him.","The Dongsang King didn’t kneel but only bowed respectfully.","Behind him, Night Owl, Lord Jing, and everyone else were all on their knees. “My lord here is Yan Yu, the son of Lord Yan of the Dayan Empire.”","The young lord’s guard straightened his back and spoke to the Dongsang King.","The Dongsang King bowed first. “I’m Leng Zhengrong, the king of the small Dongsang Kingdom. It’s an honor to meet you, my lord.”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow.","One had to admit that the Dongsang King acted much humbler than Emperor","Wu in this aspect. He called himself the king of the small Dongsang Kingdom. Feng Wu remembered that when Princess Yan Ling was around, Emperor Wu was neither humble nor overbearing.","Yan Yu wasn’t exactly nice to the Dongsang King, but he wasn’t rude either. He nodded at the king and asked, “Where’s my sister?”","Yan Yu and Princess Yan Ling were from the same mother and were very close.."]},{"number":4065,"title":"Chapter 4065: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4065: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yan Yu wasn’t supposed to be here this time. His father should have sent the son of a concubine. However, Yan Yu was worried about Princess Yan Ling, which was why he had come here himself!","The Dongsang Emperor’s face stiffened a little, but he calmed down soon enough and went back to inviting Yan Yu into the imperial palace.","However, that perfectly stiff look on his face made Yan Yu suspicious.","Yan Yu narrowed his eyes, and there was a dangerous look in them.","The guard shouted, “Princess said in her letter that she was in the Dongsang Kingdom. Where is she now? Speak!”","The prince’s guard could scold the king, and the onlookers were all shocked.","Not many people of the Dayan Empire had come to the Dongsang Kingdom, and they usually only interacted with high-ranking officials. Therefore, the common people didn’t know much about the empire. Princess Yan Ling was the only person in the empire that they knew a little bit better.","They had thought that Princess Yan Ling was already very arrogant, but now, their king wasn’t angry at all.","The Dongsang King had an indescribable look on his face. “Your Highness, let’s go inside first.”","Yan Yu frowned. “I need to know now! Speak!”","The Dongsang King looked like he couldn’t say no. He heaved a long sigh and said to Lord Jing, “Tell the prince.”","Lord Jing walked out from behind the Dongsang King, knelt down, and kowtowed to Yan Yu. He then said between broken sobs, “Your Highness, Princess Yan Ling is...”","Yan Yu’s stomach lurched, and he suddenly had a very bad feeling.","However, he tried to convince himself that it wouldn’t be too dangerous for a member of a superior state to come to a small one, not to mention that Yan Ling had brought Grandpa Ma and Grandpa Yao with her. She could do whatever she wanted on this continent.","Just then, Lord Jing finally said between broken sobs, “Princess Yan Ling was assassinated. Someone from the Junwu Empire has assassinated her!”","“What?!!!”","Yan Yu grabbed Lord Jing by the neck.","Lord Jing almost couldn’t breathe.","And Yan Yu wasn’t the only one. The group of people behind him were so intimidating that they could crush the entire imperial palace.","Seeing that King Jing was almost strangled, the Dongsang King said, “It was the Junwu Empire! Master Linghu and Jun Linyuan killed Princess Yan Ling together! ”","Infuriated, Yan Yu struck out with his fist.","Boom!","More than half of the imperial palace collapsed.","The imperial palace was protected by a formation!","It was where the Dongsang Kingdom’s dragon vein lay!","The others were so shocked that they all held their breaths and didn’t dare to utter a word.","Yan Yu said, “I don’t believe you!”","The Dongsang King was able to recover quickly. He smiled bitterly and said,","“Princess Yan Ling is indeed...”","“What about Ma Quanquan and Yao Yuan?!”","The Dongsang King said, “They were assassinated by the Junwu Empire as well!","“Why did they kill Yan Ling?!”","“Because they want to frame the Dongsang Kingdom!” said Lord Jing. “They want to drive a wedge between the Dongsang Kingdom and the Empire of","Dayan. That’s why they assassinated Princess Yan Ling, pretending that the","Dongsang Kingdom did it. That way, you would destroy the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Yan Yu still wouldn’t believe that Princess Yan Ling was dead.","“Your Highness!”","The one-eyed teenager had left some time ago, but he came back now and whispered something in Yan Yu’s ear.."]},{"number":4066,"title":"Chapter 4066: The Prince of the Yan Dynasty (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4066: The Prince of the Yan Dynasty (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing those words, Yan Yu’s face darkened.","“You can detect the scent of the Yan Ling in that place. And you found Grandpa Yao’s body?”","“It’s not just Grandpa Yao’s body. There’s Grandpa Ma’s as well. Even the princess’s... is here.” The one-eyed teenager took a step away after that.","He knew that the prince was going to explode.","As expected, Yan Yu was furious when he saw the badly wounded body of Princess Yan Ling.","Feng Wu had taken Princess Yan Ling’s body, but her plan changed, so she put it back.","Yan Yu believed it when he saw the three dead bodies.","“Someone from the Junwu Empire did this?” Yan Yu’s face was livid.","Lord Jing nodded immediately. “Yes. It was Master Linghu and Jun Linyuan of the Junwu Empire.”","“Master Linghu? Jun Linyuan?” Yan Yu smirked.","He had never suspected that the Dongsang Kingdom would kill them because that wasn’t possible.","Because of the relationship between the Dongsang Kingdom and the Dayan Empire, the Dongsang Kingdom had to do as told. They wouldn’t dare to kill Yan Ling.","Yan Yu jumped onto the Qilin and was ready to set out for the Junwu Empire","The Dongsang Kingdom’s people let out breaths of relief and thought, “The","Junwu Empire is doomed.”","The people who received the news were trvinz their best to send it to the Junwu","Empire.","The message was that the son of Lord Yan of the Dayan Empire was heading for the Junwu Empire with a large group of Spiritual Saints.","The Junwu Empire was going to be wiped out!","Something happened at that critical moment!","All of a sudden, they heard a voice on the white wall in front of the square. Yan Yu couldn’t care less about that. He was about to charge out when the one-eyed teenager stopped him.","“Your Highness, look!”","Yan Yu trusted the one-eyed teenager, so he stopped and threw a dirty look at the teenager.","The one-eyed teenager pointed at the wall behind them and shouted, “It’s the Spiritual Fossil Stone! It was when the princess was killed!”","Yan Yu immediately turned around.","On the wall was indeed the scene where Princess Yan Ling was killed that day. Every frame was clear.","The Dongsang King’s stomach lurched, and he turned around as well.","Lord Jing was the most astonished of them all.","The scene of Princess Yan Ling being killed? How was that possible? He was the one who had killed Princess Yan Ling. There was no Spiritual Fossil Stone!","However...","He was dumbfounded when he saw the stone.","It was indeed what happened that night.","It recorded everything he said when he killed Princess Yan Ling.","On the wall.","Lord Jing said maliciously, “Don’t worry. If you’re dead, the Dongsang Kingdom won’t be implicated. Even if the Dayan Empire wants to do something, it’ll have to go to the Junwu Empire.”","Yan Ling said, “So, you’re not the only one who wants to kill me. Night Owl and the Dongsang King want to kill me as well! Without the Dongsang King, you won’t be able to persuade Master Min to restrain Grandpa Ma!”","Yan Yu’s face was livid.","When the king realized what had happened, his heart almost jumped out of his mouth.","He gave Master Min warning glances, telling the latter to destroy the Spiritual Fossil Stone now!","He felt that the Dongsang Kingdom was going to be destroyed.","The Spiritual Fossil Stone had to be facing the wall. Hence, when Master Min went to look for it, Yan Yu bellowed.."]},{"number":4067,"title":"Chapter 4067: The Prince of the Yan Dynasty (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4067: The Prince of the Yan Dynasty (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yan Yu bellowed, “Stop right there! Anyone who moves will die!”","Of course, Master Min didn’t dare to move.","His heart was racing, and his face was ghastly pale.","Lord Jing looked even worse.","The images were still playing on the wall.","Lord Jing chuckled. “It’s nothing, really. If you hadn’t been so aggressive, Princess Yan Ling, we wouldn’t have attacked you. Do you know how difficult it is to set you up?”","Princess Yan Ling said, “You set me up? That’s right! You set me up from the very beginning! You took me away on purpose so that Night Light could humiliate me. You then provoked me to kill Night Light after you recorded us. What did you do after that? How did you trick the Dongsang King?!”","Princess Yan Ling said, “Yes, I regret that I didn’t tell His Majesty that Night","Owl was your son. Otherwise, you and Night Owl would have been dead by now. You would never have had the chance to act so arrogantly in front of me!”","The Dongsang King suddenly raised his head and stared at the wall.","What did he just hear?","Night Owl was Lord Jing’s son?!","Princess Yan Ling knew about it?!","She was threatening Lord Jing with it, which was why the latter wanted to silence her.","The Dongsang King almost had a heart attack.","And he wasn’t the only one. Night Owl was furious as well.","He glared at Lord Jing.","Lord Jing wanted to die.","How... how could these things be recorded? Who was it? Apart from him and Princess Yan Ling, who else was there? Why didn’t he know anything?! !!","There was too much information!","The crowd was dumbfounded.","Should they question the authenticity of the image? That was impossible. It was Princess Yan Ling’s face and voice, as well as Lord Jing’s. Neither of them tried to cover it up, so it couldn’t be fake.","The Dongsang King couldn’t take it anymore and spat out a mouth of blood.","He was doomed...","It was over...","Meanwhile, in Feng Wu’s restaurant, the others looked at one another in bewilderment.","Although they were some distance away from the scene, they were all cultivators, and that distance was nothing to them. They could hear everything coming out of the stone.","“What?!”","“Did Lord Jing kill Princess Yan Ling?!”","“Wait, didn’t Lord Jing say that the Junwu Empire killed Princess Yan Ling?","Wasn’t it Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu, and Master Linghu?”","“But look at the screen. It can’t be fake.”","“Look at Lord Jing. He can’t even stand it anymore. He has passed out.” The owner of the inn had fainted as well. He lay on the ground and couldn’t even stand up.","“It’s not real! The people of the Junwu Empire made it up! It has to be fake!” Night Owl roared. “It’s all fake!”","Yan Yu glanced at him.","The one-eyed teenager next to him had taken Night Owl down.","Yan Yu stared at the Dongsang King. “Did you just tell me that Yan Ling was killed by the Junwu Empire? Huh?”","The Dongsang King was so shocked that he was dazed.","Night Owl wasn’t his son?","Night Owl was Lord Jing’s son?","Even Princess Yan Ling knew about it, but he didn’t?"]},{"number":4068,"title":"Chapter 4068: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4068: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The recording went on.","Lord Jing described how he had used the Dongsang King to lead the public opinion so that the Dongsang King would support him in killing Princess Yan Ling and blame it on the Junwu Empire.","The Dongsang King was filled with despair.","He couldn’t find any excuse for himself.","Lord Jing... How could he...","“I’m going to kill you!”","The Dongsang King couldn’t care less about his dignity now. He grabbed Lord Jing and slapped him.","Lord Jing spat out a mouthful of blood, but he soon realized that he was going to die. He wouldn’t let the Dongsang King do anything to him.","Hence, Lord Jing also raised his fist and punched the Dongsang King in the face.","He actually hit the Dongsang King.","“How dare you!” The Dongsang King had never been hit like this before, and he was so angry that he almost couldn’t breathe.","Then, the prince of the Dayan Empire watched as the Dongsang King and Lord Jing fought. It was incredible!","They wouldn’t have been like this, but now that Princess Yan Ling had been killed by them and Prince Yan Yu had seen the evidence with his own eyes, there was no way for them to get away... As they fought, they were getting further and further away from Yan Yu.","Yan Yu smirked. With a wave of his hand, he gave the order. “Kill everyone here!”","WHAT?!","Everyone was astonished by the news.","They had thought that the Dongsang King and Lord Jing wouldn’t get away, but now, everyone was going to die.","“Run!”","The crowd didn’t see this coming. They ran as fast as they could and used all their strength, but...","Yan Yu had brought with him all capable cultivators, and none of them were weak.","Any one of them could set up a net of ligh tning around the area.","“Kill everyone within a 10km radius!” Yan Yu immediately gave the order.","Hence, the web of lightning spread out as they watched!","Little Phoenix was flying at a tremendous speed toward Feng Wu. After meeting up with Feng Wu, the two of them dashed off.","These Spiritual Saints were no joke. If they said they would kill everyone within a 10km radius, they would make sure of it.","When Feng Wu and Little Phoenix flew away, the people in the restaurant were all dumbfounded.","“Did you hear...”","“They’re killing everyone within 10km! Run!”","But by the time they realized what had happened, it was too late.","The lightning net had wrapped around them.","“Ahhhh—","Feng Wu was 10km away. Hearing the people screaming, she sighed inwardly.","The Dongsang King and his people were outside the imperial palace, and the imperial city was within that 10km radius. All the people who could live in the imperial city were influential figures of the Dongsang Kingdom.","But now...","“You’re incredible. You’ve managed to destroy them all in one go.” Little Phoenix gave Feng Wu an indescribable look.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly and sighed at Little Phoenix.. “I didn’t expect Yan Yu to be so cruel..."]},{"number":4069,"title":"Chapter 4069: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4069: The Prince of the Dayan Empire (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, if Feng Wu had known, she would have done the same.","If she didn’t do that, the Junwu Empire would be in a lot of trouble.","“Have you recorded everything?” Feng Wu asked Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix nodded. “I’ve recorded everything, but you only have one","Spiritual Fossil Stone left. You have to put it to good use.”","Feng Wu nodded. “It’s late. Let’s go to the armory.”","Little Phoenix was confused.","It thought that Feng Wu would return to the Junwu Empire right away, but as it turned out, she was bold enough to rob the armory of the Dongsang Kingdom when the Dayan Empire was already here.","Feng Wu said, “I’m afraid there’s going to be a fierce battle. These Spiritual Saints won’t attack ordinary people because of their status, but Yan Yu will be in charge of the Dongsang army from now on. I’m sure he’ll send troops to the Junwu Empire. While they’re still distracted, let’s empty the armory first.” Feng Wu indeed emptied the armory.","The second-generation fighter jets and all the energy bombs were stored in her storage space.","Where did Feng Wu get her storage device?","After following Princess Yan Ling around for so long, she had naturally prepared everything.","Not only did Feng Wu raid the armory, but she also raided the cultivation technique vault and the Spirit Stones vault as well... What she left for Yan Yu was the impoverished Dongsang Kingdom.","“Let’s go!”","Even with Feng Wu’s quick fingers, it still took her nearly an hour to finish raiding the place while the others were distracted by the palace.","After that, Feng Wu jumped onto Little Phoenix’s back and slipped away as fast as she could.","Feng Wu used the portal again.","“Wait, this portal has been used a lot recently.” The general frowned, but because Feng Wu was playing Night Owl, no one dared to stop her.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief when they were out of the portal. They were back in the Peace Grassland.","Feng Wu didn’t have time to catch her breath. Taking Little Phoenix with her, she flew as fast as she could to Nest Castle.","Meanwhile, everyone in Nest was worried about the Dongsang Kingdom.","The first letter was finally delivered at the cost of blood.","It was about Lord Jinz’s announcement that the Junwu Empire had sent someone to kill Princess Yan Ling.","“How’s that possible?! How can it be us?! We’re not capable enough to kill","Princess Yan Ling and the others! If we were, we wouldn’t be afraid at all!” Elder Helian had always been short-tempered, and he was so angry that he smashed his fist on the table.","Elder Dongfang looked concerned. “That was what we were worried about, but it really happened. The Dongsang King is so shameless! How can they do such a thing? Do they think the Dayan Empire will believe it?”","Elder Helian smirked. “Why wouldn’t we? The Dayan Empire will believe us. We’re doomed. They’re going to destroy us...”","Both Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu looked anxious. They used to be so level-headed, but now, they realize how serious the situation was.","“Is Xiao Wu alright? Why haven’t we heard anything?” Elder Helian was worried about Feng Wu again.","Just then..."]},{"number":4070,"title":"Chapter 4070: Dayan Empire (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4070: Dayan Empire (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, they heard a noise outside.","“Who’s there?!”","The alarmed Mr. Xu frowned and shouted, and the others looked up as well.","“Xiao wu?”","They were thrilled to see who it was.","Elder Helian, who was close to Feng Wu, went up to her in a hurry and took her by the arm in excitement. “You’re finally back! You disappeared as soon as you set foot in the Dongsang Kingdom! We were so worried!”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Elder Helian smacked her on the head. “Stop laughing! How can you do that? You’re so careless!”","Seeing that Feng Wu had come back, Mr. Xu frowned a little. “Your trip to Donglin City was for nothing. You might as well not go.”","Elder Helian’s face darkened. Even Mr. Xu retorted, “What are you talking about? Xiao Wu went into Donglin City all by herself, and she’s already very lucky to be able to come back alive. Mr. Xu, you’re asking too much.”","Mr. Xu’s face darkened, but Mr. Lu chimed in. “Elder Helian is right. You’re already very lucky to be back safely. By the way, Xiao Wu, since you’ve come back from Donglin City, do you know what’s going on there?”","Hearing that, everyone looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was confused. “What is it?”","Mr. Lu looked disappointed. He sighed and said in disappointment, “I see that you really don’t know, but I didn’t expect you to do anything... Helian, take her away. She must be tired.”","After that, Mr. Lu turned to Mr. Xu with a wry smile. “The general isn’t here. What should we do? I’m so worried...","Mr. Xu said, “Don’t worry. Didn’t Patriarch Huyan buy us three months? It’s been over two months, and we still have at least 20 days left.”","While they were discussing, Feng Wu took the information from Elder Helian and read it from beginning to end. She sighed with emotion. “You’ve all received the information in time. You all heard what Lord Jing said in front of everyone.”","Elder Helian didn’t know what to say. “Our spy worked very hard to send out that piece of information, and he’s dead now...”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Isn’t that a pointless sacrifice? You’ll know everything when I come back.”","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu. “What did you say? What do you know?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I know a lot more than that. For instance, you don’t know what happened afterward, do you?”","Elder Helian said anxiously, “That was the fastest way to get the information out. It happened only a day ago. Did something else happen after that?”","Feng Wu nodded. “A lot of things happened. For instance, when Lord Jing tried to blame it on the Junwu Empire, Prince Yan Yu of the Dayan Empire arrived with a large group of Spiritual Saints.”","WHAT?!","Feng Wu’s words shocked everyone, and they all stared at her.. “What did you say? Who’s Prince Yan Yu? A bunch of Spiritual Saints?!”"]},{"number":4071,"title":"Chapter 4071: Dayan Empire (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4071: Dayan Empire (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded and said seriously, “Prince Yan Yu is Princess Yan Ling’s brother. ”","Elder Helian said, “Prince Yan Yu? The son of Lord Yan of the Dayan Empire?! He brought a large group of Spiritual Saints with him?! How do you know that?","Are you sure...”","Frustrated, Elder Helian lashed out at Feng Wu.","Elder Helian wasn’t the only one. Everyone else was equally anxious. They all stared at Feng Wu, hoping that she would tell them. Feng Wu sat down in a chair. “I’m thirsty.”","Elder Dongfang immediately poured her some tea.","Feng Wu sipped her tea and said indifferently, “How do I know that? Of course, I saw it with my own eyes.”","Elder Helian asked, “Did you see with your own eyes that Prince Yan Yu had arrived with a large group of Spiritual Saints?”","Feng Wu said, “Yup.”","Elder Helian asked again, “What level is that Prince Yan Yu? And how many Spiritual Saints do you think he has?”","Elder Helian wasn’t the only one who cared. Everyone else did.","Feng Wu gave it some thought and said seriously, “That Prince Yan Yu has to be beyond the Spiritual Saint stage. As for the people he has with him, there are at least 30 of them.”","Elder Helian fell to the ground with a pale face. “More than 30 Spiritual Saints? Are you sure?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “I saw it with my own eyes. Of course, I’m sure.”","Elder Helian said, “These people are helping the Dongsang Kingdom to attack the Junwu Empire, aren’t they? Otherwise, why would he bring so many capable cultivators here? They’re all here to defeat us. We’re doomed... How are we supposed to fight them? Princess Yan Ling brought two peak-level Spiritual","Saints with her, and we’ve already been defeated. If Patriarch Huyan hadn’t intervened, the Junwu Empire would have been finished...”","Mr. Lu and the others drew in their breaths as well, and their hearts sank.","Elder Helian asked, “Is the Leng family really going to take over?”","The king of the Dongsang Kingdom was from the Leng family.","However, Feng Wu shook her head. “I don’t think so. I think the ruler of the","Dongsang Kingdom nas cnanged nanas.”","Everyone was astonished when they heard that. Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “What did you say? The Dongsang Kingdom has...”","How was that even possible?!","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Of course. The Dongsang King joined hands with Lord Jing and his men to assassinate Princess Yan Ling. Prince Yan Yu wouldn’t let him off the hook. Now that the royal palace of the Dongsang Kingdom has been destroyed, apart from me, no one else in the imperial city has been able to get away.”","What?!","Everyone’s head went blank when they heard Feng Wu’s words, and Elder Helian was the first to react.","“Wait! What did you say? Say it again!”","Hence, Feng Wu slowly repeated what she said earlier.","Elder Helian looked at the crowd, and they all looked like they had seen a ghost.","Elder Helian said, “But that can’t be! Hasn’t the Dongsang Kingdom blamed it on the Junwu Empire already? If that’s the case, it means that he’s well-prepared.. Why is Yan Yu so sure that the Dongsang King has sent someone to kill Princess Yan Ling?”"]},{"number":4072,"title":"Chapter 4072: Feng Wu Returns (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4072: Feng Wu Returns (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded. “Good question.”","Elder Helian gave Feng Wu a strange look and thought, “Something’s not right with this girl. She’s so calm. It’s as if she’s the culprit.”","Hence, he asked Feng Wu, “Tell me, then. What happened?”","Feng Wu said, “Because someone recorded the entire process of Lord Jing killing Princess Yan Ling. When Prince Yan Yu and his men arrived and the Dongsang King and his men welcomed them, that person played the recording on the Spiritual Fossil Stone.”","Feng Wu said it casually, but the others couldn’t believe their ears.","Elder Dongfang was the first to object. “That’s impossible! The Dongsang King has assassinated Princess Yan Ling, and it’s such a secret! How could he let someone record it? He’s not stupid!”","Feng Wu looked at the others, and they all nodded, obviously agreeing with Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu chuckled. “You won’t believe me even if I tell you. Fine. Little Phoenix!”","Feng Wu called the bird.","Little Phoenix crawled out of Feng Wu’s sleeve, glanced at the others in an arrogant manner, and waved its paw. Immediately, an image appeared on the wall.","Little Phoenix had projected the Spiritual Fossil Stone onto the wall of the Dongsang palace, and it was showing the others now.","Feng Wu reminded them, “Dongsang King was destroyed by this Spiritual Fossil Stone. You guys have to watch it carefully. Donglin City has been very busy recently.”","They didn’t believe it at first. How could the Dongsang King be destroyed by a mere Spiritual Fossil Stone?","Until they saw everything.","The entire process of Lord Jing assassinating Princess Yan Ling...","Everyone was dumbfounded after watching it. They couldn’t believe their eyes.","Mr. Lu suddenly stared at Feng Wu. “Where did you get this Spiritual Fossil","Stone?”","Feng Wu smiled a little.","Elder Helian suddenly realized what had happened. He pointed at the image on the wall and then at Feng Wu. He was so shocked that he was stammering.","“No, it can’t be! It was you?! You did it?!” Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu. “You were there when Lord Jing killed Princess Yan Ling?!”","Despite the question, Elder Helian was certain that the girl was there.","Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu as well and looked surprised.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Of course. I’ve been playing the maid around Princess Yan Ling. Can’t I record it in secret?”","Mr. Lu’s interest was piqued, and he asked curiously, “Tell me. What happened? What did you do when you went back to Donglin City? Did you stir up all the trouble there?”","Mr. Xu wouldn’t believe it. How was that even possible?","However, he then heard that Feng Wu had pretended to be Lord Jings guard at first to infiltrate the Jing Manor, then used her relationship with Lord Jing to plot against Princess Yan Ling, and gradually exacerbated the conflict between Princess Yan Ling and Lord Jing, it eventually created such a scene.","Feng Wu made it sound so easy, but the others were astonished.","“You!” Elder Helian pointed at Feng Wu. “You’re so bold! How dare you do such a thing on your own?! Do you know how dangerous it is?!”","The others fell silent at Feng Wu’s words.."]},{"number":4073,"title":"Chapter 4073: Feng Wu Returns (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4073: Feng Wu Returns (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The girl was simply too powerful for them to handle.","Mr. Xu frowned. “You’re only a peak Spiritual Overlord. How dare you...’","She had single-handedly destroyed more than half of the Dongsang Kingdom and the imperial capital. Was she even human? That was unbelievable!","“Wait!” Mr. Lu’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu.","“You’re no longer a peak Spiritual Overlord, are you? You look like a Level-3","Spiritual Saint now!” Mr. Lu stared at Feng Wu. “Are you a Level-3 Spiritual","Saint already?!”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Elder Dongfang and Elder Helian almost jumped to their feet.","“A Level-3 Spiritual Saint? That can’t be!”","Neither of them had reached Level 3 yet, and they used to be so much more capable than Feng Wu.","Mr. Lu didn’t know what to do either, so he gave Mr. Xu a bewildered look.","Mr. Xu probed with his spiritual essence. After that, he nodded at Mr. Lu, indicating that he was right.","Feng Wu sighed. “I thought I could become a Level-4 Spiritual Saint, but as it turned out, I’m only a Level-3 Spiritual Saint... I’m so ashamed.”","“Nonsense!” Elder Helian smacked Feng Wu on the head. “You’re killing me! I’m still a Level-2 Spiritual Saint!”","“Hey, by the way.” Feng Wu smacked her forehead, took out four boxes, and handed them each.","“What’s this?” Elder Helian could sense the dense spiritual essence before he took the box.","“It’s the Ten Thousand Spiritual Fruit,” Feng Wu said indifferently. “It’s a treasure that can improve your cultivation level. Take it.”","“The Ten Thousand Spiritual Fruit?!” Mr. Xu cried out in surprise. “It can indeed stimulate the spiritual body and bring out one’s potential in a short period of time, enabling one to make a breakthrough... But where did you get it? And you’ve taken four of them!”","It was a treasure!","It wasn’t just a treasure. Any Spiritual Saint would go crazy over it.","Feng Wu said, “I found it in my third senior brother’s valley, so I picked some for you. Take them and make a breakthrough.’","“And your third senior brother is—” Mr. Xu was genuinely shocked.","The Ten Thousand Spiritual Fruit was so precious that it could turn best friends against each other. However, the girl had given it away without hesitation...","Who was this third senior brother? Could he be someone like Patriarch Huyan?","Would the master really not mind if she picked the fruit like this?","Feng Wu waved her hand. “My third senior brother isn’t on the continent anymore, so forget about it. To him, the fruit is about the same as something you can buy on the market for a coin a kilo. Don’t worry. He won’t be mad.”","The Ten Thousand Spiritual Fruit was so important to them, but it meant so little to that master. Mr. Xu didn’t know what to say.","However, since Feng Wu had made such rapid progress in such a short period of time, they trusted her third senior brother.","“However...” Before he went into seclusion, Elder Helian asked Feng Wu, “If the Dongsang Kingdom really is in such a mess, do you think Prince Yan Yu will come after us?”"]},{"number":4074,"title":"Chapter 4074: Feng Wu Returns (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4074: Feng Wu Returns (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“And there are the cultivation techniques. ” Feng Wu took out some manuals from her third senior brother’s cave and handed them out.","Since her third senior brother had said that she could have everything in the valley, she decided to make good use of it and help her Spiritual Saints.","After all, when Prince Yan Yu and his men invaded, Mr. Lu and his colleagues would be their main force. Helping them improve their capability was Feng Wu’s top priority now.","“Isn’t that the Purple Flame Swordplay?!” “Isn’t that the Heavenly Dragon Swordplay?” “Isn’t that the Extermination of the Army?!”","“Isn’t that the Secret Wind Flame Sutra?!”","Mr. Lu, Mr. Xu, Elder Dongfang, and Elder Helian all stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Was this girl even human?!","“These are all legendary cultivation techniques! How can you...” She was taking them out as if she was giving away candy!","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","As a matter of fact, they had been so shocked by Feng Wu today that they couldn’t think straight. They were all top cultivators of the Junwu Empire!","Feng Wu waved at them and said indifferently, “My third senior brother doesn’t care about these cultivation techniques at all. He said that I could handle them however I wanted, so don’t worry about them.","Elder Helian asked, “Has the Dongsang Kingdom really been destroyed?”","Feng Wu said, “Even if they aren’t, they’ve been almost wiped out, but the","Dongsang Kingdom isn’t important.”","Elder Helian didn’t know what to say. “If the Dongsang Kingdom isn’t important, then what is? The Dayan Empire hired these people to attack us, and now that they’ve fallen out with each other, isn’t it great news for us?” Hearing what Elder Helian said, everyone grew excited.","However, Feng Wu had never looked so serious and calm. She said coldly, “That was what I thought at first. That was why I deliberately created the conflict between Princess Yan Ling and the Dongsang Kingdom. I thought that if I could drive a wedge between them, the crisis of the Junwu Empire would be solved. But I realized later that something wasn’t right.”","The others all looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “It wasn’t the Dongsang Kingdom from the very beginning. The Dayan Empire is the one that’s after us.”","“What?!!!”","That was unbelievable!","Feng Wu looked at them and stressed each word. “The Dayan Empire wants to destroy us, but as a superior kingdom, they’re limited by the rules of Nature, so they can only support the Dongsang Kingdom against us.","“Moreover, it won’t be as simple as an invasion. What the Dayan Empire wants is destruction.","“They want to destroy everyone in the Junwu Empire!”","Seeing the change in their expressions, Feng Wu said, “By ‘destruction,’ I mean that they’ll kill everyone in the Junwu Empire and use the land as their sacrificial altar...","“An altar?” Mr. Lu’s face darkened. “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu said, “As for why they want the Junwu Empire as the altar, Princess Yan Ling didn’t tell me, but one thing is for sure. The Dayan Empire won’t let us go, at least until they kill everyone.”","Ssss...","Everyone drew in their breaths.","That was so scary!","Feng Wu said solemnly, “That’s the truth..”"]},{"number":4075,"title":"Chapter 4075: Feng Wu Returns (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4075: Feng Wu Returns (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Elder Helian stuttered. “Is it a misunderstanding?”","Feng Wu shook her head and said firmly, “That’s the truth.”","The air felt heavy, and everyone fell silent.","At first, they thought that the Dongsang Kingdom was the enemy, so they were excited to see the kingdom destroyed by the Dayan Empire. But now, they realized that the big boss was the Dayan Empire.","Feng Wu said, “Yan Yu should still be consolidating the Dongsang Kingdom. As a superior kingdom, they must have their limitations and can’t attack us directly because they could have done so a long time ago. With the capability of the Dayan Empire, the Junwu Empire couldn’t have survived for so long. There must be a rule behind it.","“I’ll go back to His Majesty first. The Junwu Empire has to be prepared.”","Elder Helian said, “You’re right. If that’s the truth, we have to fight to the end!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Where’s my godfather?”","Elder Helian said, “Master Linghu let him stay behind to cultivate. He said that he would make a breakthrough.”","At the thought of Master Linghu’s capability, Feng Wu was relieved.","Feng Wu left behind the Spirit Stones she had brought from the Dongsang Kingdom before leaving.","Seeing the Spirit Stones Feng Wu had left behind, the others were amazed again. Had she emptied the Dongsang Kingdom?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had arrived at the imperial palace.","The Junwu Empire was meeting Jun Linshen and Empress Dugu.","Ever since Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan weren’t in the imperial capital, Empress Dugu, and Jun Linshen had been staying close to Emperor Wu and making him happy. As a result, Emperor Wu’s impression of them had changed a lot.","Jun Linshen frowned when he saw Feng Wu.","“Little Feng Wu, you’re finally here.” He stared at her. “You’re quite a troublemaker. Did you offend Night Owl just because you’re pretty?”","Feng Wu glanced at him.","Empress Dugu chimed in, but her tone was much gentler. “Mr. Sakiya of the","Dongsang Kingdom was here to propose a marriage to His Majesty, saying that His Royal Highness is going to marry you. Feng Wu, aren’t you with our crown prince now? Since when do you know the crown prince of the Dongsang Kingdom? That’s not appropriate, is it?”","Empress Dugu had been whispering to Emperor Wu these days, but Emperor Wu never believed her. This time, he said decisively, “Shut up!”","Empress Dugu gave Emperor Wu a pleading look.","Emperor Wu said grumpily, “Go away. Both of you.”","Jun Linshen wasn’t convinced. “Father, Mr. Sakiya said that Night Owl and Feng Wu are in love with each other. If they marry, the Dongsang Kingdom and the Junwu Empire will become allies, and we’ll live in peace for a hundred years. Father, please don’t take my brother’s side. You have to consider the people of the Junwu Empire first!”","Emperor Wu frowned and said coldly, “I told you to leave. Can’t you hear me?”","Feng Wu glanced at Jun Linshen and Empress Dugu and smirked. “Joined by marriage with the Dongsang Kingdom? That won’t be necessary.”","Jun Linshen glanced at Feng Wu. “Little Feng Wu, as a subject of the Junwu Empire, do you really want to ignore the safety of your people for your love? You’re so selfish!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “So, do you want to marry into the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Jun Linshen was furious.. “You!”"]},{"number":4076,"title":"Chapter 4076: Feng Wu Returns (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4076: Feng Wu Returns (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu waved her hand. “Even if you want to marry into the Dongsang Kingdom, you won’t have that chance. It’s not that the Dongsang Kingdom doesn’t have a princess, but the Dongsang Kingdom really doesn’t have one now. ”","Jun Linshen smirked. “Of course, the Dongsang Kingdom has princesses. They have quite a few.”","Feng Wu smiled. “The Dongsang Kingdom doesn’t even have a royal family now, let alone a princess.”","Jun Linshen said angrily, “Feng Wu, are you trying to make fun of me? The Dongsang Kingdom is so powerful. Otherwise, the Junwu Empire wouldn’t have confronted them in the Peace Grassland for so long!","“Now that you’re saying that the entire royal family of the Dongsang Kingdom is gone, are you saying that the royal family of the Junwu Empire is going to be destroyed as well? How dare you?!”","Empress Dugu was pleasantly surprised. That was indeed a good way to blame Feng Wu.","However, before Empress Dugu could say anything, Feng Wu turned to","Emperor Wu. “Your Majesty, I have something to tell you.”","Naturally, Emperor Wu was on Feng Wu’s side. With a darkened face, he glanced at Empress Dugu and Jun Linshen.","In the end, they left reluctantly.","After they left, Feng Wu showed Emperor Wu the part where Yan Yu and the others came to the Dongsang Kingdom.","Emperor Wu was astonished.","“Is that true?!” Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s true.”","Emperor Wu said, “But is everything true? Did the Dongsang King really send Lord Jing to kill Princess Yan Ling?”","Feng Wu smiled and nodded.","Emperor Wu knew Feng Wu too well. He knew what was going on when the girl raised an eyebrow.","“The Dongsang King isn’t stupid. He’s all about fawning on the Dayan Empire, so of course he wouldn’t kill Princess Yan Ling. Even if Princess Yan Ling killed his crown prince, he still wouldn’t do anything.” Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu. “What did you do?”","Feng Wu grinned.","Emperor Wu was intrigued. “Tell me. Are you still trying to keep it from me?”","Hence, Feng Wu told Emperor Wu everything from when she pretended to be Lord Jing’s guard.","“That’s so...” Emperor Wu didn’t know what to say. “That’s so...”","Emperor Wu didn’t know how to describe the girl.","“You’re such a genius.”","Back then, when the girl was little, Emperor Wu had no idea that she would become so capable. She single-handedly turned a country upside down, and the clever Dongsang King had been played like a fiddle.","Emperor Wu broke into a cold sweat and thought to himself, “Luckily, I’m not her enemy. I’ve always been on her side.","Feng Wu looked at him.","Emperor Wu went on. “Everyone knows how domineering the Dayan Empire is. If they want to become the ruler of this continent, no one will dare to defy them. What do you think we should do if they invade the Junwu Empire?”","Feng Wu gave Emperor Wu a sympathetic look.. “Your Majesty, are you saying that we should compromise?”"]},{"number":4077,"title":"Chapter 4077: Feng Wu Returns (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4077: Feng Wu Returns (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “Even if we can’t give in, we still have to. The","Junwu Empire is no match for the Dongsang Kingdom, let alone the Dayan Empire. In order to conserve our strength, I’m afraid we’ll have to change our name to the Junwu Kingdom.","“So be it. As long as we can keep the common people alive, we’ll have to live with it.”","Feng Wu gave the Junwu Empire a sympathetic look until he realized what had happened.","“Kiddo, what’s that look in your eyes? What? Am I wrong?” Emperor Wu looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu heaved a long sigh and smiled bitterly. “Even if you want to surrender, it’s not up to you.”","Emperor Wu asked, “What do you mean?","Feng Wu said, “According to Princess Yan Ling, the Dayan Empire wants to destroy the Junwu Empire entirely!”","“What did you say?!” Emperor Wu jumped to his feet and stared at Feng Wu.","“Say that again!”","Staring at Emperor Wu, Feng Wu repeated what she said.","This time, Emperor Wu heard everything.","“No! That’s impossible!” Emperor Wu waved his hand. “Why should the Dayan","Empire kill us all? We didn’t do anything to harm the empire.”","Feng Wu said solemnly, “Existence can be a mistake sometimes.”","Emperor Wu stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu told Emperor Wu what she heard when she interrogated Princess Yan Ling.","“A sacrificial altar? What kind of a sacrificial altar? Why did they have to choose the Junwu Empire? Moreover, they’re offering the blood of the people of the Junwu Empire as a sacrificial altar... That’s... That’s...” Emperor Wu felt dizzy. He couldn’t accept the result.","Feng Wu gave Emperor Wu a hand so that he wouldn’t fall.","“Xiao Wu, it’s not real, is it?” The Junwu Empire wasn’t strong enough to withstand it yet. He stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked into his eyes without saying a word.","That familiar look.. Yes, that was the look Jun Linyuan gave him every time he was delusional, reminding him that running away wouldn’t work.","“That’s...” Emperor Wu couldn’t accept it.","The Junwu Empire had been keeping a low profile for so long and finally had two geniuses — Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan. They could finally hold their heads high, but now, he was told that the Junwu Empire was going to be wiped out. Emperor Wu wanted to say that he wouldn’t believe it, but he trusted Feng Wu.","It had to be true.","“If that’s the case, it explains why the Dayan Empire has been supporting the","Dongsang Kingdom, while the Dongsang Kingdom has been targeting the Junwu Empire. That plan should have been there from the very beginning, but it’s become more intense now. To be more precise, the Dayan Empire is getting anxious.”","Clenching his fists, Emperor Wu racked his brain for the manpower he could use.","“By the way, what’s Yan Yu’s cultivation level like? What about the people he brought?” Emperor Wu asked Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said seriously, “Of the 30 or so people, the weakest one is a Spiritual Saint, and the strongest one... I don’t know their capabilities.”","Emperor Wu dropped to his knees.","He felt like admitting his defeat. If they invaded, no one in the Junwu Empire would survive.."]},{"number":4078,"title":"Chapter 4078: Feng Wu Returns (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4078: Feng Wu Returns (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Is the Dayan Empire only targeting the Junwu Empire, or is it targeting other kingdoms as well?” Emperor Wu’s voice was trembling.","Feng Wu looked into Emperor Wu’s eyes and remained silent.","Emperor Wu felt as if he had been struck by lightning. He almost couldn’t stand still. Involuntarily, he put a hand on the table and asked, “Is it just us?” Feng Wu said seriously, “I think so. As for the actual situation, it’ll depend on the attitude of the Dayan Empire.”","Emperor Wu took a deep breath. “I don’t care about my death, but what about my people? What are they going to do?”","“Do you have any idea?” Emperor Wu looked up at Feng Wu.","Seeing the conflicted look on Feng Wu’s face, Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “You have a point. You’re only in your teens, but you’ve already made such a deep impression on the Dongsang Kingdom. What can you possibly do to a colossus like the Dayan Empire?","“So, the Junwu Empire can only wait for the disaster to happen?” Emperor Wu looked as if he had aged by decades.","Feng Wu said seriously, “I’m sure we can figure it out!”","Emperor Wu waved at her with a wry smile and said, “You can leave now.”","Feng Wu knew perfectly well that Emperor Wu needed time to digest the information, so she quietly left the room.","On Feng Wu’s way back to the Feng manor, in a grove of wisteria.","Click!","Someone threw a small fruit at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu dodged involuntarily and reined in her horse.","She looked around and gripped her sword.","“Who’s there?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes, but she still didn’t see who it was.","Feng Wu was even more alarmed.","There were very few people here. If someone tried to attack her...","“Thud ! ”","Another fruit smashed down at Feng Wu. This time, Feng Wu didn’t dodge and was hit on the head.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, was prepared for this. She dashed off, and the next second, she was up a wisteria tree with a dagger in her hand.","However, that person moved swiftly and jumped onto Feng Wu’s horse.","That wasn’t all. Feng Wu realized that the man had taken her Fallen Star Sword.","“Hya!”","The man rode as fast as he could.","“Damn it!” Feng Wu said angrily.","Of course, she wouldn’t lose her Fallen Star Sword.","“Stop!” Feng Wu shouted and ran after him.","By then, Feng Wu had noticed that it was a teenager in a blue robe. He wore a mask with Zhong Kui’s face on it, which looked quite intimidating.","But Feng Wu didn’t have time for that. She had to get the Fallen Star Sword back.","The teenager rode as fast as he could on his horse, while Feng Wu jumped over the top of the wisteria tree.","The longer Feng Wu chased, the more astonished she became.","She could tell that the man was doing it on purpose because if she sped up, he would do the same. If she slowed down, he would slow down as well as if he had been waiting for her.","Who on earth was this man?","He was at least a Level-3 Spiritual Saint.","And the way he looked... Feng Wu racked her brain.","Feng Wu searched her memory, but still couldn’t figure out who it was.","However, now that she had realized that he was doing it on purpose, she wouldn’t let him control her anymore. Feng Wu suddenly screamed.","“Ahhh!”"]},{"number":4079,"title":"Chapter 4079: Feng Wu Returns (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4079: Feng Wu Returns (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Argh!” Feng Wu screamed. At the same time, she fell from the top of the wisteria tree and landed with a thump.","What?","The teenager turned around and looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. Seeing that Feng Wu was still holding her chest and wouldn’t get up, he looked confused.","After waiting for a while, Feng Wu still hadn’t caught up with him. He looked concerned and shouted at Feng Wu, “Hey! Do you want this sword or not?”","Feng Wu ignored him. Pressing a hand on her chest, she looked like she was going to pass out.","Huh? Was she still badly injured? At that thought, the teenager slowly rode toward Feng Wu, jumped off, and crouched down. He looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Hey, kiddo, are you really...”","Everything happened in a split second!","Just then, Feng Wu leaped up and slid the dagger across his throat!","The teenager was crouching, and it was impossible for him to dodge. Hence, he involuntarily pushed Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu was prepared for that. She jumped around and the next second, she was behind him. At the same time, there was the sound of an explosion.","It was a high-explosive bomb Feng Wu found in the armory of the Dongsang Kingdom. She had buried it in a formation when the teenager wasn’t looking, and she set it off just now.","Caught off guard, the teenager was hit by the explosion. Although the high-explosive bomb couldn’t damage his defense, it still gave him a lot of trouble. Feng Wu drew out her dagger again.","The teenager bent his fingers and aimed at Feng Wu’s back. However, he only managed to grab a handful of thorns!","“Ssss...”","He drew in his breath. When he looked at his palms, he saw little holes, and green smoke was rising out of them as he watched. His face turned green. “Is it poisonous?”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to reply. She struck out again.","The teenager chuckled. “Alright. I’d like to see your cultivation level!”","Thump! Thump! Thump! The two of them exchanged dozens of blows, and only then did Feng Wu realize that she was much weaker than him because the blue-robed teenager was simply too skillful.","It was as if he had been showing her mercy.","In the end, he pinned Feng Wu’s hands behind her back and tied her hands up with vines.","“Let go of me!” Feng Wu glared at him.","Crossing his arms, the teenager looked at Feng Wu in amusement. “You’re quite energetic. Why did you look like you were going to pass out just then? Are you going to faint now?”","Feng Wu ignored him and kept her gaze on him, trying to figure out who he was.","The teenager seemed to know what Feng Wu was thinking. He smiled at Feng","Wu and said, “Take a wild guess. You’ll never guess who I am!”","Feng Wu took a deep breath. “What on earth do you want, then?”","Tilting his head, the teenager gave it some thought and suddenly said to Feng Wu, “I’m new here and have nowhere to go. How about you take me back home?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t know who you are. Why would I do that? What if you hurt my family?”","The teenager shrugged. “Don’t worry. I won’t hurt your family. On the contrary, with me around, no one will pick on you. Do you want to think about it?”","Feng Wu said, “No!”"]},{"number":4080,"title":"Chapter 4080: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4080: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The teenager didn’t know what to say. “Why are you so difficult to talk to?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “Who on earth are you? Why did you offend me on purpose and want to come back with me? What’s your plan?”","The teenager gave a perfect guileless look. “I just want to look at pretty people, okay?”","Feng Wu said, “No!”","The teenager said, “Alright. What do I have to do to go home with you?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m not going to do that! Just give up!”","The teenager grinned at Feng Wu. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m sure. And untie me!”","The teenager wasn’t mad at her and untied her hands.","Seeinz that he had untied her, Fenz Wu picked up the Fallen Star Sword that had fallen to the ground, jumped onto the horse, and was about to leave. The teenager let her go without stopping her.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She looked over her shoulder involuntarily and saw that the teenager had crossed his arms and raised his eyebrows in an indifferent manner.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. This teenager was so strange!","She ignored the man and rode straight for the Feng manor. However, when she got off the horse, she saw the teenager standing behind her and smiling at her.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She tossed the rein to the gatekeeper, threw a dirty look at the teenager, and headed straight for the manor.","“Hey, who are you? You can’t go in!”","Feng Wu only made a few steps before the teenager followed her in.","“Miss Wu, he...” The doorman looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","The teenager didn’t even move a finger, but he was already stumbling back... That was a very capable man!","Feng Wu rubbed her temple in resignation and waved at the doorman. “You can leave now.”","“Yes!”","The doorman left in a hurry.","Feng Wu turned to the teenager. “What on earth do you want?”","The teenager said with a smile, “I wanted to visit you. Look, here I am.”","Feng Wu sighed in resignation. “Alright, alright.”","Feng Yanfeng arrived at that moment, and Feng Wu said, “That’s my uncle. He’s in charge of the Feng clan. Go talk to him.”","Feng Yanfeng saw the blue-robed teenager, but before he could say anything, he saw the half-smile on the teenager’s face... A chill ran down his spine, and he felt as if he had just seen death!","The teenager smiled at him. “Can I stay here?”","What more could Feng Yanfeng say? He nodded immediately. “Of course, of course...” That man was so capable that Feng Yanfeng felt like he was talking to","Jun Linyuan.","Maybe he was even more unfathomable than Jun Linyuan!","How dare he say no?","Feng Yanfeng smiled at Feng Wu. “Since he’s your honored guest, take him to Fallen Star Yard. Now.”","Feng Yanfeng dashed off before he could finish.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","By now, Feng Wu had learned that the blue-robed teenager had followed her here for a reason. As for what it was... Although she didn’t know for now, it was only a matter of time before he showed his true self.","Feng Wu turned around and threw a dirty look at him. “I’m not as capable as you are, and there’s nothing I can do to stop you. Although I don’t know what your real purpose is, but...","“I’ll kill you if you harm my family!” Feng Wu warned her in a cold voice. “Are you always this nice to your family?” Jun Linyuan grinned.."]},{"number":4081,"title":"Chapter 4081: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4081: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu stared at the blue-robed teenager. He reminded Feng Wu of Feng","Xun, but more aggressive than him.","She couldn’t scold him, nor could she chase him away. She didn’t even know what he wanted. What did he want?","Feng Wu had no choice but to keep walking.","“Hey, I’m asking you a question.” The teenager poked Feng Wu in the back.","Feng Wu ignored him.","He moved closer. “Are you really that nice to your family?”","Feng Wu asked, “Why do you care?”","He had snatched her Fallen Star Sword for no reason, tied her up for no reason, and came back home with her. Feng Wu couldn’t be more alarmed.","“Who told you it had nothing to do with me? Maybe we’re even related,” said the teenager in an unhurried tone.","Feng Wu said, “What? We’re relatives? I don’t look anything like you...”","When Feng Wu looked into his eyes, she felt that she had seen those eyes somewhere before.","She tried to grab the blue-robed teenager’s mask, but he took a step back, stood still, and smiled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Have I met you before?”","The teenager shook his head. “No, you haven’t.”","Feng Wu was perplexed. She had never met him before, but why did he look familiar?","“Your name?” Feng Wu frowned.","The teenager didn’t try to keep it from her. “I’m Luo Zilin.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is your surname Luo?”","The teenager said, “That’s right.”","Feng Wu was confused. “Is there a Luo family on this continent?”","The teenager chuckled. “Not here. Maybe it’s on another continent.”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Are you saying that you’re from the Dayan Empire?","Keep bragging.”","The teenager wasn’t angry at Feng Wu’s retort. He only smiled at her. “I’m not bragging. What if I really came from the other side of the sea?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Do you think the formation is that easy to break? One Yan Yu is already frustrating enough. If everyone can come, our continent will be in a mess!”","The teenager frowned. “Yan Yu?”","Feng Wu waved her hands in resignation and smiled bitterly. “Prince Yan Yu is from the Dayan Empire. He’s very influential, and the people he brought with him are all very capable. The Junwu Empire...”","An idea then struck Feng Wu. She turned around and stared at the teenager. “You should leave the Junwu Empire as soon as possible. It doesn’t matter where you go, but you can’t stay here anymore.”","The teenager was confused. “Why?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ve delivered the message. It’s up to you if you want to do it or not. ”","After that, Feng Wu went straight into the Fallen Star Yard.","Luo Zilin stood outside for a while and frowned, but something seemed to occur to him, and he smiled again. Opening his fan, he walked into Fallen Star Yard with a smile.","Granny Zhao was about to close the door when she saw the teenager, who was wearing a blue robe and a mask. She frowned involuntarily. “You are...”","“I’m Miss Wu’s relative.” Luo Zilin closed his fan and entered the courtyard.","Granny Zhao looked confused.. Relative? What kind of relative? Why hadn’t she","met him before?"]},{"number":4082,"title":"Chapter 4082: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4082: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What kind of relative? Why hadn’t she met him before? Granny Zhao was perplexed.","But this young master was quite good-looking, and he looked familiar. Granny Zhao couldn’t remember where she had seen him before.","Luo Zilin followed Feng Wu everywhere.","Feng Wu looked back at him in resignation. “What on earth do you want?”","The teenager looked at her and said aggrievedly, “Is that how you treat me when I’m your guest?”","Feng Wu rubbed her temple and looked at the teenager in the blue robe in resignation. “Did I invite you here as a guest? Why should I treat you differently?”","Seeing how rude Feng Wu was, Granny Zhao stepped out and said, “I’ll go get some tea. Right away.”","Feng Wu said grumpily to Granny Zhao, “This uninvited guest may be a bad person. Granny Zhao, ignore him.”","The teenager in the blue robe was very mild- tempered. No matter what Feng Wu’s attitude was, he would only smile or look aggrieved. Feng Wu didn’t know what to do.","“I know you’re trying to set me off so that I can run away on my own. Hmph, I’m not going to fall for it.” The teenager opened his fan and raised his chin.","Feng Wu looked at him. “I see you’re very confident.”","The teenager said, “Of course! Have you forgotten who I am and where I come from?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Who are you, and where are you from?","The teenager said, “Well, I can’t tell you that.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The teenager looked at Feng Wu eagerly. “Ask me any other questions, and I’ll answer them.’","Feng Wu asked, “How are we related?”","The teenager in the blue robe cleared his throat.","Feng Wu smirked and ignored him.","He was behaving strangely and babbling nonsense. Feng Wu was already under a lot of pressure, for Yan Yu, a prince of the Dayan Empire, was looming on the horizon and could explode at any moment. Therefore, she didn’t want to waste her time on unnecessary things.","“How’s my mum?” Feng Wu asked Granny Zhao, who had brought some tea.","Granny Zhao looked at Feng Wu, heaved a long sigh, and shook her head. “She hasn’t woken up yet.”","Feng Wu looked concerned. She was about to push the door open when she noticed the teenager in the blue robe behind her. “What are you doing?”","The teenager shrugged and grinned at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “Don’t come in.”","Feng Wu closed the door behind her after that, and the teenager’s nose almost knocked into the door frame.","Granny Zhao didn’t expect that Miss Wu would be so grumpy after her trip, so she smiled obsequiously at Luo Zilin. “Would you like to sit in the living room?” Luo Zilin rubbed his nose and nodded.","However, he didn’t sit down in the main hall. Instead, he strolled around Fallen Star Yard with his hands behind his back.","“Wait, I didn’t know there was such an intricate formation in this barbaric land ” Rubbing his chin. 1,110 Zilin looked amazed-","“Who are you?!” A teenager’s voice rang out in the courtyard. It was Feng Xiaoqi.","Hearing that his sister was back, Xiaoqi jumped over the wall of Grand Secretary Fang’s courtyard next door. As soon as he got back, he saw a stranger standing in his courtyard. Xiaoqi felt that something was wrong.","Luo Zilin turned around and looked at Feng Xiaoqi.."]},{"number":4083,"title":"Chapter 4083: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4083: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xiaoqi was baffled. Who on earth was this person? The teenager was staring at him with those cold eyes, and Feng Xiaoqi felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave. It was as if... as if...","That was right! It reminded him of the way his “brother-in-law” used to stare at him. It made him shudder!","“W- Who are you? Why are you here in Fallen Star Yard?!” Feng Xiaoqi stammered, but he still stepped out bravely, for he was the only boy in the family.","“And who might you be?” The teenager glanced at him.","No matter what Feng Wu did to him, he wouldn’t be angry, but he wasn’t so nice to other people. On the contrary, he was very aloof.","“I – I’m Feng Xiaoqi. Who are you, then?”","Faced with such a terrifying figure, Feng Xiaoqi gritted his teeth and glared back.","“As for me, little Feng Wu took me home.” The teenager glanced at him again.","“My sister took you back?! Why?!” Feng Xiaoqi flared up right away.","The teenager said, “Of course, it’s because I’m nice. That’s why she wants me to meet her parents. Don’t you think so?”","Feng Xiaoqi couldn’t believe his eyes. “That’s impossible!”","“Why not? Fine, make your own arrangements. Don’t mind me.” The teenager glanced at him, flapped his fan, and went on strolling around the courtyard.","“Hey, wait Feng Xiaoqi ran after him.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt that something was wrong...","This man gave him a very dangerous feeling, which was almost as dangerous as Jun Linyuan’s. Feng Xiaoqi didn’t like the way he acted as if he was half the owner of this house.","Feng Xiaoqi ran after him, but he didn’t dare to get too close, so he stopped five steps away and stared at Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin was casually admiring the plants in Fallen Star Yard when he glanced over his shoulder. “Yes?”","Feng Xiaoqi was so frustrated that he couldn’t speak...","How should he put it?","He thought, “Why do you look like you own the house? I’m the owner!” However, he was too scared to say it.","Feng Xiaoqi glanced at him in frustration, then turned to leave.","“Where’s my sister?” Feng Xiaoqi asked Granny Zhao. He had just heard that her sister was back.","Granny Zhao pointed at Lady Xuanji’s room.","Feng Wu hadn’t been around these days, and Feng Xiaoqi had been managing the family. Apart from cultivating, Feng Xiaoqi spent the rest of his time with his mother.","“Sister!” Feng Xiaoai ran into the room. Seeing Feng Wu, he threw his head into","her arms and wrapped his arms around her waist. “Sister, I missed you so much.”","Feng Wu was happy to see Feng Xiaoqi as well. Patting him on the head, she said, “I missed you, too.”","An untimely voice rang out. “How old are you? Don’t you know men and women should keep some distance?”","Feng Wu and Feng Xiaoqi looked up at the same time to find a figure in a blue robe leaning against the door frame with an indifferent smile on his face. However, he was staring at Feng Xiaoqi.","Feng Wu frowned a little. What kind of person was he? He was way out of line!","Meanwhile, Feng Xiaoqi grabbed Feng Wu’s hand and hesitated for a long while before asking, “Sister, have you betrayed my brother-in-law?”","What the hell?","Feng Wu was speechless. ‘What do you mean by that? Since when did you have a brother-in-law?”","“I’m talking about His Royal Highness. He told me before he left last time that he was going to be my brother-in-law. There will be no one else..”"]},{"number":4084,"title":"Chapter 4084: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4084: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. “Be serious.”","Feng Xiaoqi said, “I’m telling the truth. That’s what he told me.”","After that, Feng Xiaoqi even gave the teenager in blue a provoking look.","The teenager in the blue robe looked at him with a half-smile, and Feng Xiaoqi stiffened again. He looked nervous and in awe.","The teenager walked in and moved Feng Xiaoqi away from Feng Wu. Feng Xiaoqi didn’t dare to utter a word and could only look at the teenager with a pitiful look on his face.","Feng Wu glared at him. “Luo Zilin, what’s wrong with you? He’s my brother.”","The teenager glanced at Feng Wu and the person lying on the bed. For a moment, he seemed to let out a breath of relief.","Rising to her feet, Feng Wu blocked the teenager’s view and narrowed her eyes. “I’m going to ask you to leave now.”","Instead of going out, the teenager walked past Feng Wu, went up to Lady Xuanji’s bed, and stared at the beautiful woman.","The woman was stunning. Her skin was as smooth as jade, and she reminded one of a teenage girl. Time seemed to have left no trace on her face.","She and Feng Wu were quite alike, but Feng Wu hadn’t reached her full potential yet. Therefore, Lady Xuanji was still the most beautiful woman.","Feng Wu blocked the teenager’s way again and spread out her arms, looking displeased. “Luo Zilin, I’m warning you for the last time. Get out!”","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu and asked, “Are you sure you don’t want her to wake up?”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “Get out!”","There was a flash of anger in Luo Zilin’s eyes when he saw that Lady Xuanji was unconscious, but it was gone now, and he was still smiling casually. He smiled at Feng Wu. “Don’t doubt me. I really can do it.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you going to leave now, or shall I kick you out?”","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu. “Someone has poisoned her, hasn’t they? That poison looks a little like something called ‘Plum Blossom’ from the Yan manor.”","The Yan manor?!","Feng Wu wouldn’t think much of it if she hadn’t met Princess Yan Ling.","However, after meeting Princess Yan Ling and learning about the Dayan Empire, Feng Wu realized what the Yan manor represented.","“Have you heard of the Yan manor before?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and became even more alarmed.","“Why are you even asking? Of course I know who they are.” Luo Zilin opened his fan. He was pleased to hear that Feng Wu was interested in it.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. This guy was so lively. If he had a tail, he would be wagging it.","“What do you know? Do you know where Lord Yan comes from? What’s the princess’s name? What’s the prince’s name? I won’t believe you if you dont tell me!” Feng Wu wasn’t convinced.","The teenager chuckled. ‘Where is Lord Yan from? That’s a difficult question. Is he from outer space?”","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “Luo Zilin, are you kidding me?!”","Luo Zilin grinned at Feng Wu. “That’s right. Did I make you laugh?”","Feng Xiaoqi couldn’t help but chuckle.","Feng Wu was speechless. Taking a deep breath, she said, “I don’t want to talk to you anymore.. Get out of here!”"]},{"number":4085,"title":"Chapter 4085: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4085: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin said, “Please don’t. I really can cure your mother! I really can! Trust me!”","Feng Wu smirked. “I don’t believe you!”","Luo Zilin tossed Feng Wu a white porcelain bottle. “Here, take it.”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment. “What’s that?”","Luo Zilin smiled. “Something that can wake your mother up.”","Feng Wu said, “Why should I believe you?”","Luo Zilin said, “If you don’t believe me, your mother won’t wake up.”","Feng Wu stared at Luo Zilin, and the teenager had a serious look in his eyes.","Feng Wu almost believed him.","“Sister, who is he?” Feng Xiaoqi moved closer and asked in a low voice.","Feng Wu said, “He’s just a passerby.”","Feng Xiaoqi frowned. “He’s just a random passerby. Why do you believe him? What if he’s lying to you? What if Mother’s condition worsens? What if...”","All of a sudden, Feng Xiaoqi felt a chill run down his spine. Turning around, he met Luo Zilin’s half-smile.","How terrifying!","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Xiaoqi and casually said, “I’ve given it to you. It’ll expire in seven days. Use it or not.”","He left after that, but he didn’t go very far. Instead, he sat casually on the swing in the courtyard as if this was his home.","Even Feng Wu, who had always been confident, hesitated.","“Sister...” Feng Xiaoqi mumbled. “He’s terrifying, but I still have to say it...’","“What?”","“I like Brother-in-law Jun more.” Feng Xiaoqi dashed off after that.","Feng Wu asked, “Where are you going?”","Feng Xiaoqi said, “My master is calling me. I’m going to cultivate with him.”","However, as soon as Feng Xiaoqi stepped onto the wall, he fell to the ground with a thump, which almost brought tears to his eyes.","How was that even possible?! Although Feng Xiaoqi wasn’t as capable as his sister, he had been making rapid progress. He was already a Spiritual Lord! How could he not climb over the wall?!","Feng Xiaoqi felt that someone had been tugging at his foot.","He turned around involuntarily and looked at the teenager, who was basking in the sun.","The teenager smiled at him.","That was such a scary smile! Before Feng Xiaoqi knew it, he was going to jump onto the wall and run away again. However, the teenager in blue waved at him.","“Come here. Let’s have a nice chat.”","What was there to talk about? Feng Xiaoqi wanted to run away, but an invisible hand seemed to grab him by the back of his collar.","Whoosh..","Feng Xiaoqi felt as if he was a kite that had been taken back... He flew backward and landed in front of the teenager with a thump.","Feng Xiaoqi cried out in pain.","Feng Wu was studying the potion Luo Zilin gave her, so she only asked, “Xiaoqi, what happened?”","Feng Wu didn’t think anything serious would happen in her own courtyard. Feng Xiaoqi was going to tell on Feng Wu, but when he saw the teenager’s evil","smile, he swallowed back his words and said gingerly, “Sister, I’m fine...” The teenager rubbed Feng Xiaoqi’s head. “Good boy.”","The hair on Feng Xiaoqi’s back stood up and he tensed up like a nervous hedgehog.."]},{"number":4086,"title":"Chapter 4086: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4086: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Why are you so nervous?” Luo Zilin patted Feng Xiaoqi on the head as if he were patting an adorable puppy.","Feng Xiaoqi was on the alert.","“I just wanted to talk to you. Relax.” Luo Zilin pointed at the stool in front of him. “Sit.”","Feng Xiaoqi didn’t want to sit there at all. All he wanted to do was run.","However, Luo Zilin was too powerful for Feng Xiaoqi to handle. With a raise of his brow, Feng Xiaoqi had no choice but to sit down on the stool in front of him. Resting his hands on his knees, he looked both nervous and obedient.","Feng Wu had no idea what Luo Zilin and Feng Xiaoqi were talking about, for all her attention was on the potion in her hand.","Feng Wu had tested the potion and found that it was the right medicine.","Feng Wu looked up through the open window and gave Luo Zilin a suspicious look. This man was quite mysterious.","However, Feng Wu didn’t have time for that. Her top priority now was to save her mother.","Feng Wu squirted the potion under Lady Xuanji’s nose, and the medicine was put to use. However, she couldn’t tell what effect it had at the moment.","Feng Wu kept an eye on Lady Xuanji for a while. When she checked her pulse again, she was amazed to find that the beautiful lady’s pulse was indeed better than before!","It wasn’t obvious, but Feng Wu could feel it by checking her mother’s pulse.","Feng Wu left the room to find Luo Zilin giving Feng Xiaoqi instructions on his cultivation.","She frowned a little. Xiaoqi couldn’t just take instruction from a random person. If something went wrong...","However, Feng Wu was about to say something when she saw that Feng Xiaoqi was making a breakthrough.","His cultivation level was rising.","Feng Wu didn’t want to disturb Feng Xiaoqi, who was still making a breakthrough, so she could only glare at Luo Zilin.","Luo Zilin casually walked up to Feng Wu and stood next to her.","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t speak, Luo Zilin nudged her with his elbow, but he still raised his chin a little.","Feng Wu still didn’t say anything.","Luo Zilin nudged her again. “Hey, that medicine is working, isn’t it?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Luo Zilin asked, “Did I help you, then?”","Feng Wu said, “We’ll have to see how effective it is later.”","Luo Zilin snorted. “I’m sure it’ll work. Trust me.”","Feng Wu didn’t reply. Instead, she kept her gaze on Feng Xiaoqi. Right now, Feng Xiaoqi was at the critical moment of his breakthrough. Instead of sitting on the ground and cultivating, he was practicing each stance.","Luo Zilin gloated. “Do you think his stances are very compatible with his spiritual essence?”","Feng Wu didn’t nod, but she had a feeling that the stances were tailor-made for Xiaoqi and suited him perfectly.","“It’s a unique skill of the Luo family. I don’t teach it to just anyone,” Luo Zilin said proudly.","Feng Wu asked, “How did you teach him, then?”","Luo Zilin opened his fan. “Well, he’s my relative, and he has a rare Ultimate Spiritual Body. It’ll be a great honor to teach him. You know what? Only three people in the Luo family have learned it.”","Feng Wu stared at him.","Luo Zilin went on. “That’s my grandfather, my dad, and I. Now you know how much you owe me, don’t you?”","Feng Wu snapped. “Why should I believe you?”","Luo Zilin said, “You have to believe me..”"]},{"number":4087,"title":"Chapter 4087: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4087: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu threw a dirty look at him and ignored him. All her attention was on Feng Xiaoqi.","However, she had to admit that Luo Zilin’s cultivation technique was indeed very suitable for Xiaoqi. Just then, Xiaoqi had made two breakthroughs in a row and was already a peak Level-9 Spiritual Lord.","He was making breakthroughs so fast that it wouldn’t be long before he reached the Spiritual Overlord stage. Only a handful of people in the history of the Junwu Empire had reached that level at such a young age.","Luo Zilin’s arrival stirred Feng Wu’s peaceful life a little.","The continent was very calm, and it reminded one of the calmness before a storm.","During this period of time, Feng Wu went to see Duan Chaoge, as well as Feng Xun and Xuan Yi. She shared the cultivation techniques she had obtained from her third senior brother and the resources she had obtained from the","Dongsang Kingdom with them so that they could use the time to cultivate.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu went to the armory of the Junwu Empire and put in all the weapons she had obtained from the Dongsang Kingdom. She also gave them a new set of forging drawings.","While the general was thrilled, Feng Wu was smiling bitterly inwardly.","The weapons would work on the soldiers of the Dongsang Kingdom, but they wouldn’t be of much use when it came to the Dayan Empire.","However, the battlefield of the advanced cultivators required the participation of the advanced cultivators.","Feng Wu was making her breakthrough as well.","She was a Level-3 Spiritual Saint and still had a long way to go before she reached the peak of this continent. Therefore, she spared no effort in her cultivation. To her surprise...","Luo Zilin didn’t like her cultivation level at all.","“You’re only a Level-3 Spiritual Saint now? What’s wrong with you? You’re so weak!” Luo Zilin gave Feng Wu a contemptuous look. He flapped his fan and clicked his tongue. “You’re unbelievably weak!”","Feng Wu wanted to punch him in the face.","Resting her hands on her waist, she was speechless. “Weak? How? I’m a Level-3 Spiritual Saint! Where are you going to find a genius cultivator like me?!”","“Tsk, tsk. You call yourself a genius cultivator with that little capability? If someone like you is a genius, what am I? The most handsome genius?” Luo Zilin gloated.","Feng Wu snorted and wasn’t going to talk to him.","Luo Zilin knew when to stop. “Fine, fine. I’ll admit that you’re a genius, alright?”","Feng Wu snorted. “I don’t need your recognition.”","Luo Zilin said, “I’ve been traveling this continent for the past year, and you’re indeed the most talented cultivator on this continent. Are you happy now? Feng Wu glanced at him. “I’m not the most talented one on this continent. We have Jun Linyuan, and no one can be his match.”","Luo Zilin looked at Feng Wu. “I’ve heard that name before, but I’ve never met him. If I have the chance...”","“What are you going to do if you get to see him?” Feng Wu asked casually.","Luo Zilin chuckled. “If I get to meet him one day, I’ll show you that even Jun","Linyuan is nothing special. I’m the most talented one.”","Feng Wu clicked her tongue. “You’re such a braggart.”","Luo Zilin said, “Go fetch that Jun Linyuan. I’ll teach you a lesson.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “That’s all you can brag about when Jun Linyuan is in seclusion. You can say that when he comes out.”","Luo Zilin looked sorry. “Has he gone into seclusion? What a pity..”"]},{"number":4088,"title":"Chapter 4088: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4088: The Young Lord of the Dayan Empire (9)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu didn’t believe him at all!","“Hey, what did you say about your continent? Aren’t you from our continent?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","Luo Zilin flapped his fan but wouldn’t answer.","Feng Wu nudged him. “Hey, I’m talking to you.”","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu. “Cultivate instead of talking.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m a Level-3 Spiritual Saint...’","Luo Zilin said, “You can’t be proud just because you’re a Level-3 Spiritual Saint. In my family, a Level-3 Spiritual Saint is only a beginner. Even my younger brother is better than you.”","Feng Wu said, “You’re bragging!”","Luo Zilin said, “You’ll see. You need to start cultivating now! I’ll make you a Level-5 Spiritual Saint. That’s my goal.”","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t believe him. She stuck out her tongue at him, indicating that she didn’t trust him at all.","Luo Zilin was so angry that he laughed. “You don’t believe me, do you? Fine. Sit down. I’ll direct your spiritual essence. I’m sure I can activate your talent.","“Sit down,” Luo Zilin said solemnly.","Somehow, Feng Wu felt that there was something very authoritative about Luo Zilin. It was his cultivation level, which reminded her of the intimidating energy her third senior brother gave off.","How capable was Luo Zilin? Feng Wu wondered.","In the end, Feng Wu did as she was told.","Feng Wu didn’t know what was wrong with her. Although she had been talking back to Luo Zilin all the time, at the critical moment, she had a feeling that Luo Zilin was trustwonrthy.","To Feng Wu’s surprise...","After Luo Zilin directed her spiritual essence around her system, she suddenly felt the spiritual essence inside her turn hotter and hotter...","A few days later, Feng Wu opened her eyes again. They were so clear that they looked like they had been washed with ice water.","She stared at Luo Zilin in disbelief.","How was that even possible?!","All Luo Zilin did was direct her spiritual essence through one cycle, and she was able to activate an unknown spiritual source. After that, she followed Luo Zilin’s instructions and cultivated. Before she knew it, she was a Level-5 Spiritual Saint.","Going from Level 3 to Level 5 should be an extremely difficult process. Countless capable cultivators would be stuck here and would have to cultivate step by step. Some wouldn’t even be able to make any progress.","But she had made two breakthroughs in a row.","The closed palm smacked her on the forehead.","Feng Wu buried her face in her hands and looked resentfully at the man.","“Luo Zilin, why did you hit me?”","Luo Zilin gloated. “You’ve made a breakthrough, haven’t you? You’re a Level-5","Spiritual Saint now, aren’t you? Do you know how awesome I am now? I bet you admire me so much that you want to prostrate yourself in front of me. I’m so much better than Jun Linyuan.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say after that.","But she knew perfectly well how terrifying Luo Zilin was. He could easily make Xiaoqi make a breakthrough and raise her cultivation level by two levels.","Those two levels were the simplest breakthroughs Feng Wu had ever experienced.","Even Feng Wu herself wouldn’t believe it.","However, Feng Wu still wouldn’t admit it. “I admit that you’re very capable, but I don’t think you’re Jun Linyuan’s match..”"]},{"number":4089,"title":"Chapter 4089: Wandering Temple (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4089: Wandering Temple (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin snapped. “He’s your fiance, isn’t he? Why are you so protective of him?”","Feng Wu was confused. ‘Why do you..","She wanted to ask him how he knew, but on second thought, she realized that in the past few days when she was cultivating in seclusion, Luo Zilin would have been able to find out everything if he wanted to.","Feng Wu looked at the Fang Manor next door.","Ever since Luo Zilin arrived, the white fairy had been here once. She met Luo Zilin and went straight back to the Fang Manor, never to be seen again..","Feng Wu knew that Luo Zilin had to be very capable.","Just then, Feng Wu heard a noise.","Wait..","It sounded like a Spiritual Saint making a breakthrough in the direction of the Wandering Temple.","Feng Wu immediately headed for the Wandering Temple.","As soon as Fenq Wu left, Luo Zilin followed her, fanninz himself. Fenz Wu turned around and frowned at him. “I don’t think you should go.”","Luo Zilin said, “Why can’t I? Of course, I have to go.”","Feng Wu was in a hurry to see what was going on in the Wandering Temple, so she didn’t have time to argue with Luo Zilin. She dashed off.","Outside the temple, the little monk spotted Feng Wu. He didn’t have time to inform Feng Wu before Feng Wu rushed in like a gust of wind.","Apart from a low table, two people, and four rush cushions, there was nothing else in the spacious room.","Master Linghu and Feng Xiangnan sat opposite each other. Feng Wu noticed that Master Linghu had been transmitting spiritual essence to Feng Xiangnan. Even after the breakthrough, his cultivation level was still rising.","“Well, that’s interesting.”","Luo Zilin rubbed his chin and smiled.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder.","Luo Zilin said, “I didn’t expect to see such a capable cultivator in a small place like yours. It’s so dangerous.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Do you mean Master Linghu?”","Luo Zilin asked, “Who else is there? Do you know what level he is?”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What level is he?”","Luo Zilin chuckled. “Are you curious?”","Feng Wu said, “Tell me or don’t.”","Luo Zilin said, “I won’t tell you, then.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Luo Zilin said, “Fine, I’ll tell you. He’s more capable than a Spiritual Saint. Do you see it now? But he can’t leave this city.”","Feng Wu looked curiously at him again.","Feng Wu knew that Master Linghu couldn’t leave the city because he had mentioned it to her before. But how did Luo Zilin know? He had only met Master Linghu for the first time, hadn’t he?","Seeing that Feng Wu was curious, Luo Zilin asked, “Do you want to know?”","Feng Wu said, “You’re not going to tell me.”","Luo Zilin rubbed Feng Wu’s head and smiled. “You’re such a goad. That’s quick.”","Feng Wu moved away from him and cast a stern look at him. “If you have something to say, say it. I don’t know you that well.”","Luo Zilin wasn’t offended. He flapped his fan and said cheerfully, “Do you want to know me better? Let me stay with you. We’ll get to know each other better after some time.”","Feng Wu was about to retort when she heard some noise up ahead. To her surprise...","Feng Xiangnan had made another breakthrough!","He had made another breakthrough!","Feng Wu was so surprised that her eyes popped... How was that possible?"]},{"number":4090,"title":"Chapter 4090: The Wandering Temple (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4090: The Wandering Temple (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Her godfather had been stuck at a bottleneck, which was almost impossible to break. He had finally made a breakthrough, but now, he had made two breakthroughs in a row! That was unbelievable!","“What level is he now?” Feng Wu was curious.","Luo Zilln told her, “He’s a peak spiritual saint now.”","Feng Wu looked back at him in amazement. “A peak Spiritual Saint? You’re not lying to me?!”","Feng Wu remembered that the last time her godfather fought Xue Zhibei, he was only an intermediate Spiritual Saint. Back then, he was only slightly weaker than Xue Zhibei. How long had it been since then, and he was already a peak Spiritual Saint?!","Luo Zilin said, “It was all thanks to that old man that he was able to make a breakthrough.","“It’s not that easy, because the old man’s cultivation level will be depleted. Therefore, only a few people are willing to do it. Of course, only a handful of people are qualified to do it. That’s because only those who have surpassed the Spiritual Saint stage can have this kind of energy.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “I’ve been hearing you talk about surpassing the","Spiritual Saint stage. What’s that?”","Luo Zilin said, “He’s a Spiritual Sovereign. They’re very rare even in the Dayan Empire. I didn’t expect to find one here. How special.”","Feng Wu thought, “What’s so special about that? He’s my fifth senior brother!”","While Feng Wu and Luo Zilin were talking, Feng Xiangnan finally stopped cultivating and slowly opened his eyes. The first person he saw was Master Linghu.","However, Master Linghu had his back to Feng Xiangnan, so Feng Xiangnan didn’t see the sweat on his forehead.","“Master...” Feng Xiangnan was about to say something when Master Linghu cut him off and shook his head.","“Finish absorbing the spiritual essence first,” said Master Linghu.","Feng Xiangnan nodded repeatedly, fought back his excitement, and resumed his cultivation.","Master Linghu said to Feng Wu, “Kiddo, come here.” Feng Wu quickly walked up to Master Linghu.","“Sit down.”","Feng Wu nodded and sat down obediently.","Master Linghu’s eyes lit up when he looked at Feng Wu. “Your capability..","It had never occurred to Master Linghu that Feng Wu would become a Level-5 Spiritual Saint again.","“That’s all thanks to me. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to make a breakthrough.” Luo Zilin raised an eyebrow.","Master Linghu looked at him.","Feng Wu noticed that the look on the old man’s face had turned grimmer and sterner. However, he soon resumed his haughty demeanor.","“Sir, are you from the other side of the sea?” Master Linghu asked directly.","Anyone else would have behaved in a restrained manner in front of Master Linghu. Even Feng Xiangnan, the general, was very respectful toward Master Linghu.","Luo Zilin, on the other hand, felt that Master Linghu was his equal. Feng Wu didn’t know if she was mistaken, but she felt that way.","Master Linghu gestured at him to sit down.","Luo Zilin sat down on the rush cushion next to Feng Wu and smiled at Master Linghu. “Does it matter where I’m from?” He didn’t deny it!","Feng Wu stared at him in surprise.."]},{"number":4091,"title":"Chapter 4091: Wandering Temple (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4091: Wandering Temple (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu stared at him in surprise.","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu and raised an eyebrow in satisfaction, but Feng Wu was confused. “Are you really from the Dayan Empire? Are you telling the truth?”","Luo Zilin rolled his eyes. “Young lady, how many times have I told you? Do you still think I’m a liar?”","Feng Wu hesitated and glared at him again. “What’s wrong? I was just wondering. Do people from the Dayan Empire come so easily nowadays? Isn’t it very far away from here, and there’s a restriction on it? It’s not very likely that they’ll come this way.”","Luo Zilin jabbed a finger into Feng Wu’s forehead, and Feng Wu stumbled back.","“Speak. Don’t touch me.”","Master Linghu smiled at them.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Which force are you from? Which family or clan?”","Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu and raised an eyebrow. “Do you know what forces and families are there in the Dayan Empire?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Luo Zilin flapped his fan and said proudly, “There’s no point telling you. You’ll never know how capable my family is.”","Feng Wu snorted. “Is it as impressive as Lord Yan’s residence? Yan Yu and Yan Ling are quite capable if you ask me.”","Luo Zilin gave Feng Wu a strange look.","Feng Wu asked, “Why are you looking at me like that?”","Luo Zilin said, “Yan Yu is one thing, but you call Yan Ling talented? Someone like her? At her age, she can’t even get into the Spiritual Saint stage. She has no talent. Even a cripple like you is a hundred times better than her.”","At her age... Feng Wu was speechless. “She didn’t look like she was twenty yet.”","Luo Zilin said, “Nineteen.’","Feng Wu was speechless again. “Nineteen isn’t old at all.”","Luo Zilin asked Feng Wu, “What about you?”","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Luo Zilin said, “Back in my hometown if a core member of a major clan hasn’t reached the Spiritual Saint stage, they’re useless. Yan Ling is just too useless.","That’s why she’s here.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“Master Linghu should know about this, right?” Luo Zilin looked up at Master Linghu.","Feng Wu looked at Master Linghu in bewilderment. Master Linghu nodded. “That’s true. It’s indeed the case in the Dayan Empire.” Feng Wu asked curiously, “Have you been there before?”","After some hesitation, Master Linghu nodded. “I did live there for a while when","I was younger. Young Master Luo, are you from the Luo family?”","Luo Zilin raised his eyebrows. “Master Linghu, I didn’t know you knew about the Luo family.”","Master Linghu chuckled. “Does anyone in the Dayan Empire know doesn’t who the Luo family is?”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Is the Luo family famous?”","Master Linghu nodded but didn’t say anything. However, when he looked up again, he stared at Luo Zilin for a while before saying to Feng Wu, “You can leave now.”","Was it something she couldn’t hear? Feng Wu was perplexed, but she had to leave the room for the time being.","Five minutes later, Luo Zilin came out.","Feng Wu stared at him. “What did Master Linghu tell you?”","Luo Zilin opened his fan. “I can’t let you know.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you going to tell me or not?”","Luo Zilin grinned. “Why don’t you call me ‘Brother’? I’ll tell you what it is.”","Feng Wu had heard that request before.","“No.” Feng Wu had her principles.."]},{"number":4092,"title":"Chapter 4092: Birthday Party (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4092: Birthday Party (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin looked at Feng Wu affectionately and rubbed her head. “Kiddo...”","Feng Wu dodged and warned him. “Don’t call me that, and don’t touch my hair.” Luo Zilin shrugged, but he wasn’t sure if he would do it again.","“Master Linghu is a very capable cultivator,” said Luo Zilin all of a sudden.","Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised. “What kind of master is he? Is he even more capable than Yan Yu?”","Luo Zilin said, “Yan Yu? Heh.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that supposed to mean? Is that a yes or a no?”","Luo Zilin went on trying to leave her hanging. “You’ll see.”","Feng Wu snorted and ignored him, for at that moment, General Feng walked out.","“Father, are you a Level 9 now?” Feng Wu went up to him with a big smile on her face.","Feng Xiangnan was elated to see Feng Wu as well. He laughed and rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Hahaha! You’re my lucky star. Thanks to you, I made this breakthrough.","“But you’re already a Level-5 Spiritual Saint in such a short time. You’re such a genius.” Feng Xiangnan rubbed Feng Wu’s head again with a gentle look in his eyes.","Luo Zilin was displeased. Why could this man rub Xiao Wu’s head, but not him? The teenager’s face darkened.","Feng Wu ignored Luo Zilin’s displeasure and said happily to Feng Xiangnan, “Yan Yu, the prince of the Dayan Empire, has arrived at the Dongsang Kingdom with a large group of capable cultivators. Father, I’m so glad that you’ve reached Level 9 of the Spiritual Saint stage. Otherwise, the Junwu Empire would be in danger!”","“Prince Yan Yu? Who’s that?” Feng Xiangnan didn’t know that.","Hence, Feng Wu told Feng Xiangnan what she saw in the Dongsang Kingdom, which made Feng Xiangnan’s mouth fall open. He cried out in surprise, “So, you’re the culprit behind everything that happened in the Dongsang Kingdom! I was wondering how the Dongsang Kingdom could have gone through so much. No wonder... I should have guessed it, but you...”","Luo Zilin was surprised as well.","He had already overestimated Feng Wu, but he didn’t expect her to be so much smarter than he had expected. To the Dayan Empire, this was only a small border area.","“I’m going to see His Majesty, then to the Peace Grassland. Protect yourself and don’t go anywhere else. Got it?” Feng Xiangnan told Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew how much responsibility her godfather had to take, so she nodded immediately.","Feng Xiangnan soon left.","As soon as he left, Feng Wu heard someone clicking their tongues.","Feng Wu turned around and glanced at Luo Zilin in resignation. “What are vou","doing? What’s that look in your eyes? Why do I feel that you’re jealous?”","Luo Zilin snorted. “Why can he do that to you, but I can’t?”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Because he’s my senior.”","Luo Zilin said, “I’m your brother.”","Feng Wu said, “Heh.” She wouldn’t believe it.","Luo Zilin snorted. “Suit yourself. You’ll believe me one day. When that happens, you’ll want to follow me around and call me your brother.”","Feng Wu snorted again. “I’ll wait for that day..”"]},{"number":4093,"title":"Chapter 4093: Birthday Party (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4093: Birthday Party (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin said, “Sure. But I didn’t know you were so bold. How could you do such a thing? Do you know who’s behind little Yan Ling?”","“Little Yan Ling?” Feng Wu found a loophole in Luo Zilin’s words. She narrowed her eyes and gave him a sidelong glance. “Why do I get the feeling that you’re very close to Princess Yan Ling?”","Luo Zilin denied it. “What do you mean? She wants to be on friendly terms with me, but I won’t have anything to do with her.” Feng Wu glanced at him.","Luo Zilin asked, “You don’t believe me?” Feng Wu nodded.","Luo Zilin said, “You’ll believe me one day.”","In the imperial palace, Emperor Wu fell ill because he was worried about the threat from the empire.","Empress Dugu told the empress dowager what had happened.","“The emperor is sick?” The empress dowager panicked when she heard the news. “He’s in such good health. How can he be sick? Since when?”","Empress Dugu stammered at first, but in the end, she told the empress dowager, “I don’t know what Feng Wu said to His Majesty after she came to the imperial palace, but His Majesty has been a little unstable since then. He’s been depressed these days, and gradually, he’s not feeling well...’","The empress dowager’s face darkened. “It’s her? Why is it her again? Hasn’t she disappeared for a while? Why is she back? I knew it! Nothing good will come out of her! ”","The more she thought about it, the angrier the empress dowager became. She smacked the table and said, “Junjun came back with her last time, but Junjun disappeared afterward, and I couldn’t even see him. She’s even closer to Junjun than I am!”","Empress Dugu was secretly elated to see the indignant look on the empress dowager’s face, but she didn’t let it show. “...Maybe His Royal Highness is in seclusion.”","The empress dowager said angrily, “He’s in seclusion again?! Even if he is, can’t he just send someone to tell me? Moreover, why do I feel that Junjun has something to do with the emperor’s illness?","“Has something happened to Junjun?!” The empress dowager’s imagination ran wild. At that thought, she couldn’t sit still anymore and ran out of the room.","Empress Dugu immediately followed her.","The maids and grannies quickly followed her as well.","In the emperor’s bedchamber.","“Your Majesty!” Seeing that Emperor Wu was struggling to his feet, the empress dowager rushed over to stop him.","“How’s the emperor doing?” the empress dowager asked Master Chu.","Master Chu immediately said that His Majesty was alright and was only worried too much.","The empress dowager stared at Emperor Wu. “Worries? What happened?”","Emperor Wu waved his hand with a wry smile. What was it? That would be a very big deal, but telling them would only create more trouble and panic, so he decided not to tell them.","Ever since Feng Wu told him about the Dayan Empire, Emperor Wu had been writing letters to the neighboring countries for help. Since they were all from the same continent, they should work together to fight against the invasion of the other continent.","However, the letters he received all turned him down.","Emperor Wu was filled with despair.","Was the Junwu Empire going to be destroyed?","Meanwhile, the empress dowager was still speculating.."]},{"number":4094,"title":"Chapter 4094: Birthday Party (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4094: Birthday Party (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, the empress dowager said, “Are you overthinking it because of what","Feng Wu said? Is something wrong with Junjun? Tell me!”","Emperor Wu waved her off. “It has nothing to do with the crown prince.”","The empress dowager said angrily, “If it’s not about Junjun, what is it? Why are you so disturbed? Is Feng Wu in trouble? Didn’t she go to the Dongsang Kingdom? Is she in trouble?”","Emperor Wu frowned. “Mother, how did you know that?”","The empress dowager smirked. “I don’t care about worldly affairs. Do you really think I’m deaf? Someone will tell me what’s going on outside.”","The empress dowager darted an indifferent glance at the empress as she spoke.","Of course, Emperor Wu saw it. The empress must have told the empress dowager something to make her speculate.","Emperor Wu recalled how Feng Wu had single-handedly infiltrated the","Dongsang Kingdom at the risk of her own life and disturbed the peace there. She had single-handedly tricked the Dongsang Emperor, Night Owl, Lord Jing, and Princess Yan Ling.","The girl was a great contributor. Not only couldn’t Emperor Wu publicly reward her, but someone had also slandered her!","Emperor Wu’s face darkened.","“Your Majesty...” The empress dowager’s stomach lurched when she saw the look on Emperor Wu’s face.","Rubbing his forehead, the Junwu Empire said to the empress dowager,","“Mother, please go pack your things.”","The empress dowager said, “What?”","Emperor Wu said, “Mother, I think you should go to Mount Qintai and stay in the temple for the time being.”","The empress dowager stared at Emperor Wu in astonishment.","What the hell?","It was December and New Year’s Eve was only a few days away. No one would go out in the middle of the night like that.","“Has he lost his mind?” The empress dowager wanted to check the temperature of Emperor Wu’s forehead, but Emperor Wu only said solemnly, “Mother, if you really want to help me, go to Mount Qintai and live there.”","Maybe... she could still live.","Emperor Wu was filled with despair.","The Junwu Empire had always been on friendly terms with the Nanling Empire. Therefore, Emperor Wu had high hopes that the kingdom would take in a few people, but they turned him down.","Therefore, Emperor Wu had to send the empress dowager to Qintai Mountain.","“Your Majesty!” Seeing how stubborn Emperor Wu was, the empress dowager was a little angry. Her son had never disobeyed her, but now, nothing she said would work!","“The empress dowager isn’t the only one going. Dugu, you’re going as well. Take Linshen with you.” Emperor Wu told the empress.","That way, at least one more member of the royal family would be alive.","Empress Dugu frowned. “Your Majesty, has something happened? Why are you so...”","Emperor Wu took a deep breath and suddenly had a shortness of breath. He coughed so hard that he thought his lungs were going to fall out.","“Your Majesty...” Empress Dugu rushed to his side.","Emperor Wu waved his hand. He knew that they wouldn’t go if he didn’t tell them. Even if they did, they might not survive. At that thought, he straightened his face and told Master Chu, “Give Her Majesty the empress dowager a quick-acting pill.”","Was it that serious? The empress dowager shuddered. Had something really happened to her Junjun?","Emperor Wu only told them what was going to happen after the empress dowager took the pill.","“The Junwu Empire may not survive this.” It took Emperor Wu a lot of courage to say those words.."]},{"number":4095,"title":"Chapter 4095: Birthday Party (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Wait. What do you mean by that?” Empress Dugu was the first to react.","The empress dowager chimed in. “That’s right. Explain yourself. What do you mean by losing the Junwu Empire?”","Tears welled up in Emperor Wu’s eyes.","The empress dowager was even more anxious. She tugged at Emperor Wu. “Tell me!”","Empress Dugu also stared at Emperor Wu anxiously.","Since he had said the most difficult part, Emperor Wu could finish the rest in a much smoother voice.","“The Dongsang Kingdom is under the control of the Dayan Empire, and they’re going to attack the Junwu Empire. I think the empire is going to be destroyed.”","“Bullshit!” The empress dowager was so angry that she wanted to smack Emperor Wu in the head. “That’s bullshit!”","Emperor Wu smiled bitterly. “Mother, I want to make it up, but it’s the truth from the Dongsang Kingdom, and it can’t be fake. That’s why I’ve decided to let you take shelter in Qintai Mountain. After all, there’s...”","“From the Dongsang Kingdom? Who sent it?” the empress dowager asked aggressively.","Empress Dugu suddenly realized something and pointed at Emperor Wu. “Is it","Feng Wu? Hasn’t she just come back from the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Hearing that, the empress dowager was even angrier.","I think you’ve fallen ill because of what she said. Bring Feng Wu here!”","A servant of the empress dowager stepped out.","“Bring Feng Wu to the imperial palace! How dare she spread such rumors? She’s unbelievable! I won’t forgive her!”","The guard hesitated.","Apart from the empress dowager, everyone knew how highly Emperor Wu and Jun Linyuan thought of Feng Wu.","Emperor Wu almost jumped out of bed, but before he could stop her, he started coughing violently.","The empress dowager’s heart went out to Emperor Wu when she saw that he was coughing so violently. She immediately went up to him and cried, ‘Master Chu! Master Chu!”","“Mother, please don’t disrespect Feng Wu...” When Emperor Wu finally stopped coughing, he grabbed the empress dowager’s hand. “No!”","The empress dowager threw a dirty look at Emperor Wu and said angrily, “I won’t forgive her!”","Emperor Wu was so angry that he coughed again. “She didn’t spread the rumor. That girl has done us a great favor!”","As for what Feng Wu did in the Dongsang Kingdom, Emperor Wu wouldn’t go into detail. After all, Feng Wu had done some mysterious things, and there were too many people in the palace. If word got out, it wouldn’t do Feng Wu any good.","Therefore, when the empress dowager asked what Feng Wu did in the Dongsang Kingdom, Emperor Wu didn’t elaborate. He only said, “That girl has contributed greatly to the empire. Mother, please don’t mistreat her. Otherwise...","He thought, “Otherwise if you offend the girl, she may try to do something to you... I may not be able to stop her.”","But the empress dowager wouldn’t listen. To her, Feng Wu was the worst!","Since the emperor wouldn’t let her summon Feng Wu to court, she would leave the imperial palace to see herself. Satisfied?","Emperor Wu was exhausted. After he fell asleep after taking the calming medicine, the empress dowager led Granny Lan and the others out of the palace and headed for the Feng manor.."]},{"number":4096,"title":"Chapter 4096: Birthday Party (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After hearing that the empress dowager had left the imperial palace, the empress immediately sent someone to the Dugu family to invite her sister- in-law here.","She knew perfectly well that the Dugu family was connected to the Dayan Empire.","When Princess Yan Ling of the Dayan Empire came to the Junwu Empire, the Dugu family had secretly switched sides. Of course, only a handful of people knew about it, even the younger generation wasn’t aware.","Emperor Wu was kept in the dark.","The empress dowager was on the move.","She was traveling in a carriage.","Granny Lan and Granny Gui had been with the empress dowager for a long time, and Granny Lan had always liked Feng Wu. However, Granny Gui was close to Empress Dugu, so it was obvious that she was hostile toward Feng Wu.","The empress dowager kept a straight face and wouldn’t say a word. The air she gave off made everyone shiver. Granny Lan said, “Your Majesty, actually, Feng Wu...’","The empress dowager glared at her.","Granny Lan couldn’t utter a word.","Granny Gui smirked inwardly. That stupid Granny Lan had no idea how angry the empress dowager was. She was still trying to defend Feng Wu.","Granny Gui whispered, “Your Majesty, shall we take Feng Wu and leave as soon as we get there, or shall we...”","The empress dowager glanced at her, but it was obvious that the look in her eyes softened a little.","But the empress dowager still didn’t say anything.","Granny Gui whispered again, “Everyone says that Feng Wu is a fast cultivator. I wonder what level she has reached. What if she’s already very capable...”","The empress dowager snorted.","“Very capable? How capable can she be?","“Have you forgotten? She only started cultivating again two years ago. How far can she go in those two years? What did she give you? Why do you think so highly of her?!”","Granny Gui didn’t dare to utter a word...","She had given the empress dowager a hint before she left the imperial palace because she had more information than the old lady and knew that Feng Wu was at least a Spiritual Saint.","However, the empress dowager had brought Nameless, her most capable secret guard, with her.","Nameless had been protecting the empress dowager in secret and was a Level-I Spiritual Saint. That should be enough.","Granny Lan spoke in the end.","She then turned to the empress dowager, looking concerned. “Your Majesty, it’s New Year’s Eve and Feng Wu’s birthday. Even if it’s for His Royal Highness’s own good.. ‘","The empress dowager glared at Granny Lan. “Why should I depend on her when","I have Junjun? Are you working for her or me?!”","Granny Lan immediately knelt down and sighed inwardly. “Of course, I’m Your Majesty’s servant.”","The empress dowager snorted. “Shut up! Granny Gui!”","“Yes, Your Majesty.” Granny Gui immediately knelt down.","The empress dowager threw a dirty look at Granny Lan and said to Granny Gui,","“From now on, you’re going to be the maid in charge of Cining Palace!”","Granny Lan used to be in charge, while Granny Gui was the deputy one. After all these years, Granny Gui had done everything she could to get that position, but now, it had come so easily.","Granny Gui immediately came back to herself and kowtowed to the empress dowager. “Thank you, Your Majesty...”","The empress dowager gave Granny Lan a sidelong glance.. “I only want loyal people!”"]},{"number":4097,"title":"Chapter 4097: Birthday Party (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4097: Birthday Party (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They rushed to the Feng manor.","Since it was New Year’s Eve and Feng Wu was back, the Feng clan was quite busy.","Feng Yanfeng and his wife had offended Feng Wu a lot. Ever since the incident with the Hua clan, Feng Yanfeng’s family had stopped holding grudges against Feng Wu and had been fawning on the Fallen Star Yard.","Knowing that Feng Wu had come back, coupled with the fact that it was New Year’s Eve and Feng Wu’s birthday, Feng Yanfeng and his wife decided to throw a birthday party for Feng Wu.","Feng Yanfeng had invited a lot of his colleagues and all the families that had connections with the Feng clan.","Lord Mu, Lady Northern Feng, the Yan family...","Lady Wang had invited all the noble ladies and young ladies of the imperial capital as well.","The birthday banquet was held at noon, for everyone had to go back home for New Year’s Eve. They couldn’t have held it on New Year’s Eve, but Feng Wu was born on that day, and they couldn’t change the date.","They only came to tell Feng Wu after they invited her to a banquet and set up the table. It was supposed to be a pleasant surprise.","Feng Wu looked at Lady Wang in bewilderment. “A pleasant surprise?”","Lady Wang and Feng Sang arrived together and both told Feng Wu about it in excitement. Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","Seeing Feng Wu’s reaction, Lady Wang looked hurt, “Xiao Wu, aren’t you happy?","Feng Sang also looked nervously at Feng Wu.","After the incident with the Hua clan last time, the behavior of the first branch of the Feng family had indeed changed. They were respectful and friendly toward Feng Wu and no longer dared to try anything behind her back.","They were only doing it out of kindness. They didn’t want to give Feng Wu any trouble.","“Xiao Wu, are you still not going to forgive us?” Feng Sang sounded nervous.","Lady Wang nodded nervously as well. “We’ve been so mean to you and we feel so guilty. That’s why we’re hosting a banquet today. We want them to know that the head of the Feng family is a very kind person...”","Last time, the elders of the Feng clan had made Feng Wu the head of the clan, and no one objected.","Fearing that Feng Wu would be offended, Feng Sang said gingerly, “If you really don’t like it... I don’t mind if you stay here. We can entertain the guests...” Feng Wu rubbed her temple. Just then, she heard a voice behind her.","“Xiao Wu?”","Feng Wu turned around and was pleasantly surprised to see her mother!","“Mum, you’re awake!”","Luo Zilin’s medicine was effective, but Feng Wu didn’t expect it to be so effective. It only took the beautiful lady a few days to wake up.","The beautiful lady nodded and smiled at Feng Wu. “Your uncle and aunt took care of Fallen Star Yard when you weren’t around. You should show up in the front hall. Go now. I need to talk to you when you get back.”","The beautiful lady had only just woken up, and Feng Wu wanted to snuggle in her arms. She didn’t want to go to the front hall to keep their guests company.","However, since the beautiful lady had said so, Feng Wu had no choice but to nod. “Alright. I’ll only stay there for a moment.”","The beautiful lady nodded implicitly.","Somehow, Feng Wu felt that the beautiful lady seemed to have changed after she woke up this time... Time was of the essence here, and she didn’t have time to figure it out. She had to come back and ask more questions.","Feng Wu turned to Lady Wang as she walked away. “Don’t go through all that trouble again. I don’t like such a grand celebration..”"]},{"number":4098,"title":"Chapter 4098: Birthday Party (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4098: Birthday Party (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Wang had been so sure that Feng Wu wouldn’t go, but now that she knew that Feng Wu was willing to go, she didn’t dare to say another word. She immediately said, “Yes, of course. Whatever you say.”","Feng Wu only found out when she got to the banquet hall that Lady Wang was throwing a big party.","All the major clans in the imperial capital had sent people here. Some were the heads of households, and some were their wives.","Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Chaoge, Duan Chaoge, and Lady Northern Feng were all Feng Wu’s close friends. Apart from them, the Gongshu Family, the Gongshu family, the Dugu family, the Long family, and the Tao family were all here.","Gongsun Qing, Dugu Yamo, and Tao Kexin were all there.","The Zuo family, the Hua family, and the Xuanyuan family were all missing.","Feng Wu had destroyed all three families in one way or another.","The others were reminded of that as well, which was why they were so enthusiastic about Feng Wu when they saw her. They kept praising her for her talent.","Seeing all the guests, Feng Wu thought that if Yan Yu brought the Dayan Empire to the Junwu Empire now, no one here would survive.","Therefore, she couldn’t help but feel sorry for them.","Everyone was confused when they saw the look in Feng WII’s eyes. Who was she pitying? Why was she sighing?","Hasty footsteps came from outside.","The concierge rushed in first.","“Her Majesty the empress dowager is here","Her Majesty the empress dowager? Feng Wu tilted her head and looked at Lady Wang in bewilderment.","Lady Wang was bewildered, but she soon realized what had happened and smiled. “Has someone told Her Majesty that it’s your birthday today, so Her Majesty is here as well? That’s a very big favor...”","Before Lady Wang could finish, the empress dowager and the others filed into the courtyard.","With the empress dowager here, many people dropped to their knees to greet her.","Soon, people were kneeling all over the place.","They had thought that the empress dowager would show them some respect on such a good day, so they would soon stand up. However, to their surprise, the empress dowager walked in just like that and sat down on the highest seat without making a sound.","Not only didn’t she tell them to stand up, but the atmosphere was also very serious.","It was as if the air had frozen, and no one dared to breathe. The atmosphere became very tense.","What was going on?","Many stole glances at the empress dowager, who was sitting at the head of the table with a solemn look on her face.","She stared at Feng Wu with eyes that seemed to spit fire.","As time went by, the anger in her eyes became more and more obvious.","Feng Wu looked at the empress dowager in bewilderment. She couldn’t understand why the empress dowager was suddenly like this. Was she here to ruin things?","Feng Wu looked up at Granny Lan, who shook her head at Feng Wu.","The empress dowager was furious when she saw that Feng Wu was still looking around.","“Feng Wu!” The empress dowager glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was already a capable cultivator at the Spiritual Saint stage, which was beyond the empress dowager’s reach. There was no way that Feng Wu would be restrained by the royal family, not to mention that the empress dowager wasn’t even the emperor.."]},{"number":4099,"title":"Chapter 4099: Birthday Party (8)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Moreover, the empress dowager wasn’t the emperor.","Therefore, Feng Wu remained unperturbed. She only looked at the empress dowager and frowned. “Your Majesty, why are you here today?”","It was as if the empress dowager was an unreasonable old woman, and Feng Wu was a junior who didn’t want to talk to her.","The empress dowager stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. She couldn’t believe that Feng Wu would treat her like this!","She was the empress dowager and the most respected person in the Junwu Empire apart from the emperor.","“You!” The empress dowager pointed at Feng Wu and took a deep breath to suppress her rage. As the empress dowager, she couldn’t behave like a shrew.","However, many people were shocked by Feng Wu’s attitude.","They were here mostly because of the crown prince.","It was rumored that Feng Wu was the crown prince’s future wife, and Emperor Wu had never denied it. Therefore, they all knew that Feng Wu was definitely going to marry the crown prince.","Therefore, all the influential families had been trying to fawn on the Feng clan. This time, Feng Yanfeng invited most of them as guests.","But no one knew that Feng Wu and the empress dowager couldn’t see eye to eye.","The empress dowager stared at Feng Wu and said angrily, “Kneel!”","Spiritual Saints and above naturally had their own pride. Feng Wu couldn’t kneel just like that, not to mention that it was under such circumstances.","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu stood there with her legs apart. She stared at the empress dowager and said calmly, “No.”","NO?","Many people stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu’s friends feared that Feng Wu would get hurt, so they all went to stand behind her.","Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Chaoge, and Duan Chaoge were all behind Feng Wu. They were all looking at the empress dowager as if they were backing Feng Wu up.","Lady Northern Feng felt a headache coming on. She smiled and walked toward the empress dowager. “Your Majesty...”","As soon as she spoke, the empress dowager was furious.","“Isn’t she your goddaughter? Aren’t you going to do something about it?","“If you don’t do anything, I’ll discipline her for you!","“I don’t want her to harm the family that she’s going to marry!”","Lady Northern Feng smiled bitterly. “Your Majesty, actually, Xiao Wu...”","The empress dowager didn’t wait for Lady Northern Feng to finish. Instead,","she stared at Feng Wu and said coldly, “I see that you’ve become very confident.","Is there nothing I can do about it?”","Feng Wu remained unperturbed, but she narrowed her eyes.","She said indifferently, “It’s not easy to host a birthday banquet like this. Your Majesty, there’s no need to ruin it. After all, we don’t know if there’ll be another one like this in the future.”","What was that supposed to mean? Many people couldn’t understand it.","However, the empress dowager obviously understood what Feng Wu meant, which successfully set the empress dowager off again.","The empress dowager smacked the back of her chair, rose to her feet, and pointed at Feng Wu.","“You’re the one who spread the scary rumors and made His Majesty sick with anger. Now, you’re threatening me again. I’m not afraid!","“Granny Gui, take Feng Wu down!”","Granny Gui didn’t have much cultivation ability, but she was the empress dowager’s servant, and Feng Wu wouldn’t dare to defy her!"]},{"number":4100,"title":"Chapter 4100: Birthday Party (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4100: Birthday Party (9)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Gui went to fetch Feng Wu confidently.","Everyone was astonished.","They had figured out that the empress dowager was here for Feng Wu, but they didn’t expect her to be so disrespectful.","They looked at one another in bewilderment.","The lady of the Dugu family lowered her voice. “Is the rumor about Feng Wu being the crown prince’s fiancee a lie?”","Next to Mrs. Dugu were Lady Tao and Mrs. Long. They were all bewildered and had solemn looks on their faces. With their sharp senses, they could tell that something wasn’t right.","Lady Tao said, “I’m afraid there’s a misunderstanding.”","Mrs. Dugu smirked. “Misunderstanding? If that’s the case, Her Majesty the empress dowager wouldn’t be so angry. If you ask me, I think Feng Wu has done something very serious. According to Her Majesty, Feng Wu has made His Majesty sick.”","How could they ignore the emperor’s health? No one dared to speak.","Mrs. Dugu was the only one who looked at Feng Wu with an indescribable twinkle in her eyes.","Granny Gui went up to Feng Wu and smirked. “It’s Her Majesty the empress dowager’s order. Miss Feng Wu, sorry about this.”","After that, Granny Gui reached out to grab Feng Wu.","She then took out a rope, trying to tie Feng Wu up.","“Get lost!” Feng Wu scolded Granny Gui.","“How dare you!” The empress dowager was furious when she saw Feng Wu’s reaction. She shouted, “Granny Gui, slap her!”","Granny Gui sneered at Feng Wu before raising her hand.","Just when Granny Gui was about to hit Feng Wu...","“Stop!”","Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and the others charged at her from behind, but Feng Wu was too quick to react.","Feng Wu struck out before they could reach her.","To be more precise, she kicked.","Thump!","Feng Wu kicked at Granny Gui, and Granny Gui shot out like an arrow and fell at the empress dowager’s feet.","Moreover, she couldn’t help but keep falling back. Panic-stricken, Granny Gui grabbed the empress dowager by the robe.","The empress dowager stumbled. If Granny Lan hadn’t caught her in time, she would have dragged the empress dowager to the ground.","OMG!","Everyone drew in their breaths and stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","How courageous was that?","That was the empress dowager!","The empress dowager was Emperor Wu’s most respected figure, but Feng Wu didn’t show the empress dowager any respect at all. She hit her granny right in front of her.","All the ladies looked at one another in bewilderment. They were genuinely shocked by Feng Wu’s behavior.","They weren’t the only ones.","Even Lady Wang was shocked by Feng Wu’s decisiveness.","Last time, Feng Wu was already an impressive cultivator, but now, she was even more relentless.","But this was the empress dowager...","Lady Wang was so frustrated. Why did she have to throw such a big party? With so many people here, the whole thing would get out... Feng Wu’s reputation would be ruined.."]}]);
